-05 12:59:54.375','','It is observed that you have incorporated and submitted the facts of complaint as an enclosure   too. The facts as contained in Facts of the Case under the tab Complaint Details are different than the facts contained under the tab List of enclosures in support of the complaint. This cannot be allowed. The facts have to be included only under the tab Complaint Details in the specified para for Facts of the case in the given space. The Facts of complaint cannot be included under the tab which meant for supporting documents as enclosures.  Further document  i.e.Brochure Annexure A2 is mentioned containing 22 pages but uploaded only 20 pages. Document A3 old allotment letter  and A8  document part are not legible. Modify complaint and enclosures accordingly and re submit the same within 15 days as per instructions.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-05 12:55:32.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-05 12:55:32.000'),(155,440001,'999','2018-10-06 08:56:09.000',1053,'AdCNo10312018','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-10-06 08:56:09.000','999','2018-10-06 08:56:09.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-10-06 08:56:09.000','sysadmin','2018-10-06 08:56:09.000'),(156,440055,'memberjsk','2018-10-08 10:16:10.000',1039,'AdCNo10202018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2018-10-08 10:20:33.328','','2018-10-08 10:20:33.328','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online. Since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the complainant or his counsel for 12.11.2018 for consideration through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the complainant may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date.\r\n(J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n',2,0,'memberjsk','2018-10-08 10:16:10.000','memberjsk','2018-10-08 10:16:10.000'),(157,440007,'legaladvrera','2018-10-09 10:24:26.000',1047,'AdCNo10242018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-09 10:28:49.703','','2018-10-09 10:28:49.703','','It is observed that you have incorporated and submitted the facts of complaint as an enclosure   too. The facts as contained in Facts of the Case under the tab Complaint Details are different than the facts contained under the tab List of enclosures in support of the complaint. This cannot be allowed. The facts have to be included only under the tab Complaint Details in the specified para for Facts of the case in the given space. The Facts of complaint cannot be included under the tab which meant for supporting documents as enclosures.  Further , enclosure A2 i.e. brochure is having only 20 pages instead of mentioned 22. Enclosure A3  & A8 are not legible. Modify complaint and enclosures accordingly and re submit the same within 15 days as per instructions.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-09 10:24:26.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-09 10:24:26.000'),(158,440058,'exclegalrera','2018-10-09 10:29:07.000',1039,'AdCNo10202018','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-09 10:33:31.016','','2018-10-09 10:33:31.016','','Notice to Complainant to appear on 12.11.2018 at 9.30 AM with the direction to submit hard copies of complaints and documents on the date fixed.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2018-10-09 10:29:07.000','exclegalrera','2018-10-09 10:29:07.000'),(159,440007,'legaladvrera','2018-10-09 10:40:16.000',1050,'AdCNo10262018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-09 10:44:40.047','','2018-10-09 10:44:40.047','','It is observed that you have incorporated and submitted the facts of complaint in enclosures of 17 pages   too. The facts as contained in Facts of the Case under the tab Complaint Details are different than the facts contained under the tab List of enclosures in support of the complaint. This cannot be allowed. The facts have to be included only under the tab Complaint Details in the specified para for Facts of the case in the given space. The Facts of complaint cannot be included under the tab which meant for supporting documents as enclosures. Upload enclosures and authorization separately too.  Modify complaint and enclosures accordingly and re submit the same within 15 days as per instructions.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-09 10:40:16.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-09 10:40:16.000'),(160,440056,'legaladvrera','2018-10-09 11:09:41.000',1049,'AdCNo10272018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-09 11:14:04.750','','2018-10-09 11:14:04.750','','Fee, format and documents checked and found proper. Submitted for kind consideration and directions please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-09 11:09:41.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-09 11:09:41.000'),(161,440056,'legaladvrera','2018-10-09 11:22:12.000',1052,'AdCNo10282018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-09 11:26:36.328','','2018-10-09 11:26:36.328','','Fee, format and documents checked which are in order. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-09 11:22:12.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-09 11:22:12.000'),(162,440056,'legaladvrera','2018-10-09 11:52:49.000',1031,'AdCNo10292018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JS