gh e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n',2,0,'memberjsk','2018-10-17 10:54:25.000','memberjsk','2018-10-17 10:54:25.000'),(175,440001,'999','2018-10-19 14:03:33.000',1060,'AdCNo10332018','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-10-19 14:03:33.000','999','2018-10-19 14:03:33.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-10-19 14:03:33.000','sysadmin','2018-10-19 14:03:33.000'),(176,440001,'999','2018-10-22 14:58:53.000',1059,'AdCNo10342018','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-10-22 14:58:53.000','999','2018-10-22 14:58:53.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-10-22 14:58:53.000','sysadmin','2018-10-22 14:58:53.000'),(177,440001,'999','2018-10-22 18:39:51.000',1061,'AdCNo10352018','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-10-22 18:39:51.000','999','2018-10-22 18:39:51.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-10-22 18:39:51.000','sysadmin','2018-10-22 18:39:51.000'),(178,440001,'999','2018-10-24 19:09:44.000',1063,'AdCNo10362018','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-10-24 19:09:44.000','999','2018-10-24 19:09:44.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-10-24 19:09:44.000','sysadmin','2018-10-24 19:09:44.000'),(179,440007,'legaladvrera','2018-10-25 11:20:27.000',1036,'AdCNo10212018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-25 11:24:58.344','','2018-10-25 11:24:58.344','','Promoter name mentioned in place of Project name. Further, the relief of interest can be sought by filing complaint under Form \'M\'  . Remove the defects and re-submit complaint immediately.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-25 11:20:27.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-25 11:20:27.000'),(180,440007,'legaladvrera','2018-10-25 11:59:22.000',1057,'AdCNo10322018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-25 12:03:53.141','','2018-10-25 12:03:53.141','','Component of Interest can not be sought under Form \'N\' it can be sought under Form \'M\'. Component of compensation can only be sought under Form \'M\'.  Further, S.Nos. of list of enclosures are not properly arranged. Document mentioned at present sno 3 i.e. Payment receipts finds mentioned 6 pages but detailed as  from page number 33 to 38 requires rectification. Modify the complaint in this regard and re-submit the same within 15 days as per instructions. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-25 11:59:22.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-25 11:59:22.000'),(181,440007,'legaladvrera','2018-10-25 13:16:23.000',1060,'AdCNo10332018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-25 13:20:54.188','','2018-10-25 13:20:54.188','','Component of refund of amount and interest cannot be sought under Form \'N\'  said relief can be sought under Form \'M\' only. Component of compensation be sought under Form \'N\'. You may segregate the relief and file separate complaint.  Rectify the defects and re-submit complaint within 15 days as per instructions.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-25 13:16:23.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-25 13:16:23.000'),(182,440058,'exclegalrera','2018-10-25 14:48:40.000',1052,'AdCNo10282018','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-25 14:53:11.453','','2018-10-25 14:53:11.453','','Notice to Complainant to appear on 27.11.2018 at 9.30 AM with the direction to submit similar sets (hard copies) of complaints and documents on the date fixed.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2018-10-25 14:48:40.000','exclegalrera','2018-10-25 14:48:40.000'),(183,440059,'exclegalrera','2018-10-25 14:50:13.000',1052,'AdCNo10282018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-25 14:54:44.563','','2018-10-25 14:54:44.563','','Notice to Respondent for appearance on 27.11.2018 at 9.30 AM with the direction to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice and advance copy to complainant as per directions.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2018-10-25 14:50:13.000','exclegalrera','2018-10-25 14:50:13.000'),(184,440004,'999','2018-10-25 14:55:51.000',1057,'AdCNo10322018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-10-25 14:55:51.000','999','2018-10-25 14:55:51.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-10-25 14:55:51.000','sysadmin','2018-10-25 14:55:51.000'),(185,440058,'exclegalrera','2018-10-25 15:04:34.000',1031,'AdCNo10292018','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-25 15:09:05.219','','2018-10-25 15:09:05.219','','Noti