by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-11-20 08:38:39.000','999','2018-11-20 08:38:39.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-11-20 08:38:39.000','sysadmin','2018-11-20 08:38:39.000'),(204,440001,'999','2018-11-22 14:58:53.000',1071,'AdCNo10452018','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-11-22 14:58:53.000','999','2018-11-22 14:58:53.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-11-22 14:58:53.000','sysadmin','2018-11-22 14:58:53.000'),(205,440001,'999','2018-11-25 11:33:06.000',1078,'AdCNo10462018','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-11-25 11:33:06.000','999','2018-11-25 11:33:06.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-11-25 11:33:06.000','sysadmin','2018-11-25 11:33:06.000'),(206,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 12:51:59.000',1059,'AdCNo10342018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-28 12:56:38.141','','2018-11-28 12:56:38.141','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with reliefs for possession as well as refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018.\r\n For relief of possession and refund of amount along with interest, complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest or possession in form M only. Further you have uploaded incomplete documents as mentioned in the list of enclosures as you have not properly page numbered the documents and has not uploaded complete documents.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations,instructions.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 12:51:59.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-28 12:51:59.000'),(207,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 13:10:51.000',1061,'AdCNo10352018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-28 13:15:30.281','','2018-11-28 13:15:30.281','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. Further  you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 13:10:51.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-28 13:10:51.000'),(208,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 13:14:13.000',1063,'AdCNo10362018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-28 13:18:52.781','','2018-11-28 13:18:52.781','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. Further  you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 13:14:13.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-28 13:14:13.000'),(209,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 14:58:52.000',1064,'AdCNo10372018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-28 15:03:31.766','','2018-11-28 15:03:31.766','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for interest on amount paid , which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of interest on amount paid , a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of interest on amount paid in form M only. Further  you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\nIt is also observed that you have also incorporated and submitted the complaint in form N containing facts of complaint as a separate enclosure  annexure. The facts as contained in Facts of the Case under the tab Complaint details are different than the facts contained under the tab List of enclosures in support of the complaint, same is not permissible. The facts have to be included only under the tab Complaint Details in the specified para for Facts of the case in the given space. The Facts of complaint cannot be included under other tab which meant for supporting documents as enclosures.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 14:58:52.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-28 14:58:52.000'),(210,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:04:02.000',1035,'AdCNo10392018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-28 15:08:41.516','','2018-11-28 15:08:41.516','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. Further  you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded\r\nIt is also observed that you have also incorporated and submitted the complaint in form N containing facts of complaint as a separate enclosure / annexure. The facts as contained in Facts of the Case under the tab Complaint Details are different than the facts contained under the tab List of enclosures in support of the complaint, same is not permissible. The facts have to be included only under the tab Complaint Details in the specified para for Facts of the case in the given space. The Facts of complaint cannot be included under other tab which meant for supporting documents as enclosures.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:04:02.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:04:02.000'),(211,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:13:24.000',1038,'AdCNo10402018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-28 15:18:03.359','','2018-11-28 15:18:03.359','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for interest on amount paid which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of interest on amount paid, separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of  interest in form M only. Further  you have not properly uploaded the documents as they should be uploaded separately with proper page numbering.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:13:24.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:13:24.000'),(212,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:28:26.000',1065,'AdCNo10412018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-28 15:33:05.375','','2018-11-28 15:33:05.375','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only.\r\n Further  you have not properly mentioned the name of the documents uploaded and proper  page numbering of the documents uploaded has also not been done.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:28:26.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:28:26.000'),(213,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:36:17.000',1070,'AdCNo10432018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-28 15:40:56.172','','2018-11-28 15:40:56.172','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. \r\nFurther more  you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:36:17.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:36:17.000'),(214,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:50:28.000',1071,'AdCNo10452018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-28 15:55:07.328','','2018-11-28 15:55:07.328','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. \r\nFurther  you have not properly page numbered and named the documents uploaded.Also the name and contact number of complainant has been filled in place of respondent.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:50:28.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-28 15:50:28.000'),(215,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 09:51:06.000',1078,'AdCNo10462018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-29 09:55:46.272','','2018-11-29 09:55:46.272','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for interest on amount paid , which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of interest on amount paid, a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. \r\nFurther  you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 09:51:06.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-29 09:51:06.000'),(216,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:18:54.000',1076,'AdCNo10442018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-29 10:23:33.428','','2018-11-29 10:23:33.428','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with reliefs for immediate possession as well as interest on  amount paid , which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular No RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. For relief of possession and interest on amount paid , complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of interest on amount paid or possession in form M only.\r\n Further you have uploaded incomplete documents as mentioned in the list of enclosures as you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\nProject Rera number mentioned in your complaint is also incorrect.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:18:54.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:18:54.000'),(217,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:30:17.000',1050,'AdCNo10262018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-29 10:34:56.428','','2018-11-29 10:34:56.428','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only.\r\n Further more documents should be uploaded separately and should be properly page numbered.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:30:17.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:30:17.000'),(218,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:34:21.000',1040,'AdCNo10232018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-29 10:39:01.085','','2018-11-29 10:39:01.085','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. \r\nFurther more you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:34:21.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:34:21.000'),(219,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:38:09.000',1036,'AdCNo10212018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-29 10:42:48.444','','2018-11-29 10:42:48.444','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for interest on amount paid, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of interest on amount paid a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. \r\nFurther  you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:38:09.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:38:09.000'),(220,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:49:26.000',1057,'AdCNo10322018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-11-29 10:54:06.100','','2018-11-29 10:54:06.100','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for interest on amount paid, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018.\r\nFor relief of  interest on amount paid a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as  for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of interest on amount paid in form M only.  Further   you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:49:26.000','amlegalrera','2018-11-29 10:49:26.000'),(221,440004,'999','2018-12-03 11:31:02.000',1076,'AdCNo10442018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-12-03 11:31:02.000','999','2018-12-03 11:31:02.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-12-03 11:31:02.000','sysadmin','2018-12-03 11:31:02.000'),(222,440001,'999','2018-12-03 12:47:45.000',1079,'AdCNo10472018','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-12-03 12:47:45.000','999','2018-12-03 12:47:45.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-12-03 12:47:45.000','sysadmin','2018-12-03 12:47:45.000'),(223,440056,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 10:35:40.000',1060,'AdCNo10332018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-04 10:40:22.462','','2018-12-04 10:40:22.462','','The complainant has resubmitted the complaint with request to withdraw the same as mentioned in column for Compensation sought. \r\nSubmitted for kind consideration and  orders in this regard. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 10:35:40.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-04 10:35:40.000'),(224,440056,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 10:44:24.000',1076,'AdCNo10442018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-04 10:49:06.602','','2018-12-04 10:49:06.602','','The complainant has filed present complaint claiming relief as compensation for delayed possession.  \r\nFee , format and documents checked. The complainant has uploaded agreement in two parts  at sno 4 & 5, however same is complete as mentioned.\r\nSubmitted for kind  consideration and further orders please. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 10:44:24.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-04 10:44:24.000'),(225,440056,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 10:58:17.000',1062,'AdCNo10382018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-04 11:02:59.821','','2018-12-04 11:02:59.821','','Apart from compensation , the complainant sought directions to the effect that  competent authority and the promoter may be directed to permit the applicant to similarly claim the additional area as has been allowed to adjacent SCO Nos. 1063-65 and the expenses for the construction of the same may be ordered to be paid by the promoter to the tune of Rs.15,00,000/- which relief is required to be considered whether it falls under \'Compensation\' or not to entertain the complaint. Otherwise\r\nFee , format and documents checked which are in proper order. \r\nSubmitted for kind consideration and further directions please. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 10:58:17.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-04 10:58:17.000'),(226,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 11:24:39.000',1068,'AdCNo10422018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-04 11:29:21.868','','2018-12-04 11:29:21.868','','The interest for the period of delayed possession cannot be claimed under form N. Relief of compensation can only be sought under form N, and however the relief for interest on account of delay in handling over possession can be sought under form M.\r\nThe compensation sought by you is not specified and clear.You are required to specify whether you are claiming relief of interest in handling over delay of possession from the promoter or compensation only.\r\nAlso upload each document as a separate annexure with proper details and proper page numbering.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 11:24:39.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-04 11:24:39.000'),(227,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 11:34:23.000',1047,'AdCNo10242018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-04 11:39:05.227','','2018-12-04 11:39:05.227','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with reliefs for possession as well as assured returns on amount paid and future assured returns, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular No RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of possession as well as assured returns on amount paid and future assured returns, complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of possession as well as assured returns on amount paid and future assured returns, in form M only. \r\nFurther you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded. \r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 11:34:23.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-04 11:34:23.000'),(228,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 11:34:59.000',1046,'AdCNo10252018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-04 11:39:41.149','','2018-12-04 11:39:41.149','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with reliefs for possession as well as assured returns on amount paid and future assured returns, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular No RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of possession as well as assured returns on amount paid and future assured returns, complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of possession as well as assured returns on amount paid and future assured returns, in form M only. \r\nFurther you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded. \r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-04 11:34:59.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-04 11:34:59.000'),(229,440004,'999','2018-12-04 18:24:22.000',1050,'AdCNo10262018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-12-04 18:24:22.000','999','2018-12-04 18:24:22.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-12-04 18:24:22.000','sysadmin','2018-12-04 18:24:22.000'),(230,440056,'amlegalrera','2018-12-05 09:50:54.000',1050,'AdCNo10262018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-05 09:55:36.709','','2018-12-05 09:55:36.709','','The complainant has re submitted the complaint claiming relief of compensation amounting to Rs 10 Lacs. A separate complaint under Form M is being filed seeking refund of amount deposited along with interest. Fee, format and other documents checked. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-05 09:50:54.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-05 09:50:54.000'),(231,440004,'999','2018-12-05 14:18:45.000',1068,'AdCNo10422018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-12-05 14:18:45.000','999','2018-12-05 14:18:45.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-12-05 14:18:45.000','sysadmin','2018-12-05 14:18:45.000'),(232,440055,'memberjsk','2018-12-05 14:53:50.000',1050,'AdCNo10262018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2018-12-05 14:58:33.299','','2018-12-05 14:58:33.299','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 08.01.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n',2,0,'memberjsk','2018-12-05 14:53:50.000','memberjsk','2018-12-05 14:53:50.000'),(233,440055,'memberjsk','2018-12-05 14:56:51.000',1062,'AdCNo10382018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2018-12-05 15:01:34.158','','2018-12-05 15:01:34.158','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 08.01.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n',2,0,'memberjsk','2018-12-05 14:56:51.000','memberjsk','2018-12-05 14:56:51.000'),(234,440055,'memberjsk','2018-12-05 14:59:17.000',1076,'AdCNo10442018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2018-12-05 15:03:59.969','','2018-12-05 15:03:59.969','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 08.01.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n',2,0,'memberjsk','2018-12-05 14:59:17.000','memberjsk','2018-12-05 14:59:17.000'),(235,440055,'memberjsk','2018-12-05 15:04:55.000',1060,'AdCNo10332018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2018-12-05 15:09:38.272','','2018-12-05 15:09:38.272','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online. Since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the complainant or his counsel for 20.12.2018 for consideration through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the complainant may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date.\r\n(J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n',2,0,'memberjsk','2018-12-05 15:04:55.000','memberjsk','2018-12-05 15:04:55.000'),(236,440004,'999','2018-12-06 22:48:11.000',1078,'AdCNo10462018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-12-06 22:48:11.000','999','2018-12-06 22:48:11.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-12-06 22:48:11.000','sysadmin','2018-12-06 22:48:11.000'),(237,440001,'999','2018-12-10 10:36:43.000',1082,'AdCNo10482018','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-12-10 10:36:43.000','999','2018-12-10 10:36:43.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-12-10 10:36:43.000','sysadmin','2018-12-10 10:36:43.000'),(238,440061,'amlegalrera','2018-12-10 11:30:37.000',1060,'AdCNo10332018','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-10 11:34:49.803','','2018-12-10 11:34:49.803','','Notice to Complainant to\r\nappear for preliminary\r\nhearing on 20.12.18 at\r\n09.30 AM',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-10 11:30:37.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-10 11:30:37.000'),(239,440058,'amlegalrera','2018-12-10 11:36:42.000',1076,'AdCNo10442018','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330