.278','','2018-12-13 15:23:38.278','','The complainant has re submitted the complaint claiming relief of compensation amounting to Rs 10 lac as financial loss and 50,000 as litigation expenses .Fee, format and other documents checked. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:19:45.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:19:45.000'),(269,440056,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:25:31.000',1078,'AdCNo10462018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-13 15:29:23.818','','2018-12-13 15:29:23.818','','The complainant has re submitted the complaint claiming relief of compensation amounting to Rs 20,00,000.on account of mental agony and financial loss. Fee, format and other documents checked. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:25:31.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:25:31.000'),(270,440056,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:29:53.000',1070,'AdCNo10432018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-13 15:33:46.346','','2018-12-13 15:33:46.346','','The complainant has re submitted the complaint claiming relief of compensation on account of mental  harassment. Fee, format and other documents checked. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:29:53.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:29:53.000'),(271,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:40:11.000',1079,'AdCNo10472018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-13 15:44:03.923','','2018-12-13 15:44:03.923','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest   (Rs.24000/- and Rs.5000/- for upvc windows & gas connection fittings as a hidden charges) a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. \r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:40:11.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-13 15:40:11.000'),(272,440054,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 16:00:55.000',1034,'AdCNo10162018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-13 16:04:48.218','','2018-12-13 16:04:48.218','','Complaint returned to the complainant,with a liberty to file fresh complaint before the authority as per the decision of learned authority.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 16:00:55.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-13 16:00:55.000'),(273,440004,'999','2018-12-13 16:20:53.000',1086,'AdCNo10492018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-12-13 16:20:53.000','999','2018-12-13 16:20:53.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-12-13 16:20:53.000','sysadmin','2018-12-13 16:20:53.000'),(274,440056,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 16:33:28.000',1082,'AdCNo10482018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-13 16:37:20.548','','2018-12-13 16:37:20.548','','FEE, FORMAT AND DOCUMENTS CHECKED WHICH ARE IN ORDER. COMPLAINANT HAS FILED FRESH COMPLAINT IN VIEW OF ORDERS DATED 05.06.2018 PASSED BY HON\'BLE CHAIRMAN. SUBMITTED FOR KIND CONSIDERATION AND FURTHER DIRECTIONS PLEASE.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 16:33:28.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-13 16:33:28.000'),(275,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 16:42:28.000',1086,'AdCNo10492018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-13 16:46:20.264','','2018-12-13 16:46:20.264','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only.  \r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-13 16:42:28.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-13 16:42:28.000'),(276,440004,'999','2018-12-13 22:28:18.000',1064,'AdCNo10372018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-12-13 22:28:18.000','999','2018-12-13 22:28:18.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-12-13 22:28:18.000','sysadmin','2018-12-13 22:28:18.000'),(277,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-12-14 10:06:54.000',1064,'AdCNo10372018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-14 10:11:42.778','','2018-12-14 10:11:42.778','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for interest on amount paid along with immediate possession , which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of interest on amount paid along with immediate possession , a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N. \r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of interest on amount paid along with immediate possession in form M only.\r\nFurther you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\n\r\n It is also observed that you have also incorporated and submitted the complaint in form N containing facts of complaint as a separate enclosure annexure. The facts as contained in Facts of the Case under the tab Complaint details are different than the facts contained under the tab List of enclosures in support of the complaint, same is not permissible. The facts have to be included only under the tab Complaint Details in the specified para for Facts of the case in the given space. \r\nThe Facts of complaint cannot be included under other tab which meant for supporting documents as enclosures.\r\n\r\n Hence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-14 10:06:54.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-14 10:06:54.000'),(278,440055,'memberjsk','2018-12-17 12:16:43.000',1082,'AdCNo10482018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2018-12-17 12:21:13.592','','2018-12-17 12:21:13.592','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 16.01.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n',2,0,'memberjsk','2018-12-17 12:16:43.000','memberjsk','2018-12-17 12:16:43.000'),(279,440055,'memberjsk','2018-12-17 12:18:12.000',1070,'AdCNo10432018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2018-12-17 12:22:42.149','','2018-12-17 12:22:42.149','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 16.01.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registere