 the complainant with the liberty to file fresh one before the authority as per the decision of learned authority.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-18 13:59:34.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-18 13:59:34.000'),(308,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-12-19 13:15:33.000',1088,'AdCNo10502018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-19 13:19:50.948','','2018-12-19 13:19:50.948','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount on account of club house, a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount on account of club house in form M only.  Further   you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-19 13:15:33.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-19 13:15:33.000'),(309,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-12-19 13:20:21.000',1064,'AdCNo10372018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-19 13:24:39.259','','2018-12-19 13:24:39.259','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with reliefs for possession , which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular No RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\n\r\nFor relief of immediate possession , complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\n\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-19 13:20:21.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-19 13:20:21.000'),(310,440007,'amlegalrera','2018-12-19 13:26:20.000',1086,'AdCNo10492018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-19 13:30:37.700','','2018-12-19 13:30:37.700','','Documents uploaded are wrongly uploaded, you need to upload all the documents separately and as per serial numbers with proper page numbering.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-19 13:26:20.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-19 13:26:20.000'),(311,440054,'amlegalrera','2018-12-21 15:30:09.000',1060,'AdCNo10332018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-21 15:34:18.965','','2018-12-21 15:34:18.965','','complaint withdrawn with liberty to file fresh one.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-21 15:30:09.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-21 15:30:09.000'),(312,440054,'amlegalrera','2018-12-21 15:34:58.000',1026,'AdCNo10092018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-21 15:39:07.365','','2018-12-21 15:39:07.365','','Complaint returned with liberty to file fresh one.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-21 15:34:58.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-21 15:34:58.000'),(313,440004,'999','2018-12-23 07:23:03.000',1086,'AdCNo10492018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2018-12-23 07:23:03.000','999','2018-12-23 07:23:03.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2018-12-23 07:23:03.000','sysadmin','2018-12-23 07:23:03.000'),(314,440004,'999','2018-12-24 11:51:32.000',1088,'AdCNo10502018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Ap