complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. For relief of refund of amount on account of club house, a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N. You may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount on account of club house in form M only. Further you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded. Hence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-31 11:38:18.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-31 11:38:18.000'),(319,440056,'amlegalrera','2018-12-31 11:44:00.000',1089,'AdCNo10512018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-31 11:48:45.448','','2018-12-31 11:48:45.448','','The complainant has submitted the complaint claiming relief of compensation on account of  harassment,deficiency of services  etc. Fee, format and other documents checked. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-31 11:44:00.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-31 11:44:00.000'),(320,440056,'amlegalrera','2018-12-31 11:48:00.000',1086,'AdCNo10492018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-31 11:52:44.979','','2018-12-31 11:52:44.979','','The complainant has re submitted the complaint claiming relief of compensation on account of deficiency in services,litigation expenses  etc. Fee, format and other documents checked. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-31 11:48:00.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-31 11:48:00.000'),(321,440056,'amlegalrera','2018-12-31 15:43:45.000',1079,'AdCNo10472018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-12-31 15:48:30.698','','2018-12-31 15:48:30.698','','The complainant has re submitted the complaint claiming relief of compensation on account of deficiency in services,litigation expenses  etc. Fee, format and other documents checked. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2018-12-31 15:43:45.000','amlegalrera','2018-12-31 15:43:45.000'),(322,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-01-01 12:38:51.000',1088,'AdCNo10502018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-01 12:43:36.886','','2019-01-01 12:43:36.886','','Component of compensation due to delayed possession, relief regarding carpet area and decision of GST demanded by promoter, cannot be sought under Form \'N\' said relief can be sought under Form \'M\' only. Component of compensation be sought under Form \'N\'. \r\nYou may segregate the relief and rectify the defects and re-submit complaint within 15 days as per instructions.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-01 12:38:51.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-01 12:38:51.000'),(323,440055,'memberjsk','2019-01-01 15:45:21.000',1079,'AdCNo10472018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2019-01-01 15:50:06.016','','2019-01-01 15:50:06.016','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 24.01.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n',2,0,'memberjsk','2019-01-01 15:45:21.000','memberjsk','2019-01-01 15:45:21.000'),(324,440055,'memberjsk','2019-01-01 15:48:12.000',1086,'AdCNo10492018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2019-01-01 15:52:57.156','','2019-01-01 15:52:57.156','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 29.01.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n',2,0,'memberjsk','2019-01-01 15:48:12.000','memberjsk','2019-01-01 15:48:12.000'),(325,440055,'memberjsk','2019-01-01 15:55:11.000',1089,'AdCNo10512018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2019-01-01 15:59:56.328','','2019-01-01 15:59:56.328','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 29.01.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant