'In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-01-02 11:27:46.000','sysadmin','2019-01-02 11:27:46.000'),(335,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-01-02 14:21:51.000',1064,'AdCNo10372018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-02 14:26:35.057','','2019-01-02 14:26:35.058','','you have re submitted the complaint\r\nin form N containing\r\nfacts of complaint as a\r\nseparate enclosure\r\n\"Annexure MC-01\" same is not permissible.\r\nThe facts have to be\r\nincluded only under the\r\ntab Complaint Details in\r\nthe specified para for\r\nFacts of the case in the\r\ngiven space. The Facts\r\nof complaint cannot be\r\nincluded under other tab\r\nwhich is meant for\r\nsupporting documents\r\nas enclosures. Hence\r\nyou are required to\r\nmodify the present\r\ncomplaint and re submit\r\nthe same for admissible\r\nrelief immediately.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-02 14:21:51.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-02 14:21:51.000'),(336,440004,'999','2019-01-04 11:51:37.000',1036,'AdCNo10212018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-01-04 11:51:37.000','999','2019-01-04 11:51:37.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-01-04 11:51:37.000','sysadmin','2019-01-04 11:51:37.000'),(337,440001,'999','2019-01-04 19:10:32.000',1081,'AdCNo10532019','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-01-04 19:10:32.000','999','2019-01-04 19:10:32.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-01-04 19:10:32.000','sysadmin','2019-01-04 19:10:32.000'),(338,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-01-07 10:03:23.000',1081,'AdCNo10532019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-07 10:07:54.840','','2019-01-07 10:07:54.840','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with reliefs for possession, as well as compensation for delayed possession in form of interest, and promised amount for delay in possession which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular No RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of possession and as well as compensation for delayed possession in form of interest, and promised amount for delay in possession , complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of possession and as well as compensation for delayed possession in form of interest, and promised amount for delay in possession  in form M only.\r\n Further you have not properly page numbered the documents  uploaded.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief within 15 days as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-07 10:03:23.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-07 10:03:23.000'),(339,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-01-07 17:02:39.000',1070,'AdCNo10432018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-07 17:07:10.899','','2019-01-07 17:07:10.899','','Complainant was instructed to remove defects in the complaint and to file a separate complaint for relief regarding interest.\r\nComplainant has re submitted the complaint without modifying it.\r\nComplainant was required to remove the defects and re submit the complaint in 15 days as per regulations, where as the complainant has resubmitted it after the expiry of given time.\r\nNow at this stage as per REGULATIONS, 2017 Section 6(5) the above said complaint is being forwarded for further orders and consideration.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-07 17:02:39.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-07 17:02:39.000'),(340,440004,'999','2019-01-07 19:32:59.000',1081,'AdCNo10532019','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-01-07 19:32:59.000','999','2019-01-07 19:32:59.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-01-07 19:32:59.000','sysadmin','2019-01-07 19:32:59.000'),(341,440059,'amlegalrera','2019-01-08 15:39:54.000',1022,'AdCNo10102018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-08 15:44:26.040','','2019-01-08 15:44:26.040','','Notice to respondent to appear on 30/01/2019 at 9.30 am, and file  written reply along with relevant documents .',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-08 15:39:54.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-08 15:39:54.000'),(342,440004,'999','2019-01-08 19:35:05.000',1040,'AdCNo10232018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-01-08 19:35:05.000','999','2019-01-08 19:35:05.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-01-08 19:35:05.000','sysadmin','2019-01-08 19:35:05.000'),(343,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-01-09 10:04:49.000',1036,'AdCNo10212018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-09 10:09:21.112','','2019-01-09 10:09:21.112','','Complainant was instructed to remove defects in the complaint and to file a separate complaint for relief regarding interest. Complainant has re submitted the complaint without modifying it. Complainant was required to remove the defects and re submit the complaint in 15 days as per regulations, where as the complainant has resubmitted it after the expiry of given time. Now at this stage as per REGULATIONS, 2017 Section 6(5) the above said complaint is being forwarded for further orders and consideration.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-09 10:04:49.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-09 10:04:49.000'),(344,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-01-09 10:17:03.000',1040,'AdCNo10232018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-09 10:21:35.270','','2019-01-09 10:21:35.270','','Complainant was instructed to remove defects in the complaint and to file a separate complaint for relief regarding interest. Complainant has re submitted the complaint without modifying it. Complainant was required to remove the defects and re submit the complaint in 15 days as per regulations, where as the complainant has resubmitted it after the expiry of given time. Now at this stage as per REGULATIONS, 2017 Section 6(5) the above said complaint is being forwarded for further orders.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-09 10:17:03.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-09 10:17:03.000'),(345,440055,'memberjsk','2019-01-09 12:19:03.000',1070,'AdCNo10432018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2019-01-09 12:23:34.988','','2019-01-09 12:23:34.988','','scrutinize the matter as per latest instructions',2,0,'memberjsk','2019-01-09 12:19:03.000','memberjsk','2019-01-09 12:19:03.000'),(346,440055,'memberjsk','2019-01-09 12:20:16.000',1036,'AdCNo10212018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2019-01-09 12:24:48.457','','2019-01-09 12:24:48.457','','scrutinize the matter as per latest instructions',2,0,'memberjsk','2019-01-09 12:20:16.000','memberjsk','2019-01-09 12:20:16.000'),(347,440059,'amlegalrera','2019-01-09 14:06:25.000',1070,'AdCNo10432018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d