\r\n21.11.2018.\r\n For relief of\r\ninterest on amount paid\r\na separate complaint\r\nunder form M can be\r\nfiled and maintainable,\r\nwhere as for\r\ncompensation complaint\r\ncan be filed under form\r\nN. You may file a\r\nseparate and\r\nindependent complaint\r\nfor  relief for\r\ninterest on amount paid, in form M only.\r\nHence you\r\nare required to modify\r\nthe present complaint\r\nand re submit the same\r\nfor admissible relief immediately as per\r\nregulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-14 11:03:17.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-14 11:03:17.000'),(352,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-01-14 11:23:09.000',1047,'AdCNo10242018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-14 11:27:37.756','','2019-01-14 11:27:37.756','','Complainant was instructed to remove defects in the complaint and to file a separate complaint for relief regarding immediate possession. Complainant has re submitted the complaint, and filed a separate complaint in form \"M\" for other reliefs apart from compensation.\r\n Complainant was required to remove the defects and re submit the complaint in 15 days as per regulations, where as the complainant has resubmitted it after the expiry of given time. Now at this stage as per RERA REGULATIONS, 2017 Section 6(5) the above said complaint is being submitted for further orders and consideration. Fee, format and other documents checked. \r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-14 11:23:09.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-14 11:23:09.000'),(353,440001,'999','2019-01-14 12:21:40.000',1097,'AdCNo10542019','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-01-14 12:21:40.000','999','2019-01-14 12:21:40.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-01-14 12:21:40.000','sysadmin','2019-01-14 12:21:40.000'),(354,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-01-1