n clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. For relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N. You may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only.\r\n Hence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-16 10:52:58.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-16 10:52:58.000'),(364,440004,'999','2019-01-16 16:02:12.000',1090,'AdCNo10522018','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-01-16 16:02:12.000','999','2019-01-16 16:02:12.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-01-16 16:02:12.000','sysadmin','2019-01-16 16:02:12.000'),(365,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-01-16 16:30:10.000',1090,'AdCNo10522018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-16 16:34:30.440','','2019-01-16 16:34:30.440','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. For relief of refund of amount on account of club house, a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N. You may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount on account of club house in form M only. Further you have not properly page numbered the documents uploaded. \r