plaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. \r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief as per regulations within 15 days\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-21 12:10:40.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-21 12:10:40.000'),(391,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-01-21 12:57:42.000',1102,'AdCNo10582019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-21 13:01:46.968','','2019-01-21 13:01:46.968','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with reliefs for possession or refund of amount paid along with interest, which is not permissible in a complaint under form Nas per circular No RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. For relief of possession or refund of amount paid along with interest, complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable,where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest or possession in form M only.\r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-01-21 12:57:42.000','amlegalrera','2019-01-21 12:57:42.000'),(392,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-01-21 13:03:06.000',1068,'AdCNo10422018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-01-21 13:07:11.125','','2019-01-21 13:07:11.125','','You have sought relief\r\nof compensation\r\nclubbed with relief for\r\ninterest on delayed\r\npossession, which is not\r\npermissible in a\r\ncomplaint under form N\r\nas per circular no\r\nRERA.PB.ENF.15 dated\r\n21.11.2018.\r\n You 