y Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-02-06 11:33:02.726','','2019-02-06 11:33:02.726','','The columns for address of complainant, for notices and that of authorized person is provided separately in the complaint form. The complaint finds mention address of Authorized Representative/Advocate same as that of complainant which can not be permitted. You are required to mention address of complainant in the specified column. Rectify the defect and re-submit complaint immediately.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-02-06 11:28:35.000','amlegalrera','2019-02-06 11:28:35.000'),(428,440001,'999','2019-02-06 16:17:32.000',1111,'AdCNo10622019','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-02-06 16:17:32.000','999','2019-02-06 16:17:32.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-02-06 16:17:32.000','sysadmin','2019-02-06 16:17:32.000'),(429,440004,'999','2019-02-06 22:41:58.000',1106,'AdCNo10602019','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-02-06 22:41:58.000','999','2019-02-06 22:41:58.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-02-06 22:41:58.000','sysadmin','2019-02-06 22:41:58.000'),(430,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-02-07 09:48:02.000',1106,'AdCNo10602019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-02-07 09:52:30.164','','2019-02-07 09:52:30.164','','You were requested to modify the complaint and re submit the same  as It is observed that you\r\nhave incorporated and\r\nsubmitted the complaint\r\nin form \'N\' containing\r\nfacts of complaint as a\r\