 is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018. \r\nFor relief of refund of amount along with interest a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of refund of amount along with interest in form M only. \r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-02-11 16:17:24.000','amlegalrera','2019-02-11 16:17:24.000'),(444,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-02-11 16:19:48.000',1110,'AdCNo10612019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-02-11 16:23:47.102','','2019-02-11 16:23:47.102','','You have sought relief of compensation clubbed with relief for interest on amount paid, which is not permissible in a complaint under form N as per circular no RERA.PB.ENF.15 dated 21.11.2018.\r\nFor relief of  interest on amount paid a separate complaint under form M can be filed and maintainable, where as  for compensation complaint can be filed under form N.\r\nYou may file a separate and independent complaint for relief of interest on amount paid in form M only. \r\nHence you are required to modify the present complaint and re submit the same for admissible relief as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-02-11 16:19:48.000','amlegalrera','2019-02-11 16:19:48.000'),(445,440004,'999','2019-02-12 12:23:47.000',1106,'AdCNo10602019','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-02-12 12:23:47.000','999','2019-02-12 12:23:47.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-02-12 12:23:47.000','sysadmin','2019