ed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n',2,0,'memberjsk','2019-02-15 15:47:17.000','memberjsk','2019-02-15 15:47:17.000'),(449,440058,'amlegalrera','2019-02-15 16:10:03.000',1106,'AdCNo10602019','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-02-15 02:45:23.049','','2019-02-15 02:45:23.049','','Notice to Complainant to appear on 18.03.2019 at 09.30 AM and submit similar sets (hard Copies) of the complaint and the documents attached submitted online.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-02-15 16:10:03.000','amlegalrera','2019-02-15 16:10:03.000'),(450,440058,'amlegalrera','2019-02-15 16:10:08.000',1106,'AdCNo10602019','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-02-15 02:45:28.201','','2019-02-15 02:45:28.201','','Notice to Complainant to appear on 18.03.2019 at 09.30 AM and submit similar sets (hard Copies) of the complaint and the documents attached submitted online.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-02-15 16:10:08.000','amlegalrera','2019-02-15 16:10:08.000'),(451,440059,'amlegalrera','2019-02-15 16:10:50.000',1106,'AdCNo10602019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-02-15 02:46:10.237','','2019-02-15 02:46:10.237','','Notice to Respondent for appearance on 18.03.2019 at 09.30 AM with the direction to file reply within fifteen days from receipt of notice and advance copy to complainant as per directions.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-02-15 16:10:50.000','amlegalrera','2019-02-15 16:10:50.000'),(452,440001,'999','2019-02-21 13:05:05.000',1114,'AdCNo10632019','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-02-21 13:05:05.000','999','2019-02-21 13:05:05.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-02-21 13:05:05.000','sysadmin','2019-02-21 13:05:05.000'),(453,440001,'999','2019-02-21 14:40:38.000',1125,'AdCNo10642019','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-02-21 14:40:38.000','999','2019-02-21 14:40:38.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-02-21 14:40:38.000','sysadmin','2019-02-21 14:40:38.000'),(454,440001,'999','2019-02-22 19:15:05.000',1126,'AdCNo10652019','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-02-22 19:15:05.000','999','2019-02-22 19:15:05.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-02-22 19:15:05.000','sysadmin','2019-02-22 19:15:05.000'),(455,440001,'999','2019-02-24 21:43:35.000',1127,'AdCNo10662019','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-02-24 21:43:35.000','999','2019-02-24 21:43:35.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-02-24 21:43:35.000','sysadmin','2019-02-24 21:43:35.000'),(456,440004,'999','2019-02-25 14:48:18.000',1110,'AdCNo10612019','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-02-25 14:48:18.000','999','2019-02-25 14:48:18.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-02-25 14:48:18.000','sysadmin','2019-02-25 14:48:18.000'),(457,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-02-26 10:25:59.000',1125,'AdCNo10642019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-02-25 21:00:59.909','','2019-02-25 21:00:59.909','','As per Circular No RERA /PB./ENF/1H dated 29.10.2018, your complaint is not maintainable in form N, as claimed for refund of deposited amount along with interest which can only be sought under form M, the same shall be decided by the Authority of its concerned bench, however the relief claiming compensation can be adjudicated by the Adjudicating officer in addition to claim in form N.\r\n\r\n Hence you may file a separate complaint for refund of amount or interest, however present complaint in form N can be considered for claim of compensation only if any.\r\nSo kindly re submit your complaint with modification for admissible relief within 15 days as per rules.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-02-26 10:25:59.000','amlegalrera','2019-02-26 10:25:59.000'),(458,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-02-26 10:27:57.000',1036,'AdCNo10212018','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-02-25 21:02:58.280','','2019-02-25 21:02:58.280','','You have sought relief\r\nof compensation\r\nclubbed with relief for\r\ninterest on amount paid,\r\nwhich is not permissible\r\nin a complaint under\r\nform N as per circular no\r\nRERA.PB.ENF.15 dated\r\n21.11.2018. For relief of\r\ninterest on amount paid\r\na separate complaint\r\nunder form M can be\r\nfiled and maintainable,\r\nwhere as for\r\ncompensation complaint\r\ncan be filed under form\r\nN. You may file a\r\nseparate and\r\nindependent complaint\r\nfor relief for interest on\r\namount paid, in form M\r\nonly. Hence you are\r\nrequired to modify the\r\npresent complaint and\r\nre submit the same for\r\nadmissible relief\r\nimmediately as per regulations',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-02-26 10:27:57.000','amlegalrera','2019-02-26 10:27:57.000'),(459,440001,'999','2019-02-26 11:20:57.000',1129,'AdCNo10672019','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-02-26 11:20:57.000','999','2019-02-26 11:20:57.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-02-26 11:20:57.000','sysadmin','2019-02-26 11:20:57.000'),(460,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-02-27 16:46:36.000',1126,'AdCNo10652019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-02-27 03:21:27.430','','2019-02-27 03:21:27.430','','As per mail received from the complainant dated 27.02.2019, the Annexure A1 has been uploaded twice which needs to be rectified and should be uploaded correctly.\r\nkindly remove the defects and upload the same immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-02-27 16:46:36.000','amlegalrera','2019-02-27 16:46:36.000'),(461,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-02-28 11:45:48.000',1127,'AdCNo10662019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-02-27 22:20:33.145','','2019-02-27 22:20:33.145','','Power of attorney/ Vakalatnama filed/ uploaded is not in proper format, however kindly upload the proper Memorandum of Authorization, in form 2 as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-02-28 11:45:48.000','amlegalrera','2019-02-28 11:45:48.000'),(462,440004,'999','2019-02-28 15:14:46.000',1127,'AdCNo10662019','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous',