ered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any.The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\n                                                                                                                                 RERA\r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-05-03 15:46:26.000','psmemberjsk','2019-05-03 15:46:26.000'),(805,440058,'amlegalrera','2019-05-03 16:09:26.000',1276,'AdCNo11112019','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-05-03 16:14:57.106','','2019-05-03 16:14:57.106','','Notice to Complainant to appear on 12.06.2019 at 09.30 AM and submit similar sets (hard Copies) of the complaint and the documents attached submitted online.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-05-03 16:09:26.000','amlegalrera','2019-05-03 16:09:26.000'),(806,440059,'amlegalrera','2019-05-03 16:10:14.000',1276,'AdCNo11112019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-05-03 16:15:45.045','','2019-05-03 16:15:45.045','','Notice to Respondent for appearance and filing of reply with advance copy to complainant as per directions.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-05-03 16:10:14.000','amlegalrera','2019-05-03 16:10:14.000'),(807,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-05-03 16:34:03.000',1271,'AdCNo11002019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-05-03 16:39:33.035','','2019-05-03 16:39:33.035','','I