on)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-05-05 16:44:38.000','sysadmin','2019-05-05 16:44:38.000'),(882,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-05-06 11:00:25.000',1175,'AdCNo10962019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-05-06 11:05:37.249','','2019-05-06 11:05:37.249','','You have filed complaint against promoter but the name of promoter as per records of Registration is recorded different. You are required to mention name of promoter as recorded against Registration Number of the Project involved in the complaint which you may verify from the list of Registered Projects on the official website of the Authority. rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-05-06 11:00:25.000','amlegalrera','2019-05-06 11:00:25.000'),(883,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-05-06 11:20:37.000',1036,'AdCNo10212018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-05-06 11:25:49.718','','2019-05-06 11:25:49.718','','complainant was requested to resubmit the complaint along with hard copies. complainant has re submitted the complaint but hard copies are yet to received.\r\nfee format and other documents checked submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.  ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-05-06 11:20:37.000','amlegalrera','2019-05-06 11:20:37.000'),(884,440001,'999','2019-05-06 11:58:59.000',1281,'AdCNo12072019','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-05-06 11:58:59.000','999','2019-05-06 11:58:59.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-05-06 11:58:59.000','sysadmin','2019-05-06 11:58:59.000'),(885,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-05-06 12:08:43.000',1281,'AdCNo12072019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-05-06 12:13:54.622','','2019-05-06 12:13:54.622','','You have filed complaint against promoter but the name of promoter as per records of Registration is recorded different. You are required to mention name of promoter as recorded against Registration Number of the Project involved in the complaint which you may verify from the list of Registered Projects on theofficial website of the Authority. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-05-06 12:08:43.000','amlegalrera','2019-05-06 12:08:43.000'),(886,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-05-06 13:24:05.000',1268,'AdCNo11492019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-05-06 13:29:16.559','','2019-05-06 13:29:16.559','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 13.06.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any.The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\n                                                                                                                                 RERA\r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-05-06 13:24:05.000','psmemberjsk','2019-05-06 13:24:05.000'),(887,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-05-06 13:25:03.000',1167,'AdCNo10952019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-05-06 13:30:13.985','','2019-05-06 13:30:13.985','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 13.06.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any.The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\