en received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 20.06.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. Specific report qua the fact that the plot/flat etc. falls in the project registered with this Authority be obtained from the registration branch. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date.\r\n (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA\r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-05-30 10:18:41.000','psmemberjsk','2019-05-30 10:18:41.000'),(1311,440058,'amlegalrera','2019-05-30 10:50:51.000',1299,'AdCNo12212019','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-05-30 10:56:32.494','','2019-05-30 10:56:32.494','','Notice to Complainant to appear on 20.06.2019 at 09.30 AM and submit similar sets (hard Copies) of the complaint and the documents attached submitted online.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-05-30 10:50:51.000','amlegalrera','2019-05-30 10:50:51.000'),(1312,440059,'amlegalrera','2019-05-30 11:02:47.000',1299,'AdCNo12212019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2