ints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017 for further proceedings. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-05-31 15:40:45.000','amlegalrera','2019-05-31 15:40:45.000'),(1450,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:13:40.000',1291,'AdCNo12192019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-06-03 10:19:00.008','','2019-06-03 10:19:00.008','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant alleged violation of section 18 and has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:13:40.000','amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:13:40.000'),(1451,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:18:50.000',1312,'AdCNo12312019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-06-03 10:24:10.758','','2019-06-03 10:24:10.758','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant alleged violation of section 18 and has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:18:50.000','amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:18:50.000'),(1452,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:19:05.000',1295,'AdCNo12182019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-06-03 10:24:25.665','','2019-06-03 10:24:25.665','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant alleged violation of section 18 and has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:19:05.000','amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:19:05.000'),(1453,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:40:13.000',1308,'AdCNo12292019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-06-03 10:45:32.868','','2019-06-03 10:45:32.868','','You have filed complaint alleging violation 12 and Section 18 of the Act you have also prayed for possession. If you want to stay in project in that case you may seek interest for the delayed period of possession under proviso of Section 18(1) of the Act for which you are required to submit your complaint under FORM-M and for that you may modify the complaint otherwise if you opt to withdraw from the project in that case you may seek refund, interest and compensation but under FORM-N. You may refer Judgment dated 27.02.2019 passed by Hon\'ble Real Estate Appellate Tribunal, Punjab in this regard wherein certain guidelines have been drawn.  The complaint is hereby returned for rectification and re-submission or clarification which you are required to do within fifteen days from today. You are also required to submit hard copies of the re-submitted complaint with legal section same day of re-submission.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:40:13.000','amlegalrera','2019-06-03 10:40:13.000'),(1454,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-06-03 12:19:11.000',1280,'AdCNo12112019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-06-03 12:24:30.962','','2019-06-03 12:24:30.962','','It has been observed that you were asked twice to submit hard copies of your complaint, but till date the hard copies has not been received with this Authority. You are  required to submit hard copies of the uploaded complaint immediately with Legal Wing of Authority.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-06-03 12:19:11.000','amlegalrera','2019-06-03 12:19:11.000'),(1455,440007,'amleg