'In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-06-10 10:58:49.926','','2019-06-10 10:58:49.926','','you have filed complaint against a registered project but the name of respondent i.e. of Promoter of the Registered Project is not in consonance with Project Registration Number and documents uploaded.  You are required to implead promoter as respondent after verifying the list of registered projects from website of Authority. You may add any number of additional respondents therein which are necessary.\r\n Complaint is returned for necessary rectifications. Resubmit complaint or explanation within 15 days with required sets of hard copies on the same day. You are free to contact legal wing of Authority on working days.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-06-10 10:53:33.000','amlegalrera','2019-06-10 10:53:33.000'),(1468,440058,'amlegalrera','2019-06-10 12:38:01.000',1274,'AdCNo11202019','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-06-10 12:43:18.364','','2019-06-10 12:43:18.364','','Notice to Complainant to\r\nappear on 16.07.2019 at\r\n09.30 AM and submit\r\nsimilar sets (hard\r\nCopies) of the complaint\r\nand the documents\r\nattached submitted\r\nonline',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-06-10 12:38:01.000','amlegalrera','2019-06-10 12:38:01.000'),(1469,440059,'amlegalrera','2019-06-10 12:38:38.000',1274,'AdCNo11202019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-06-10 12:43:54.942','','2019-06-10 12:43:54.942','','Notice to Respondent\r\nfor appearance and\r\nfiling of reply with\r\nadvance copy to\r\ncomplainant as per\r\ndirections',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-06-10 12:38:38.000','amlegalrera','2019-06-10 12:38:38.000'),(1470,440004,'999','2019-06-10 14:37:19.000',1311,'AdCNo12322019','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-06-10 14:37:19.000','999','2019-06-10 14:37:19.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-06-10 14:37:19.000','sysadmin','2019-06-10 14:37:19.000'),(1471,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-06-10 15:07:45.000',1306,'AdCNo12282019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-06-10 15:13:02.004','','2019-06-10 15:13:02.004','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 29.07.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project by getting a specific report from registration Branch. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.    \r\n                                                                    (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n\r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-06-10 15:07:45.000','psmemberjsk','2019-06-10 15:07:45.000'),(1472,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-06-10 15:13:42.000',1307,'AdCNo12302019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-06-10 15:18:58.536','','2019-06-10 15:18:58.536','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 29.07.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project by getting a specific report from registration Branch. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.    \r\n                                                                    (J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\nRERA, \r\n\r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-06-10 15:13:42.000','psmemberjsk','2019-06-10 15:13:42.000'),(1473,440058,'amlegalrera','2019-06-10 15:19:37.000',1306,'AdCNo12282