007,'amlegalrera','2019-06-19 16:42:13.000',1316,'AdCNo12342019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-06-19 16:47:39.251','','2019-06-19 16:47:39.251','','You have filed complaint against Promoter of a registered project but in the list of respondents the name of Promoter who is recorded against registration number of the project is not included. Verify the same from List of Registered Projects available on website of authority and rectify the same. \r\nRectify defects and re-submit complaint within 15 days from today otherwise complaint shall be forwarded to proceed with in accordance with law',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-06-19 16:42:13.000','amlegalrera','2019-06-19 16:42:13.000'),(1801,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-06-20 11:46:05.000',1327,'AdCNo12432019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-06-20 11:51:23.706','','2019-06-20 11:51:23.706','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned by the complainant and also mentioned in the project file and provided by the promoter (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 01.08.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. Specific report qua the fact that the plot/flat etc. falls in the project registered with this Authority be obtained from the registration branch. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date.\r\n(J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer, \r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-06-20 11:46:05.000','psmemberjsk','2019-06-20 11:46:05.000'),(1802,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-06-20 11:50:45.000',1284,'AdCNo12122019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-06-20 11:56:03.738','','2019-06-20 11:56:03.738','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned by the complainant and also mentioned in the project file and provided by the promoter (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 01.08.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. Specific report qua the fact that the plot/flat etc. falls in the project registered with this Authority be obtained from the registration branch. The file shal