 by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-07-09 14:34:35.000','999','2019-07-09 14:34:35.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-07-09 14:34:35.000','sysadmin','2019-07-09 14:34:35.000'),(1980,440004,'999','2019-07-10 09:26:19.000',1330,'AdCNo12442019','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-07-10 09:26:19.000','999','2019-07-10 09:26:19.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-07-10 09:26:19.000','sysadmin','2019-07-10 09:26:19.000'),(1981,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-07-10 10:14:58.000',1344,'AdCNo12572019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-07-10 10:20:48.290','','2019-07-10 10:20:48.290','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned by the complainant and also mentioned in the project file and provided by the promoter (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 26.08.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. Specific report qua the fact that the plot/flat etc. falls in the project registered with this Authority be obtained from the registration branch. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date.\r\n(J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer,\r\n                                                                                                         RERA \r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-07-10 10:14:58.000','psmemberjsk','2019-07-10 10:14:58.000'),(1982,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-07-10 10:16:19.000',1343,'AdCNo12562019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-07-10 10:22:09.630','','2019-07-10 10:22:09.630','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned by the complainant and also mentioned in the project file and provided by the promoter (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 26.08.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. Specific report qua the fact that the plot/flat etc. falls in the project registered with this Authority b