s you want to stay in project. As per proviso section 18(1) where allottee does not intend to withdraw from the project, he can claim interest for delayed possession. kindly rectify the defects and modify your complaint and re submit immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 10:46:41.000','amlegalrera','2019-08-19 10:46:41.000'),(2238,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 10:47:22.000',1409,'AdCNo13012019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-08-19 10:53:10.264','','2019-08-19 10:53:10.264','','You have filed complaint against Promoter of a registered project but in the list of respondents the name of Promoter who is recorded against registration number of the project is not included. Verify the same from List of Registered Projects available on website of authority and rectify the same. Rectify defects and re-submit complaint within 15 days from today otherwise complaint shall be forwarded to proceed with in accordance with law.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 10:47:22.000','amlegalrera','2019-08-19 10:47:22.000'),(2239,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 10:49:10.000',1389,'AdCNo12892019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-08-19 10:54:58.483','','2019-08-19 10:54:58.483','','You were required to remove defects but you have submitted your complaint without removing defects.\r\nYou have filed complaint against Promoter of a registered project but in the list of respondents the name of Promoter who is recorded against registration number of the project is not included. Verify the same from List of Registered Projects available on website of authority and rectify the same. Rectify defects and re-submit complaint within 15 days from today otherwise complaint shall be forwarded to proceed with in accordance with law.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 10:49:10.000','amlegalrera','2019-08-19 10:49:10.000'),(2240,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 11:05:20.000',1394,'AdCNo12932019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-08-19 11:11:08.458','','2019-08-19 11:11:08.458','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant alleged violation of section 18 for non delivery of possession by respondent and has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 11:05:20.000','amlegalrera','2019-08-19 11:05:20.000'),(2241,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 11:07:42.000',1404,'AdCNo12942019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-08-19 11:13:30.660','','2019-08-19 11:13:30.660','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant alleged violation of section 18 for non delivery of possession by respondent and has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 11:07:42.000','amlegalrera','2019-08-19 11:07:42.000'),(2242,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 15:31:38.000',1390,'AdCNo12902019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-08-19 15:37:24.880','','2019-08-19 15:37:24.881','','It has been observed that you have filed complaint seeking possession along with compensation on part of delayed possession. In light of the judgement dated 27.02.2019 of REAT your complaint is maintainable under form M as you want to stay in project. As per proviso section 18(1) where allottee does not intend to withdraw from the project, he can claim interest for delayed possession. kindly rectify the defects and modify your complaint and re submit immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-08-19 15:31:38.000','amlegalrera','2019-08-19 15:31:38.000'),(2243,440004,'999','2019-08-20 09:43:46.000',1409,'AdCNo13012019','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-08-20 09:43:46.000','999','2019-08-20 09:43:46.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-08-20 09:43:46.000','sysadmin','2019-08-20 09:43:46.000'),(2244,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-08-20 09:48:22.000',1409,'AdCNo13012019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-08-20 09:54:01.755','','2019-08-20 09:54:01.755','','You have filed complaint against Promoter of a registered project but in the list of respondents the name of Promoter who is recorded against registration number of the project is not included. Verify the same from List of Registered Projects available on website of authority and rectify the same. Rectify defects and re-submit complaint within 15 days from today otherwise complaint shall be forwarded to proceed with in accordance with law.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-08-20 09:48:22.000','amlegalrera','2019-08-20 09:48:22.000'),(2245,440053,'amlegalrera','2019-08-20 11:06:15.000',1036,'AdCNo10212018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-08-20 11:11:55.107','','2019-08-20 11:11:55.107','','Complaint was transferred by the Bench of Adjudicating officer of Authority to the bench of Chairperson vide orders dated 28.06.2019.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-08-20 11:06:15.000','amlegalrera','2019-08-20 11:06:15.000'),(2246,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-08-20 11:20:47.000',1404,'AdCNo12942019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-08-20 11:26:26.863','','2019-08-20 11:26:26.863','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned in the complaint and on the e-mail mentioned in the project file (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 09.10.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice  with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through e-mail, registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. Specific report from registration Branch. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.    \r\n(J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\n                                                                                                        RERA\r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-08-20 11:20:47.000','psmemberjsk','2019-08-20 11:20:47.000'),(2247,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-08-20 11:22:24.000',1394,'AdCNo12932019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-08-20 11:28:03.930','','2019-08-20 11:28:03.930','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint 