ost or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. Specific report from registration Branch. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date. Complainant shall also disclose about the pendency of complaint before any other Bench, if any.    \r\n(J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer\r\n                                                                                                        RERA\r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-09-13 15:56:35.000','psmemberjsk','2019-09-13 15:56:35.000'),(2438,440062,'amlegalrera','2019-09-13 15:57:34.000',1418,'AdCNo13092019','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-09-13 16:03:23.327','','2019-09-13 16:03:23.327','','You have not submitted the hard copies of the complaint. Submit hard copies of the complaint immediately otherwise the complaint shall be deal in accordance with law.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-09-13 15:57:34.000','amlegalrera','2019-09-13 15:57:34.000'),(2439,440058,'amlegalrera','2019-09-13 15:58:49.000',1425,'AdCNo13142019','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-09-13 16:04:38.421','','2019-09-13 16:04:38.421','','Notice to complainant to appear 30.10.2019 at 9.30 am, and supply copy of complaint and documents submitted online in two sets.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-09-13 15:58:49.000','amlegalrera','2019-09-13 15:58:49.000'),(2440,440058,'amlegalrera','2019-09-13 15:59:19.000',1430,'AdCNo13172019','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-09-13 16:05:07.562','','2019-09-13 16:05:07.562','','Notice to complainant to appear 30.10.2019 at 9.30 am, and supply copy of complaint and 