382','','Present -  	None\r\nComplaint received online and since the complaint has been received on line, therefore, it relates to a project registered with this authority. The complaint be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail as mentioned by the complainant and also mentioned in the project file and provided by the promoter (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copy of PDF file of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online, for 06.11.2019 with a direction to the respondent to appear and file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from receipt of notice with a direction to send a copy of reply and documents to the complainant through registered post, speed post or a reputed courier. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through e-mail address mentioned in the complaint with a direction to the complainant to file  similar sets (hard copies) of complaint as well as documents submitted online and the parties may be intimated telephonically on the available number if any. Specific report qua the fact that the plot/flat etc. falls in the project registered with this Authority be obtained from the registration branch. The file shall be taken up at 0930AM on that date.\r\n(J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer,\r\n                                                                                                         RERA \r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:02:47.000','psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:02:47.000'),(2642,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:30:03.000',1482,'AdCNo13532019UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-10-04 03:07:00.448','','2019-10-04 03:07:00.448','','Present 	None\r\nComplaint received online. It be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-mail (in case e-mail address not available then through registered/speed post) alongwith copies of documents enclosed with the complaint filed online for 06.11.2019 with a direction to the respondent to file reply to the complaint alongwith relevant documents if any within fifteen days from the date of service with an advance copy to the complainant atleast two days prior to the date fixed. Notice be also issued to the complainant or his counsel through the available e-mail address, if any and if e-mail address is not available or due to any reason if it is not possible, then to send notice to the complainant through registered/speed post with a direction to the complainant to file a similar set of complaint as well as documents submitted online. The parties may ensure the correctness of the registration of the project. A report be also obtained from the registration branch  of the Authority whether the project is registered one or unregistered. The file shall be taken up at 930AM on that date.\r\n(J.S. Khushdil)\r\nAdjudicating Officer, \r\nRERA 04.10.2019\r\n',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:30:03.000','psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:30:03.000'),(2643,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-10-04 15:31:16.000',1484,'AdCNo13522019UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-10-04 03:08:12.751','','2019-10-04 03:08:12.751','','As per mail received by complainant, the complaint was submitted by mistake as some modification is still required.Kindly re submit the complaint immediately after modifications as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-10-04 15:31:16.000','amlegalrera','2019-10-04 15:31:16.000'),(2644,440055,'psmemberjsk','2019-10-04 15:31:18.000',1489,'AdCNo13592019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-10-04 03:08:14.909','','2019-10-04 03:08:14.909','','Present 	None\r\nComplaint received online. It be registered. Now, notice be issued to the respondent through e-ma