ind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-05 13:03:48.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-05 13:03:48.000'),(3516,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2019-12-05 13:07:46.000',1568,'AdCNo14242019UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2019-12-05 13:14:54.683','','2019-12-05 13:14:54.683','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondent through E-mail/ Registered Speed Post for 23.12.2019 Respondent shall have to file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least 3 days.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2019-12-05 13:07:46.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2019-12-05 13:07:46.000'),(3517,440058,'amlegalrera','2019-12-05 13:09:35.000',1568,'AdCNo14242019UR','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-05 13:16:43.529','','2019-12-05 13:16:43.529','','Notice to complainant to appear 23.12.2019 , and supply copy of complaint and documents submitted online in two sets.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-05 13:09:35.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-05 13:09:35.000'),(3518,440059,'amlegalrera','2019-12-05 13:10:29.000',1568,'AdCNo14242019UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-05 13:17:37.793','','2019-12-05 13:17:37.793','','Notice to respondent to appear and file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least 3 days before date fixed.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-05 13:10:29.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-05 13:10:29.000'),(3519,440004,'999','2019-12-05 13:37:29.000',1595,'AdCNo14402019','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-12-05 13:37:29.000','999','2019-12-05 13:37:29.000','In Process',