','2019-12-17 10:07:27.005','','1. It is observed that you have incorporated and submitted the complaint in form \'N\' containing facts of complaint as a separate enclosure / Annexure-CA , same is not permissible. The facts have to be included only under the tab Complaint Details\" in the specified para for \'Facts of the case\' in the given space. The Facts of complaint cannot be included under other tab which meant for supporting documents as enclosures.\r\n2. Page numbers 63-68 is missing in your online complaint.whereas you have annexed it in your hard copy.\r\n3. Complaint is being filed through authorized representative, but power of attorney/ authorization letter has not been uploaded.\r\nKindly rectify defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-17 10:00:21.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-17 10:00:21.000'),(3627,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-12-17 10:25:31.000',1591,'AdCNo14612019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-17 10:32:37.297','','2019-12-17 10:32:37.297','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-17 10:25:31.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-17 10:25:31.000'),(3628,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-12-17 10:32:12.000',1494,'AdCNo13722019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-17 10:39:17.983','','2019-12-17 10:39:17.983','','As per email dated 17.12.2019 received with this Authority, the complainant\r\nwants to modify his complaint as earlier it was submitted by mistake.Kindly re submit your\r\ncomplaint immediately as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-17 10:32:12.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-17 10:32:12.000'),(3629,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2019-1