09:44:39.000'),(3709,440059,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 09:45:15.000',1664,'AdCNo14992019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-18 09:52:04.945','','2019-12-18 09:52:04.945','','Notice to respondent to appear and file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least 3 days before date fixed.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 09:45:15.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-18 09:45:15.000'),(3710,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:34:45.000',1501,'AdCNo13762019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-18 11:41:33.938','','2019-12-18 11:41:33.938','','You were requested to remove objections vide observations dated 10.12.2019 but you had re submitted your complaint on 16.12.2019 without removing objections. It has been observed that the hard copy of the complaint submitted is incomplete, as the online complaint has 58 pages whereby the one which has been submitted manually contains only 37 pages.Kindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:34:45.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:34:45.000'),(3711,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:39:03.000',1558,'AdCNo14212019UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-18 11:45:52.109','','2019-12-18 11:45:52.109','','You were required to remove objections vide observation dated 10.12.2019 but It has been observed that the complaint has been re submitted without removing objections.You had filed the present complaint through Authorize\r\nrepresentative but the vakalatnama/ Authority letter has not been uploaded. Kindly rectify the\r\ndefects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:39:03.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:39:03.000'),(3712,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:55:54.000',1562,'AdCNo14112019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-18 12:02:42.614','','2019-12-18 12:02:42.614','','You were requested to remove objections vide observations dated 29.11.2019 but you have resubmitted your complaint on 09.12.2019 without removing the objections. It has been observed that the relief\'s so claimed falls within the proviso to section 18(1). Since the allottee does not wish to withdraw from the project, hence the following  prayers can only be claimed under form \"M\".It is the Authority which can only deal with the matter falling under proviso to section 18(1). 2. The RERA Appellate Tribunal vide judgement dated 27.02.2019, passed in Appeal no-53 of 2019 has specifically stated at page number-44 of the judgement, that the matters arising under the proviso, cannot be placed before the Adjudicating Officer, but shall be placed entirely before the Authority. Kindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:55:54.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:55:54.000'),(3713,440007,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:59:24.000',1042,'AdCNo13602019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-18 12:06:13.226','','2019-12-18 12:06:13.226','','You were requested to remove objections vide observations dated 25.11.2019 but you have re submitted your complaint without removing objections.You are seeking compensation against delayed possession, whereas\r\ninterest for delayed possession, along with litigation expenses has already been granted to\r\nyou in complaint No-GC.1027.2018. Further the respondent was directed to comply the order\r\nwithin 60 days and you can file execution petition to execute the orders passed in the above\r\nsaid complaint after the expiry of above said time period.Accordingly you can withdraw this\r\ncomplaint and file an execution before the Authority.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:59:24.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-18 11:59:24.000'),(3714,440062,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 12:38:36.000',1569,'AdCNo14692019','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-18 12:45:24.289','','2019-12-18 12:45:24.289','','You have not submitted the hard copies of the complaint after re submitting your complaint on 17.12.2019. Kindly submit hard copies of the complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 12:38:36.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-18 12:38:36.000'),(3715,440001,'999','2019-12-18 14:20:59.000',1665,'AdCNo15012019','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-12-18 14:20:59.000','999','2019-12-18 14:20:59.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2019-12-18 14:20:59.000','sysadmin','2019-12-18 14:20:59.000'),(3716,440056,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 14:41:32.000',1569,'AdCNo14692019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-18 14:48:18.426','','2019-12-18 14:48:18.426','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant alleged violation of section 18 for non delivery of possession by respondent and has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2019-12-18 14:41:32.000','amlegalrera','2019-12-18 14:41:32.000'),(3717,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2019-12-18 14:42:35.000',1569,'AdCNo14692019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac778