7,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 12:51:14.000',1672,'AdCNo15062019UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-01-05 23:28:08.793','','2020-01-05 23:28:08.793','','You were required to remove objections but you have resubmitted your complaint without removing objections.It has been observed that the details of Respondent is wrongly filled, as you have filled complainant details in the tab of respondent. Kindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 12:51:14.000','amlegalrera','2020-01-06 12:51:14.000'),(3968,440056,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 12:55:43.000',1566,'AdCNo14192019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-01-05 23:32:37.106','','2020-01-05 23:32:37.106','','The complaint was returned to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017 vide observation dated 16.12.2019 but the complainant has disputed in the correctness of the defects pointed out. Complaint is put before the bench under Regulation 6(4) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017 for appropriate orders. Submitted for kind consideration and further directions please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 12:55:43.000','amlegalrera','2020-01-06 12:55:43.000'),(3969,440004,'999','2020-01-06 12:55:44.000',1679,'AdCNo15102019UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-01-06 12:55:44.000','999','2020-01-06 12:55:44.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-01-06 12:55:44.000','sysadmin','2020-01-06 12:55:44.000'),(3970,440004,'999','2020-01-06 13:18:15.000',1672,'AdCNo15062019UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-01-06 13:18:15.000','999','2020-01-06 13:18:15.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-01-06 13:18:15.000','sysadmin','2020-01-06 13:18:15.000'),(3971,440056,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:06:57.000',1558,'AdCNo14212019UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-01-06 00:43:50.698','','2020-01-06 00:43:50.699','','Fee and format checked which are in order. . The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:06:57.000','amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:06:57.000'),(3972,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:23:33.000',1682,'AdCNo15112019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-01-06 01:00:27.095','','2020-01-06 01:00:27.095','',' It has been observed that the relief\'s so claimed at point number  2 i.e Interest for delayed possession ,of the prayer, falls within the proviso to section 18(1), hence the above said prayer at point number  2 , can only be claimed under form \"M\".It is the Authority which can only deal with the matter falling under proviso to section 18(1). \r\n2. The RERA Appellate Tribunal vide judgement dated 27.02.2019, passed in Appeal no-53 of 2019 has specifically stated at page number-44 of the judgement, that the matters arising under the proviso, cannot be placed before the Adjudicating Officer, but shall be placed entirely before the Authority. \r\nKindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:23:33.000','amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:23:33.000'),(3973,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:34:27.000',1639,'AdCNo14842019UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-01-06 01:11:20.564','','2020-01-06 01:11:20.564','','It has been observed that you have filed complaint against the Real estate promoter but you have written the name of project instead the name of respondent under the Tab \" Particulars of respondent\" . Kindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:34:27.000','amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:34:27.000'),(3974,440056,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:43:37.000',1647,'AdCNo14882019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-01-06 01:20:30.106','','2020-01-06 01:20:30.106','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant alleged violation of section 18 for non delivery of possession by respondent and has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:43:37.000','amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:43:37.000'),(3975,440056,'amlegalrera','2020-01-06 14:49:15.000',1650,'AdCNo15002019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-01-06 01:26:08.822','','2020-01-06 01:26:08.822','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant alleged violation of section 18 for non delivery of possession by respondent and has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',