plaint against Promoter of a registered project but in the list of respondents the name of Promoter who is recorded against registration number of the project is not included. Verify the same from List of Registered Projects available on website of authority and rectify the same. Kindly Rectify defects and re-submit complaint within 15 days from today otherwise complaint shall be forwarded to proceed with in accordance with law.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 12:33:34.000','amlegalrera','2020-03-02 12:33:34.000'),(4481,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 12:35:37.000',1766,'AdCNo15602020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-03-02 12:35:41.024','','2020-03-02 12:35:41.024','','You have filed complaint against Promoter of a registered project but in the list of respondents the name of Promoter who is recorded against registration number of the project is not included. Verify the same from List of Registered Projects available on website of authority and rectify the same. Also the page numbering of Annexure 2 is incorrect.Kindly Rectify defects and re-submit complaint within 15 days from today otherwise complaint shall be forwarded to proceed with in accordance with law.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 12:35:37.000','amlegalrera','2020-03-02 12:35:37.000'),(4482,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 12:45:31.000',1754,'AdCNo15532020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-03-02 12:45:34.899','','2020-03-02 12:45:34.899','','1. It has been observed that the relief\'s so claimed at point number 1 and 2 of the prayer, falls within the proviso to section 18(1). Since the allottee does not wish to withdraw from the project, hence the following above said prayer at point number 1 ad 2 , can only be claimed under form \"M\".It is the Authority which can only deal with the matter falling under proviso to section 18(1). 2. The RERA Appellate Tribunal vide judgement dated 27.02.2019, passed in Appeal no-53 of 2019 has specifically stated at page number-44 of the judgement, that the matters arising under the proviso, cannot be placed before the Adjudicating Officer, but shall be placed entirely before the Authority. Kindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 12:45:31.000','amlegalrera','2020-03-02 12:45:31.000'),(4483,440056,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 13:31:13.000',1744,'AdCNo15552020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-03-02 13:31:17.258','','2020-03-02 13:31:17.258','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant alleged violation of section 18 for non delivery of possession by respondent and has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint has been submitted by complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 13:31:13.000','amlegalrera','2020-03-02 13:31:13.000'),(4484,440056,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 13:32:01.000',1745,'AdCNo15572020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-03-02 13:32:04.480','','2020-03-02 13:32:04.480','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant alleged violation of section 18 for non delivery of possession by respondent and has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint has been submitted by complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 13:32:01.000','amlegalrera','2020-03-02 13:32:01.000'),(4485,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 13:38:36.000',1748,'AdCNo15562020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-03-02 13:38:40.133','','2020-03-02 13:38:40.133','','As per email dated 02.03.2020 received with this Authority, the complainant wants to modify his complaint as earlier it was submitted by mistake.Kindly re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-03-02 13:38:36.000','amlegalrera','2020-03-02 13:38:36.000'),(4486,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2020-03-02 14:09:13.000',1744,'AdCNo15552020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2020-03-02 14:09:17.118','','2020-03-02 14:09:17.118','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondent through E-mail/ Registered Speed Post for 03.04.2020. Respondent shall have to file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2020-03-02 14:09:13.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2020-03-02 14:09:13.000'),(4487,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2020-03-02 14:11:48.000',1745,'AdCNo15572020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2020-03-02 14:11:51.617','','2020-03-02 14:11:51.617','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondent through E-mail/ Registered Speed Post for 03.04.2020. Respondent shall have to file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2020-03-02 14:11:48.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2020-03-02 14:11:48.000'),(4488,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2020-03-02 14:38:02.000',1533,'AdCNo13942019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2020-03-02 14:38:05.419','','2020-03-02 14:38:05.419','','Application for withdrawal has been receiv