'),(4687,440062,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 10:22:07.000',1799,'AdCNo15962020','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 10:22:08.386','','2020-05-08 10:22:08.386','','Hard Copy of the Complaint is required to be submitted for further necessary action.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 10:22:07.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 10:22:07.000'),(4688,440062,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 10:26:50.000',1807,'AdCNo16032020','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 10:26:51.293','','2020-05-08 10:26:51.293','','Hard Copy of the Complaint is required to be submitted for further necessary action.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 10:26:50.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 10:26:50.000'),(4689,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 10:32:33.000',1813,'AdCNo16022020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 10:32:34.452','','2020-05-08 10:32:34.452','','You have filed complaint against Promoter of a registered project, but in the list of respondents the name of Promoter which is recorded against the registration number of the project is not included. Verify the same from List of Registered Projects available on website of Authority and rectify the same. Kindly Rectify defects and re-submit complaint immediately.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 10:32:33.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 10:32:33.000'),(4691,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:11:50.000',1790,'AdCNo15862020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 11:11:51.433','','2020-05-08 11:11:51.433','','1. It has been observed that the relief\'s so claimed of the prayer, falls within the proviso to section 18(1). Since the allottee does not wish to withdraw from the project, hence the following above said prayers can only be claimed under form \"M\".It is the Authority which can only deal with the matter falling under proviso to section 18(1). 2. The RERA Appellate Tribunal vide judgement dated 27.02.2019, passed in Appeal no-53 of 2019 has specifically stated at page number-44 of the judgement, that the matters arising under the proviso, cannot be placed before the Adjudicating Officer, but shall be placed entirely before the Authority. 3. Kindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:11:50.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:11:50.000'),(4692,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:25:08.000',1680,'AdCNo15402020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 11:25:09.777','','2020-05-08 11:25:09.777','',' In the light of the Real Estate Appellate Tribunal  judgement dated 27.02.2019, passed in Appeal no-53 of 2019  It has been observed that the relief\'s so claimed in the prayer, at sr no 1 and 2 of your complaint for seeking various directions can only be filed before the Authority under form M. Kindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:25:08.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:25:08.000'),(4693,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:26:36.000',1723,'AdCNo15442020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 11:26:37.464','','2020-05-08 11:26:37.464','','It has been observed that you want to file complaint against promoter but you have selected \" Complaint against Allottee\". Further the name of Promoter which is recorded against registration number of the project is not included. Verify the same from List of Registered Projects available on website of authority and rectify the same. Kindly Rectify defects and re-submit complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:26:36.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:26:36.000'),(4694,440062,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:29:59.000',1642,'AdCNo14902019','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 11:30:01.011','','2020-05-08 11:30:01.011','','Hard Copy of the Complaint is required to be submitted for further necessary action.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:29:59.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:29:59.000'),(4695,440062,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:41:22.000',1824,'AdCNo16172020','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 11:41:23.761','','2020-05-08 11:41:23.761','','Hard Copy of the Complaint is required to be submitted for further necessary action.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:41:22.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:41:22.000'),(4696,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:46:18.000',1694,'AdCNo15382020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 11:46:19.871','','2020-05-08 11:46:19.871','','It has been observed that the complaint is being filed by the Authorized Representative, but the Tab (1.)(b) Particulars of the Authorized Representative/ Counsel details (Advocate or any other person) has been left blank. Kindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:46:18.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 11:46:18.000'),(4697,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:13:22.000',1730,'AdCNo15502020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 12:13:23.496','','2020-05-08 12:13:23.496','','You have filed complaint against Promoter of a registered project, but in the list of respondents the name of Promoter which is recorded against the registration number of the project is not included. Verify the same from List of Registered Projects available on website of Authority and rectify the same. Also in the facts of case Tab, No details of the case has been provided which is necessary for the adjudication of case, and relevant documents to be uploaded for supporting your case.Kindly Rectify defects and re-submit your complaint immediately as per Regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:13:22.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:13:22.000'),(4698,440062,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:26:26.000',1746,'AdCNo15542020','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 12:26:28.042','','2020-05-08 12:26:28.042','','Hard Copy of the Complaint is required to be submitted for further necessary action.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:26:26.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:26:26.000'),(4699,440062,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:30:28.000',1792,'AdCNo15762020','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 12:30:29.652','','2020-05-08 12:30:29.652','','Hard Copy of the Complaint is required to be submitted for further necessary action.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:30:28.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:30:28.000'),(4700,440062,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:46:56.000',1747,'AdCNo15822020','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 12:46:57.714','','2020-05-08 12:46:57.714','','Hard Copy of the Complaint is required to be submitted for further necessary action.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:46:56.000','amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:46:56.000'),(4701,440062,'amlegalrera','2020-05-08 12:47:37.000',1822,'AdCNo16162020','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-05-08 12:47:38.527','','2020-05-08 12:47:38.527','',