ted at page number-44 of the judgement, that the matters arising under the proviso, cannot be placed before the Adjudicating Officer, but shall be placed entirely before the Authority.Kindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:19:42.000','amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:19:42.000'),(5099,440058,'amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:21:52.000',1809,'AdCNo16082020','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-06-26 15:21:53.778','','2020-06-26 15:21:53.778','','Notice to complainant to appear 07.08.2020 at 10.00 am, and supply copy of complaint and documents submitted online in two sets.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:21:52.000','amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:21:52.000'),(5100,440058,'amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:22:08.000',1776,'AdCNo15832020','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-06-26 15:22:09.668','','2020-06-26 15:22:09.668','','Notice to complainant to appear 07.08.2020 at 10.00 am, and supply copy of complaint and documents submitted online in two sets.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:22:08.000','amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:22:08.000'),(5101,440058,'amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:22:25.000',1818,'AdCNo16142020','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-06-26 15:22:26.715','','2020-06-26 15:22:26.715','','Notice to complainant to appear 07.08.2020 at 10.00 am, and supply copy of complaint and documents submitted online in two sets.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:22:25.000','amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:22:25.000'),(5102,440058,'amlegalrera','2020-06-26 15:22:44.000',1821,'AdCNo16152020','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-06-26 15:22:45.840','','2020-06-26 15:22:45.840','','Notice to complainant to appear 07.08.2020 at 10.00 am, and supply copy of complaint and documents submitted online i