ordance with law.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-02 11:17:57.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-02 11:17:57.000'),(5209,440007,'legaladvrera','2020-07-02 22:45:12.000',1851,'AdCNo16272020TR-AUTH01042020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-02 22:45:13.131','','2020-07-02 22:45:13.131','','You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. Please rectify the same and resubmit.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2020-07-02 22:45:12.000','legaladvrera','2020-07-02 22:45:12.000'),(5210,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 13:04:49.000',1801,'AdCNo16232020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-03 13:04:51.006','','2020-07-03 13:04:51.006','','Complaint returned for removing of defects vide orders dated 01.07.2020',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 13:04:49.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-03 13:04:49.000'),(5211,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 14:13:16.000',1814,'AdCNo16042020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-03 14:13:17.834','','2020-07-03 14:13:17.834','','Complaint returned for removing of defects vide orders dated 01.07.2020',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 14:13:16.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-03 14:13:16.000'),(5212,440061,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 14:15:21.000',1789,'AdCNo15772020','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-03 14:15:22.865','','2020-07-03 14:15:22.865','','Notice issued to complainant for 20.07.2020 for Preliminary Hearing.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 14:15:21.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-03 14:15:21.000'),(5213,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 14:18:16.000',1714,'AdCNo15332020'