ferred to Authority by the Adjudicating Officer. Whereas complainant is seeking multiple reliefs including (i) To direct the opposite parties to remove all the structural defects and other defects in the apartment as mentioned in the complaint within 30 days and/ or in the alternative, for the payment of exemplary compensation to the Complainant in consonance with the spirit of Section 14(3) of the Act, 2016 (ii) To direct the Respondents to complete all the works as per the Apartment Buyer Agreement which was duly entered between the parties and the advertisement brochure.\r\n\r\nVide Order dated 01.07.2020 passed by the Adjudicating Officer, the Complainant was directed to appear before the Authority on 07.07.2020. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted by rotation for your kind consideration and necessary directions please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 16:40:53.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-03 16:40:53.000'),(5218,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 16:58:58.000',1881,'AdCNo16442020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-03 16:59:00.131','','2020-07-03 16:59:00.131','','It has been observed that complaint has been filed through the Authorised representative but Vakalatnama has not been uploaded in the list of enclosures in support of your complaint.Kindly rectify the defects and resubmit your complaint as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 16:58:58.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-03 16:58:58.000'),(5219,440056,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 16:59:43.000',1852,'AdCNo16282020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-03 16:59:45.350','','2020-07-03 16:59:45.350','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint has been submitted by complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-03 16:59:43.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-03 16:59:43.000'),(5220,440001,'999','2020-07-03 19:36:42.000',1900,'AdCNo16542020','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-07-03 19:36:42.000','999','2020-07-03 19:36:42.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-07-03 19:36:42.000','sysadmin','2020-07-03 19:36:42.000');
