ecked which are in order. The complainant  has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-21 11:36:32.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-21 11:36:32.000'),(5411,440056,'amlegalrera','2020-07-21 11:41:46.000',1916,'AdCNo16702020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-21 11:41:45.563','','2020-07-21 11:41:45.563','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant  has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-21 11:41:46.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-21 11:41:46.000'),(5412,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-07-21 12:29:55.000',1911,'AdCNo16622020UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-21 12:29:54.970','','2020-07-21 12:29:54.970','','As per Email dated 21.07.2020 received with this Authority, the complainant wants to modify his complaint as earlier it was submitted by mistake.Kindly re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-21 12:29:55.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-21 12:29:55.000'),(5413,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-07-21 15:50:36.000',1792,'AdCNo15762020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-21 15:50:35.361','','2020-07-21 15:50:35.361','','It is observed that you have also incorporated and submitted the complaint in form \'N\' containing facts of complaint as a separate enclosure / annexure at sr no 1. The facts as contained in \'Facts of the Case\' under the tab \"Complaint Details\" are 