 and A 63 with the hard copies of the present complaint submitted to this office. (vi) The Documents submitted by you shows that Plot Buyer Agreement for all plots executed separately between the parties. Accordingly, you are required to institute separate complaint for seeking relief for each plot. (vii) You have mentioned in relief \'...as per provided in the code\' (needs clarification about the code). Please clarify the position and resubmit accordingly.\r\n',2,0,'legaladvrera','2020-08-08 23:57:49.000','legaladvrera','2020-08-08 23:57:49.000'),(5531,440062,'legaladvrera','2020-08-09 09:44:21.000',1927,'AdCNo16742020TR-AUTH01092020','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-08-09 09:44:23.779','','2020-08-09 09:44:23.779','','Hard Copy of the Complaint in requisite number may be submitted.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2020-08-09 09:44:21.000','legaladvrera','2020-08-09 09:44:21.000'),(5533,440004,'999','2020-08-09 10:49:48.000',1887,'AdCNo16612020','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-08-09 10:49:48.000','999','2020-08-09 10:49:48.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-08-09 10:49:48.000','sysadmin','2020-08-09 10:49:48.000'),(5534,440004,'999','2020-08-09 11:19:53.000',1881,'AdCNo16442020TR-AUTH01072020','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-08-09 11:19:53.000','999','2020-08-09 11:19:53.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-08-09 11:19:53.000','sysadmin','2020-08-09 11:19:53.000'),(5535,440001,'999','2020-08-09 15:48:21.000',1964,'AdCNo16972020','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted b