,'Hard Copy of the Complaint is required to be submitted for further necessary action.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-09-02 10:09:06.000','amlegalrera','2020-09-02 10:09:06.000'),(5607,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-09-02 10:57:46.000',1989,'AdCNo17102020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-09-02 10:57:45.964','','2020-09-02 10:57:45.964','','1. It has been observed that the relief\'s so claimed at point number 1 and 2 of the prayer, falls within the proviso to section 18(1). Since the allottee does not wish to withdraw from the project, hence the following above said prayers at point number 1 and 2 , can only be claimed under form \"M\".It is the Authority which can only deal with the matter falling under proviso to section 18(1). 2. The RERA Appellate Tribunal vide judgement dated 27.02.2019, passed in Appeal no-53 of 2019 has specifically stated at page number-44 of the judgement, that the matters arising under the proviso, cannot be placed before the Adjudicating Officer, but shall be placed entirely before the Authority.Moreover the present complaint has been filed by the Authorised representative but the \"Tab (1.)(b) Particulars of the Authorized Representative/ Counsel details (Advocate or any other person), If complaint is filed through Authorized Representative/ Counsel, particulars thereof\" has been left blank and no details of Authorised representative has been filled. Kindly rectify the defects and re submit your complaint immediately as per regulations.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-09-02 10:57:46.000','amlegalrera','2020-09-02 10:57:46.000'),(5608,440056,'amlegalrera','2020-09-02 11:04:39.000',1913,'AdCNo16632020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-09-02 11:04:39.120','','2020-09-02 11:04:39.120','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant has sought refund , interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint have been called from complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-09-02 11:04:39.000','amlegalrera','2020-09-02 11:04:39.000'),(5609,440001,'999','2020-09-02 12:02:04.000',2000,'AdCNo17222020','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-02 12:02:04.000','999','2020-09-02 12:02:04.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-02 12:02:04.000','sysadmin','2020-09-02 12:02:04.000'),(5610,440001,'999','2020-09-02 16:02:11.000',1915,'AdCNo17232020','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-02 16:02:11.000','999','2020-09-02 16:02:11.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-02 16:02:11.000','sysadmin','2020-09-02 16:02:11.000'),(5611,440001,'999','2020-09-02 17:18:27.000',2002,'AdCNo17242020','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-02 17:18:27.000','999','2020-09-02 17:18:27.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-02 17:18:27.000','sysadmin','2020-09-02 17:18:27.000'),(5612,440004,'999','2020-09-02 18:46:31.000',1989,'AdCNo17102020','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-02 18:46:31.000','999','2020-09-02 18:46:31.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-02 18:46:31.000','sysadmin','2020-09-02 18:46:31.000'),(5613,440053,'legaladvrera','2020-09-03 09:30:03.000',1934,'AdCNo16812020TR-AUTH01082020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-09-03 09:30:03.698','','2020-09-03 09:30:03.698','','Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant alleged that there exists a delay or failure in providing possession of plot number A 62 by the Promoter i.e. \'Ansal Properties and Infrastructure Limited\' in the project \'Golflinks -II\'. The Complainant sought relief that the respondent may be directed that the Ops or Promoter to pay the interest for all those years and months for which such delay is done by the Ops or Promoter in giving possession. The same falls under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016. Further, the Complainant sought other reliefs for deficiency in service, opportunity cost and pay back general maintenance charged from the Allottee with interest, on account of delay in providing all the amenities or services promised to the Allottee, etc. The Complainant alleged that the Promoter has violated the provisions of sections 7, 11, 12, 14, 16, 17, 18, 63 and 69 of the RERA (REAL ESTATE REGULATION AND DEVELOPMENT) ACT, 2016. Earlier, complaints of similar project registration were entrusted to this bench of Authority. Accordingly, the present complaint is entrusted to this Bench of Authority for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2020-09-03 09:30:03.000','legaladvrera','2020-09-03 09:30:03.000'),(5614,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-09-03 13:56:46.000',1987,'AdCNo17172020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-09-03 13:56:46.995','','2020-09-03 13:56:46.995','','It has been observed that the documents uploaded in \"List of Enclosures/ Document(s) in support of the complaint (Form-N) Details\" at Sr no.7 i.e emails to company is showing 0 number of pages in your complaint whereas you have uploaded 13 pages.Further the hard copies of your complaint which has been received with this Authority vide Diary no.2772 dated 02.09.2020 are also incomplete as you were required to submit two sets of hard copies ( one for the bench and other for the respondent) but you have supplied only one and that too without index.Kindly rectify your defects immediately and resubmit your complaint immediately as per Regulations. After re submitting online complaint supply hard copies in two sets.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-09-03 13:56:46.000','amlegalrera','2020-09-03 13:56:46.000'),(5615,440001,'999','2020-09-04 11:26:33.000',2006,'AdCNo17252020','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-04 11:26:33.000','999','2020-09-04 11:26:33.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-04 11:26:33.000','sysadmin','2020-09-04 11:26:33.000'),(5616,440001,'999','2020-09-04 15:34:39.000',2001,'AdCNo17262020','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-04 15:34:39.000','999','2020-09-04 15:34:39.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-04 15:34:39.000','sysadmin','2020-09-04 15:34:39.000'),(5617,440055,'chairperson','2020-09-04 15:53:19.000',1934,'AdCNo16812020TR-AUTH01082020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2020-09-04 15:53:20.714','','2020-09-04 15:53:20.714','','Notice be issued to respondent no 1, asking for a reply (with a copy to the complainant) within 15 days of the receipt of notice, and to appear on 13.10.20 at 2.30 pm. Complainant to be also present at this hearing.',2,0,'chairperson','2020-09-04 15:53:19.000','chairperson','2020-09-04 15:53:19.000'),(5618,440001,'999','2020-09-04 19:10:49.000',2013,'AdCNo17272020','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-04 19:10:49.000','999','2020-09-04 19:10:49.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-04 19:10:49.000','sysadmin','2020-09-04 19:10:49.000'),(5619,440001,'999','2020-09-05 09:32:05.000',2012,'AdCNo17282020','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-05 09:32:05.000','999','2020-09-05 09:32:05.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-05 09:32:05.000','sysadmin','2020-09-05 09:32:05.000'),(5620,440001,'999','2020-09-07 09:30:30.000',2014,'AdCNo17292020','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-07 09:30:30.000','999','2020-09-07 09:30:30.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-07 09:30:30.000','sysadmin','2020-09-07 09:30:30.000'),(5621,440001,'999','2020-09-07 10:49:10.000',2005,'AdCNo17302020UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-07 10:49:10.000','999','2020-09-07 10:49:10.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-07 10:49:10.000','sysadmin','2020-09-07 10:49:10.000'),(5622,440007,'amlegalrera','2020-09-07 11:21:36.000',1999,'AdCNo17202020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0