ind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n\r\n',2,0,'legaladvrera','2020-10-06 23:04:09.000','legaladvrera','2020-10-06 23:04:09.000'),(6024,440059,'amlegalrera','2020-10-07 13:33:35.000',1923,'AdCNo16762020UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-10-07 13:33:35.430','','2020-10-07 13:33:35.430','','Notice to respondent to appear and file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least 3 days before date fixed.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-10-07 13:33:35.000','amlegalrera','2020-10-07 13:33:35.000'),(6025,440059,'amlegalrera','2020-10-07 13:41:49.000',1859,'AdCNo16572020UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-10-07 13:41:49.071','','2020-10-07 13:41:49.071','','Notice to respondent to appear and file reply within 15 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least 3 days before date fixed.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-10-07 13:41:49.000','amlegalrera','2020-10-07 13:41:49.000'),(6026,440058,'amlegalrera','2020-10-07 13:55:51.000',1820,'AdCNo16182020','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-10-07 13:55:51.758','','2020-10-07 13:55:51.758','','Notice to complainant to appear and for the purpose already fixed.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-10-07 13:55:51.000','amlegalrera','2020-10-07 13:55:51.000'),(6027,440059,'amlegalrera','2020-10-07 14:02:18.000',1520,'AdCNo14032019UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-10-07 14:02:18.102','','2020-10-07 14:02:18.102','','Notice to respondent to appear and file reply within 10 days of service of notice with advance copy to complainant at least 3 days before date fixed.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2020-10-07 14:02:18.000','amlegalrera','2020-10-07 14:02:18.000'),(6028,440004,'999','2020-10-07 14:02:18.000',2046,'AdCNo17542020','Application Re-Submission(M