:46:22.632','','2021-01-11 15:46:22.632','','Fee and Format of the present Complaint checked. Requisite number of Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L).The complainant seeks following reliefs. 1.To restore the Unit , Food Court Unit No. FC11, Super area 808 ft of the complainants and complainants will make the payment of Rs.12,44,565/- within a period of one month from the date of order and balance payment of the Unit shall be made at the time of delivery of the possession.\r\n\r\n2. In alternative this Honble Court may deem fit on the facts and circumstances of the case direct the respondents to refund the amount of Rs.8,55,435/- along with interest at12 percent per annum from the date of deduction till the date of payment.\r\n\r\n3. Complainant reserves his right to claim compensation after the decision of the present complaint.\r\n4. Costs of the complaint may also be allowed to the tune of Rs.50,000/-.Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted before the Authority for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-01-11 15:46:18.000','amlegalrera','2021-01-11 15:46:18.000'),(6617,440008,'amlegalrera','2021-01-11 16:00:00.000',2092,'AdCNo17892020TR-AUTH01622020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-11 16:00:04.257','','2021-01-11 16:00:04.257','','Fee and Format of the present Complaint checked. Requisite number of Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L).The complainant seeks following reliefs. \r\n\r\n1. Respondent be directed to handover possession to complainant at the earliest after obtaining Occupation and Completion certificate from Competent Authority .\r\n\r\n2. Direct respondent to pay interest for delay of 6 months in execution of buyers agreement from date of Booking on amounts paid(1476448) at rate of 18% ( said being rate at which builder charges for delay).\r\n\r\n3. Respondent be directed to pay interest at 18% on total amounts paid so far ( Rs. 70,87,455/- ) from due date of delivery (11.03.2019) till physical possession of apartment is handed over .  \r\n\r\n4. Respondent be directed to produce /supply Approved drawings of the Apartment along with calculations justifying Super Area of 1920 sq ft..\r\n\r\n5. Respondent be directed to produce layout plans of project existing at the time of booking as well as approved by competent authorities . Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted before the Authority for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-01-11 16:00:00.000','amlegalrera','2021-01-11 16:00:00.000'),(6618,440008,'amlegalrera','2021-01-11 16:02:40.000',2041,'AdCNo17502020TR-AUTH01552020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-11 16:02:44.601','','2021-01-11 16:02:44.601','','Fee and Format of the present Complaint checked. Requisite number of Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L).The complainant seeks following reliefs.\r\n\r\n That on account of default of respondent in complying with his duty to handover possession in accordance with terms and conditions of agreement and thus being in violation of Section 18 of RERA, Applicant may kindly be refunded his paid amount (Rs.22,50,000/-) with interest as per rules from the date of deposit till payment, for misusing of money of applicant by respondent.\r\n\r\nAccordingly, the present Complaint is submitted before the Authority for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-01-11 16:02:40.000','amlegalrera','2021-01-11 16:02:40.000'),(6619,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-01-13 11:42:25.000',2124,'AdCNo18112020','','','Authority Desk