 Level I','2021-01-25 21:44:46.000','999','2021-01-25 21:44:46.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-01-25 21:44:46.000','sysadmin','2021-01-25 21:44:46.000'),(6711,440004,'999','2021-01-26 21:00:26.000',2104,'AdCNo17972020','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-01-26 21:00:26.000','999','2021-01-26 21:00:26.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-01-26 21:00:26.000','sysadmin','2021-01-26 21:00:26.000'),(6712,440004,'999','2021-01-27 09:34:34.000',1509,'AdCNo13752019UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-01-27 09:34:34.000','999','2021-01-27 09:34:34.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-01-27 09:34:34.000','sysadmin','2021-01-27 09:34:34.000'),(6713,440008,'amlegalrera','2021-01-27 10:03:02.000',2073,'AdCNo17732020TR-AUTH01142020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-27 10:03:02.291','','2021-01-27 10:03:02.291','','Fee and Format of the present Complaint checked. Requisite number of Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L).\r\nThe complainant seeks following reliefs \r\n(i) That  the Developers should   hand  over the possession of    above mentioned Office space after completing the  specification as    mentioned in their office letter dated 27 Nov 2015  in fully  finished  condition along with various amenities mentioned in the prospect and with all necessary document as per RERA act.\r\n\r\n (ii)        That the Developers should compensate the loss occurred  to the   complainant  due to delay in possession of Office space in fully  finished condition as per sale agreement  under the  provision  of   section 19 sub section 4 of RERA Act 2016.\r\n\r\n(iii)       That due to the act and conduct of the Developers complainant   have  suffered a great deal of financial loss and mental agony, harassment, torture for which developers are liable to compensate by  paying  Rs 200000 (Rupees Two Lacs Only) to the complainant under section 12 of RERA Act 2016.\r\n\r\n(vi)     To impose penalty as per section 38 (I) and section 61 of RERA Act 2016 on  Developers for failing to complete the project  along with various amenities.\r\nAccordingly, the present Complaint is submitted before the Authority for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-01-27 10:03:02.000','amlegalrera','2021-01-27 10:03:02.000'),(6714,440008,'sysadmin','2021-01-18 11:06:04.000',1881,'AdCNo16442020TR-AUTH01072020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-27 11:06:04.118','','2021-01-27 11:06:04.118','','In light of judgment dated 16.10.2020 passed by Hon\'ble Punjab and Haryana High Court in \'Janta Land Promoters Pvt Ltd Vs Union of India and others bearing CWP No. 8548 of 2020\' and other connected matters, the present complaint has been transferred from Adjudicating Officer to \'Authority\'.',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-01-18 11:06:04.000','sysadmin','2021-01-18 11:06:04.000'),(6715,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-01-27 11:24:38.000',2032,'AdCNo17472020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-27 11:24:38.181','','2021-01-27 11:24:38.181','','Fee and format checked which are in order. The complainant has sought refund of amount, interest thereon and compensation. The hard copies of the complaint has been submitted by complainant. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'am