)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-01-30 20:15:53.000','999','2021-01-30 20:15:53.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-01-30 20:15:53.000','sysadmin','2021-01-30 20:15:53.000'),(6788,440008,'amlegalrera','2021-02-01 11:13:11.000',2144,'AdCNo00072021TR-AUTH00062021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-02-01 11:13:14.674','','2021-02-01 11:13:14.674','','Fee and Format of the present Complaint checked. Requisite number of Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The complainant seeks following reliefs \r\n1.  To Direct Respondent to give the possession of the said apartment in liveable condition after completing all the repair and maintenance work along with the occupancy/completion certificate.\r\n2. Direct the respondent to give the possession of said apartment along with the delayed interest  from the date when the possession was to be delivered to the complainant, to accord due compensation for the financial agony suffered by the Complainant.\r\n\r\n3. To Direct the Respondent to not further demand the balance amount from the complainants till the final possession is given to the complainants of the said apartment in liveable condition along with the occupancy/completion certificate.\r\n\r\n4. To Direct the Respondent to pay compensation of Rs. 10,00,000/- on account of harassment and mental agony caused to the Complainant on account of deficiency in service and unfair trade practices.\r\n\r\n5. Direct the respondent to pay Rs. 30,000 towards litigation expenses for dragging complainant in filing of the present complaint.\r\n Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted before the Authority for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-02-01 11:13:11.000','amlegalrera','2021-02-01 11:13:11.000'),(6789,440008,'sysadmin','2021-01-18 10:54:06.000',2040,'AdCNo17492020URTR-AUTH01512020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-02-02 10:54:06.049','','2021-02-02 10:54:06.049','','In light of judgment dated 16.10.2020 passed by Hon\'ble Punjab and Haryana High Court in \'Janta Land Promoters Pvt Ltd Vs Union of India and others bearing CWP No. 8548 of 2020\' and other connected matters, the present complaint has been transferred from Adjudicating Officer to \'Authority\'.',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-01-18 10:54:06.000','sysadmin','2021-01-18 10:54:06.000'),(6790,440008,'sysadmin','2021-01-18 10:54:51.000',1670,'AdCNo15042019TR-AUTH01412020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-02-02 10:54:50.767','','2021-02-02 10:54:50.767','','In light of judgment dated 16.10.2020 passed by Hon\'ble Punjab and Haryana High Court in \'Janta Land Promoters Pvt Ltd Vs Union of India and others bearing CWP No. 8548 of 2020\' and other connected matters, the present complaint has been transferred from Adjudicating Officer to \'Authority\'.',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-01-18 10:54:51.000','sysadmin','2021-01-18 10:54:51.000'),(6791,440008,'sysadmin','2021-01-18 10:55:35.000',1542,'AdCNo13982019TR-AUTH01492020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-02-02 10:55:34.486','','2021-02-02 10:55:34.486','','In light of judgment dated 16.10.2020 passed by Hon\'ble Punjab and Haryana High Court in \'Janta Land Promoters Pvt Ltd Vs Union of India and others bearing CWP No. 8548 of 2020\' and other connected matters, the present complaint has been transferred from Adjudicating Officer to \'Authority\'.',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-01-18 10:55:35.000','sysadmin','2021-01-18 10:55:35.000'),(6792,440008,'sysadmin','2021-01-18 10:56:15.000',1450,'AdCNo13572019TR