nf. Demolish the unauthorized structure. \r\ng. Install lifts from basement to stilt as per layout plan near T02, T07.\r\nh. Adhere NBC  GST norms.\r\nFurther complainant seeks various directions\r\na. Appoint the Amicus Curie for the Ground Survey Report  to penalize the respondent for violations of RERA.\r\nb. Conduct the Audit of OPs accounts for actual funds flow.\r\nc. Verify the physical existence of the registered office of the OP.\r\nd. Appoint an administrator to supervise the project until it completes as per RERA.\r\ne. Provide other reliefs that this Honble Authority may deem fit and appropriate.\r\nf. Start recharging of prepaid power backup and to delink it from maintenance payment and any amount limit.\r\nAccordingly, the present Complaint is submitted before the Authority for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-02-04 10:51:47.000','amlegalrera','2021-02-04 10:51:47.000'),(6841,440008,'amlegalrera','2021-02-04 10:57:29.000',2097,'AdCNo17912020TR-AUTH01602020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-02-04 10:57:30.205','','2021-02-04 10:57:30.205','','Fee and Format of the present Complaint checked. Requisite number of Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex-L.The complainant seeks following reliefs \r\na. Develop the project periphery  amenities as shown in different media.\r\nb. Cover the adjoining GANDA NALLA immediately. \r\nc. Fix all the defects in permanent nature immediately.\r\nd. Compensate  against advance paid amounts being delay and  deficiency in delivery and services.\r\ne. Compensate  by Rs 1.5 Cr against harassment, Breach of Trust, Failure to provide ontime possession of flat and covered car parking.\r\nf. Demolish the unauthorized structure. \r\ng. Install lifts from basement to stilt as per layout plan near T02, T07.\r\nh. Adhere NBC  GST 