Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations, 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated as also specify your relief. Further, you sought directions to the respondents to pay 10 per cent of the total estimated cost of the project under section 59 of Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016 while the project is already registered under the Act. Please clarify the position. Kindly Rectify the defects and re-submit the complaint at the earliest alongwith its hard copies.\r\n\r\n',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-03-05 18:17:25.000','legaladvrera','2021-03-05 18:17:25.000'),(7066,440004,'999','2021-03-10 14:48:18.000',2172,'AdCNo00302021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-03-10 14:48:18.000','999','2021-03-10 14:48:18.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-03-10 14:48:18.000','sysadmin','2021-03-10 14:48:18.000'),(7067,440004,'999','2021-03-10 17:40:02.000',2160,'AdCNo00202021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-03-10 17:40:02.000','999','2021-03-10 17:40:02.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-03-10 17:40:02.000','sysadmin','2021-03-10 17:40:02.000'),(7068,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-03-15 11:34:32.000',2178,'AdCNo00372021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-03-15 11:34:34.591','','2021-03-15 11:34:34.591','','Fee and Format of the present Complaint checked. Requisite number of Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant alleged that the Respondents have made violations under Section 12, 13 and 14 of RERA Act, 2016.The complainant has sought refund, interest thereon, compensation and Litigation charges. The Complainant further seeks directions that the Respondent be directed to pay unpaid assured return till the time of Payment which was promised and not paid by the Respondent with interest. The Complainant alleged that the Registration of the Respondent should be Revoked as Per Section 7 of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016.  Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-03-15 11:34:32.000','legaladvrera','2021-03-15 11:34:32.000'),(7069,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-03-15 12:20:40.000',2178,'AdCNo00372021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-03-15 12:20:42.982','','2021-03-15 12:20:42.982','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 19.04.2021. Respondent shall file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  The complainant be also informed about the next date of hearing and its purpose through any mode of communication.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-03-15 12:20:40.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-03-15 12:20:40.000'),(7070,440058,'exclegalrera','2021-03-15 16:46:55.000',2178,'AdCNo00372021','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-03-15 16:46:57.575','','2021-03-15 16:46:57.575','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 19.04.2021 as per directions.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2021-03-15 16:46:55.000','exclegalrera','2021-03-15 16:46:55.000'),(7071,440059,'exclegalrera','2021-03-15 16:47:38.000',2178,'AdCNo00372021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-03-15 16:47:41.388','','2021-03-15 16:47:41.388','','Notice to Respondent to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 19.04.2021 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2021-03-15 16:47:38.000','exclegalrera','2021-03-15 16:47:38.000'),(7072,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-03-16 14:03:29.000',2096,'AdCNo17902020TR-AUTH01582020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-03-16 14:03:28.310','','2021-03-16 14:03:28.310','','The Complaint relates to the project i.e. The Hermitage Park and has been filed against the PARADIGM Business Ventures. Fee and Format of the present Complaint checked. Requisite number of Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex-L. Complainant alleged that Possession of the Flat has been taken by the Complainant but various violations have been made by the Respondent. In compliance to the directions given on 11.02.2021, Complainant was asked to mention each of the alleged violations in relation to the particular Section that has been contravened as also to comply with as stipulated in Regulation 4 (2) of the Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations, 2017. Now, Complainant has resubmitted his Complaint mentioning the relevant sections of the Act and seeks various directions/reliefs. Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted before the Authority for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-03-16 14:03:29.000','legaladvrera','2021-03-16 14:03:29.000'),(7073,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-03-16 14:08:32.000',2097,'AdCNo17912020TR-AUTH01602020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','733