ot been laid down or specified for any violation or contravention against the Promoter/Respondent(s). You have filed complaint against Promoter of a registered project but in the list of respondents the name of Promoter who is recorded against registration number of the project is not included. Verify the same from List of Registered Projects available on website of authority and rectify the same. Further you have uploaded documents in one file.  Upload all documents separately.  Rectify defects and re-submit complaint within 15 days otherwise complaint shall be forwarded to proceed with in accordance with law.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-16 08:35:16.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-16 08:35:16.000'),(7204,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-04-16 08:52:54.000',2200,'AdCNo00492021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-16 08:52:55.488','','2021-04-16 08:52:55.488','','The present Complaint is about a plot allotted to the Complainant in an unregistered project \" Surya Enclave Extension\" and has been filed against \"Jalandhar Improvement Trust\".  Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L).  The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount along with compensation / interest and litigation cost. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-16 08:52:54.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-16 08:52:54.000'),(7205,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-04-16 09:26:45.000',2202,'AdCNo00512021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-16 09:26:46.284','','2021-04-16 09:26:46.284','','The present Complaint is about a apartment allotted to the Complainant in a RERA registered project and has been filed against \"Parkwood Developers Pvt. Ltd.\". Hard Copies of the Co