ied with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount along with interest, compensation, litigation cost and penalty. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 02:15:23.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-19 02:15:23.000'),(7247,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 02:48:42.000',2104,'AdCNo17972020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-19 02:48:45.120','','2021-04-19 02:48:45.120','','The present Complaint alleges that a plot in a RERA registered project \" Dream City Khanna\" was allotted to the Complainant. The Complaint has been filed against \" AIPL Housing and Urban Infrastructure Limited\". Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Complainant prays for the compensation qua with regard to failure of Respondents to discharge the obligations imposed on him under the Act under section 14 and 18 (3). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 02:48:42.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-19 02:48:42.000'),(7248,440001,'999','2021-04-19 12:56:47.000',2237,'AdCNo00752021','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-04-19 12:56:47.000','999','2021-04-19 12:56:47.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-04-19 12:56:47.000','sysadmin','2021-04-19 12:56:47.000'),(7249,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 13:00:24.000',2189,'AdCNo00442021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-19 13:00:27.917','','2021-04-19 13:00:27.917','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) Under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the RERA Act, if an allottee wants to stay in the project for taking possession, he can seek interest as per Rules on the deposited amount for the delayed period in handing over of possession and for that cause of action and relief, complainant is required to file complaint under Form M with Authority. (ii) In terms of Section 71 of the Act, the power lies with the Adjudicating Officer for the purpose of adjudging compensation in Form N, please clarify (iii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. (iv) Last page of Hard copy of the complaint received is missing and signature of complainant is not affixed on the complaint. (v) Page number not marked on the annexures of the complaint. (vi) Uploaded Annexure i.e Apartment Allottee arrangement contains 37 pages but Page Number mentioned at Sr. No. 9 of the Form reveals 25 pages. (vii) Copy of Vakaltnama has not been uploaded on the portal. (viii) Relief of litigation expenses has been sought in question form. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n\r\n',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 13:00:24.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-19 13:00:24.000'),(7250,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 13:24:09.000',2190,'AdCNo00452021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-19 13:24:12.651','','2021-04-19 13:24:12.651','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) Under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the RERA Act, if an allottee wants to stay in the project for taking possession, he can seek interest as per Rules on the deposited amount for the delayed period in handing over of possession and for that cause of action and relief, complainant is required to file complaint under Form M with Authority. (ii) In terms of Section 71 of the Act, the power lies with the Adjudicating Officer for the purpose of adjudging compensation in Form N, please clarify (iii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. (iv) The Complaint has not been signed by the complainant. (v) Page number not marked on the annexures of the complaint. (vi) Copy of Vakaltnama has not been uploaded on the portal. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 13:24:09.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-19 13:24:09.000'),(7251,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 15:00:56.000',2218,'AdCNo00612021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-19 15:00:59.698','','2021-04-19 15:00:59.698','','As per your request received through email dated 19.04.2021, the complaint is returned for rectification therein. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 15:00:56.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-19 15:00:56.000'),(7252,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 15:49:39.000',2196,'AdCNo00482021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-19 15:49:43.167','','2021-04-19 15:49:43.167','','As per your request received through email dated 19.04.2021, the complaint is returned for modification therein. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-19 15:49:39.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-19 15:49:39.000'),(7253,440