ected to ensure that necessary formalities for transfer\r\nof the case are completed before the next date of hearing. Accordingly, the case is submitted\r\nbefore the Learned Adjudicating Officer for kind consideration and further proceedings',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-22 14:27:26.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-22 14:27:26.000'),(7270,440054,'exclegalrera','2021-04-22 14:53:37.000',1293,'AdCNo12162019TR-AUTH01442020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-22 14:53:37.964','','2021-04-22 14:53:37.964','','Complaint dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 09.04.2021.',1,0,'exclegalrera','2021-04-22 14:53:37.000','exclegalrera','2021-04-22 14:53:37.000'),(7271,440054,'exclegalrera','2021-04-22 14:54:50.000',1294,'AdCNo12172019TR-AUTH01432020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-22 14:54:50.698','','2021-04-22 14:54:50.698','','Complaint dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 09.04.2021.',1,0,'exclegalrera','2021-04-22 14:54:50.000','exclegalrera','2021-04-22 14:54:50.000'),(7272,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-04-22 17:17:59.000',2214,'AdCNo00582021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-04-22 17:17:59.870','','2021-04-22 17:17:59.870','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 25.05.2021. Respondent shall file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  The complainant be also informed about the next date of hearing and its purpose through any mode of communication.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-04-22 17:17:59.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-04-22 17:17:59.000'),(7273,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-04-22 17:19:03.000',2104,'AdCNo17972020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-04-22 17:19:04.058','','2021-04-22 17:19:04.058','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 25.05.2021. Respondent shall file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  The complainant be also informed about the next date of hearing and its purpose through any mode of communication.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-04-22 17:19:03.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-04-22 17:19:03.000'),(7274,440063,'legaladvrera','2021-04-22 18:59:42.000',2184,'AdCNo00532021','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-22 18:59:43.573','','2021-04-22 18:59:43.573','','The Complainant sought interest interest for period of delay in delivery of possession. Accordingly, in terms of Circular No. RERA/Pb/LEGAL/24 dated 05.03.2021, the case is to be heard by the Authority.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-22 18:59:42.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-22 18:59:42.000'),(7275,440064,'legaladvrera','2021-04-22 19:00:42.000',2184,'AdCNo00532021TR-AUTH00232021','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Role Authority Desk','NA','2021-04-22 19:00:42.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-22 19:00:42.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-22 19:00:42.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-22 19:00:42.000'),(7276,440004,'999','2021-04-22 19:16:57.000',2195,'AdCNo00472021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-04-22 19:16:57.000','999','2021-04-22 19:16