17:40:27.379','','During the course of the hearing held on 26.04.2021,  it was directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant with the direction to rectify the defects in the online complaint within three days and hard copy of the same be also submitted on or before 01.06.2021. Accordingly, the complaint is returned for the compliance of the above order within stipulated time. You may consult the Legal Branch of the Authority in case of any assistance/clarification required.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-27 17:40:28.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-27 17:40:28.000'),(7287,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-04-27 17:47:39.000',2195,'AdCNo00472021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-27 17:47:39.332','','2021-04-27 17:47:39.332','','The present Complaint is about a flat allotted to the Complainant in a RERA registered project \"ATS Casa Espana\" and the same has been filed against \" ATS INFRABUILD PRIVATE LIMITED\". Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-27 17:47:39.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-27 17:47:39.000'),(7288,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-04-28 12:03:10.000',2195,'AdCNo00472021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-04-28 12:03:10.645','','2021-04-28 12:03:10.645','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 28.05.2021. Respondent shall file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  The complainant be also informed about the next date of hearing and its purpose through any mode of communication.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-04-28 12:03:10.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-04-28 12:03:10.000'),(7289,440001,'999','2021-04-29 12:19:33.000',2249,'AdCNo00842021','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-04-29 12:19:33.000','999','2021-04-29 12:19:33.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-04-29 12:19:33.000','sysadmin','2021-04-29 12:19:33.000'),(7290,440055,'pschairperson','2021-04-29 12:30:10.000',1639,'AdCNo14842019URTR-AUTH01522020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2021-04-29 12:30:11.098','','2021-04-29 12:30:11.098','','As per order dated 19.04.2021 complaint has been transferred to A.O for further proceedings on 04.05.2021 at 10.30 AM. Accordingly Legal Branch is directed to completed the formalities for transfer of case.',2,0,'pschairperson','2021-04-29 12:30:10.000','pschairperson','2021-04-29 12:30:10.000'),(7291,440063,'legaladvrera','2021-04-29 13:16:38.000',1639,'AdCNo14842019URTR-AUTH01522020','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-29 13:16:39.551','','2021-04-29 13:16:39.551','','During the Course of the hearing held on 19.04.2021, complaint has been transferred to Adjudicating Officer and parties were directed to appear before the Adjudicating Officer for\r\nfurther proceedings on 04.05.2021 at 10.30 AM. Legal Branch was directed to ensure that necessary formalities for transfer of the case are completed before the next date.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-29 13:16:38.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-29 13:16:38.000'),(7292,440064,'legaladvrera','2021-04-29 13:18:23.000',1639,'AdCNo14842019URTR','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Role Authority Desk','NA','2021-04-29 13:18:23.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-29 13:18:23.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-29 13:18:23.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-29 13:18:23.000'),(7293,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-04-29 13:24:28.000',1639,'AdCNo14842019URTR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-29 13:24:28.941','','2021-04-29 13:24:28.941','','During the Course of the hearing held on 19.04.2021, the Authority observed that relief claimed in the complaint is refund of money deposited by the complainant alongwith interest and compensation, this matter is to be dealt with by the Adjudicating Officer in terms of Circular No. RERA/Pb/LEGAL/24 dated 05.03.2021. Parties were directed to appear before the Adjudicating Officer  on 04.05.2021 at 10.30 AM for\r\nfurther proceedings. Accordingly, the complaint is transferred to Adjudicating Officer for kind consideration and further proceedings please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-29 13:24:28.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-29 13:24:28.000'),(7294,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-04-29 14:03:18.000',2224,'AdCNo00702021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-29 14:03:19.129','','2021-04-29 14:03:19.129','','As per your request received through email dated 27.04.2021, the complaint  is unlocked for rectification.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-29 14:03:18.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-29 14:03:18.000'),(7295,440004,'999','2021-04-29 14:45:17.000',2224,'AdCNo00702021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-04-29 14:45:17.000','999','2021-04-29 14:45:17.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-04-29 14:45:17.000','sysadmin','2021-04-29 14:45:17.000'),(7296,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-04-30 08:46:02.000',2218,'AdCNo00612021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-30 08:46:03.363','','2021-04-30 08:46:03.363','','After scrutinizing your complaint, it has been observed as under (i) You have mentioned that your complaint is against Allottee while it should be against the Promoter of the Registered Project. (ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated and Specific Relief claimed (iii) Words under Facts of the case seems to be missing. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the same. In case the defects pointed out are not corrected, the matter shall be dealt with as per the said Regulations. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-04-30 08:46:02.000','legaladvrera','2021-04-30 08:46:02.000'),(7297,440001,'999','2021-04-30 09:48:54.000',2248,'AdCNo00852021UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-04-30 09:48:54.000','999','2021-04-30 09:48:54.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-04-30 09:48:54.000','sysadmin','2021-04-30 09:48:54.000'),(7298,440058,'exclegalrera','2021-04-30 11:30:08.000',2195,'AdCNo00472021','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-04-30 11:30:09.160','','2021-04-30 11:30:09.160','','Notice to Com