legaladvrera','2021-05-08 07:40:04.000',2196,'AdCNo00482021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-08 07:40:06.010','','2021-05-08 07:40:06.010','','Page Numbers mentioned at Sr. No. 8 of the Form N (List of Enclosures) are not in order. Further, at Sr. No. 8 of the Form N, the words \'resignation of plot\' have been written instead of words \'registration of plot\'. The same may be corrected on the web portal and resubmit the complaint along with  hardcopy of online complaint.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-08 07:40:04.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-08 07:40:04.000'),(7316,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-08 08:27:46.000',2213,'AdCNo00772021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-08 08:27:48.557','','2021-05-08 08:27:48.557','','The present complaint has been filed on behalf of a private company. A copy of Resolution for appointing an individual as a legal representative of a Private Company with an authorisation to sign all papers, applications, complaints, vakalatnama, and all other documents in connection with any legal proceedings by or against the company, may be provided.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-08 08:27:46.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-08 08:27:46.000'),(7317,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-08 08:29:31.000',2233,'AdCNo00762021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-08 08:29:33.698','','2021-05-08 08:29:33.698','','The present complaint has been filed on behalf of a private company. A copy of Resolution for appointing an individual as a legal representative of a Private Company with an authorisation to sign all papers, applications, complaints, vakalatnama, and all other documents in connection with any legal proceedings by or against the company, may be provided.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-08 08:29:31.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-08 08:29:31.000'),(7318,440001,'999','2021-05-08 12:43:20.000',2258,'AdCNo00962021','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-05-08 12:43:20.000','999','2021-05-08 12:43:20.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-05-08 12:43:20.000','sysadmin','2021-05-08 12:43:20.000'),(7319,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 15:29:22.000',2234,'AdCNo00722021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-09 15:29:24.742','','2021-05-09 15:29:24.742','','The present Complaint is about a plot allotted to the Complainant in a RERA registered project \" Sunny Enclave- Amazon City\" and the same has been filed against \" BAJWA DEVELOPERS LTD\". Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 15:29:22.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-09 15:29:22.000'),(7320,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 15:37:10.000',2206,'AdCNo00542021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-09 15:37:13.398','','2021-05-09 15:37:13.398','','The present Complaint is about a shop allotted to the Complainant in a RERA registered project \" METRO TOWN PROMENADE\". Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount deposited by her along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 15:37:10.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-09 15:37:10.000'),(7321,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 16:50:45.000',2113,'AdCNo00782021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-09 16:50:48.586','','2021-05-09 16:50:48.586','','The Complainants have sought refund of entire amount deposited by them along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 16:50:45.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-09 16:50:45.000'),(7322,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 17:20:25.000',2237,'AdCNo00752021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-09 17:20:27.929','','2021-05-09 17:20:27.929','','After scrutinizing your complaint, it has been observed as under (i) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the name of the project to which it relates, specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated and Specific Relief claimed. (ii) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You may refer the RERA website for the name, address and contact details of the promoter of the project. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing/resubmitting the Complaint. Accordingly, the complaint may be resubmitted immediately so that necessary action could be taken in time.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 17:20:25.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-09 17:20:25.000'),(7323,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 17:40:03.000',2173,'AdCNo00382021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-09 17:40:06.242','','2021-05-09 17:40:06.242','','After scrutinizing your complaint, it has been observed as under (i) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to clearly mention the name of the project to which it relates, specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated (ii) Name of the project is not correct as recorded against the RERA Registration number. (iii) Page Number mentioned at Sr. No. 8 of the Form - \'List of Enclosures\' are not correct. The same may be removed and resubmit the same along with the hard copies. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing/resubmitting the Complaint. Accordingly, the complaint may be resubmitted so that further necessary action could be taken.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 17:40:03.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-09 17:40:03.000'),(7324,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-09 18:28:11.000',2231,'AdCNo00692021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-09 18:28:14.461','','2021-05-09 18:28:14.461','','After scrutinizing your complaint, it has been observed as under (i) Page Number mentioned at Sr. No. 8 of the Form - List of Enclosures, are not correct. (ii) Vakalatnama not stamped. Every Vakalatnama filed by any Advocate, should be affixed with one Advocate Welfare Fund Stamp. (iii) You have filed your complaint in Form N seeking relief for transferring the complaint to appropria