romoter for the same project). Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-15 10:25:59.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-15 10:25:59.000'),(7419,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-05-15 12:29:02.000',2237,'AdCNo00752021TR-AUTH00252021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-15 12:29:04.833','','2021-05-15 12:29:04.833','','The Complaint alleges delay in delivery of possession of a unit in a RERA registered project \'Celestia Royal Chandigarh\'. The complaint has been filed against the promoter M/S Omaxe Chandigarh Extension Developers Pvt. Ltd. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of physical possession of the unit by the Respondent and has sought relief of interest on the delayed period of possession at the rate prescribed by Rule 16 of the RERA Rules, 2017, which violation falls under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the Act. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-15 12:29:02.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-15 12:29:02.000'),(7420,440055,'pschairperson','2021-05-17 15:25:16.000',1404,'AdCNo12942019TR-AUTH01282020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2021-05-17 15:25:19.720','','2021-05-17 15:25:19.720','','The relief claimed in the complaint is refund of money deposited by the complainant along with interest and compensation, this matter is to be dealt with by the Adjudicating officer in terms of Circular No. RERA/Pb./LEGAL/24 dated 05.03.2021. Accordingly, the parties are dire