y (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. (ii)  You have uploaded the copy of complaint in Form \'N\' as annexure. You have to mention your facts in Form \'N\' online only. (iii) Annexure Reference Number as Annexure C-1, C-2 and so on, may be mentioned at Sr. No. 8 of the Complaint Form. (iv) An Advocate welfare stamp fee should be affixed on vakalatnama. An Index for the complaint may also be enclosed. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies thereof in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing/resubmitting the Complaint. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-20 12:03:50.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-20 12:03:50.000'),(7481,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-20 12:04:46.000',2269,'AdCNo01012021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-20 12:04:47.126','','2021-05-20 12:04:47.126','','After scrutinizing your complaint, it has been observed that (i) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. (ii)  You have uploaded the copy of complaint in Form \'N\' as annexure. You have to mention your facts in Form \'N\' online only. (iii) Annexure Reference Number as Annexure C-1, C-2 and so on, may be mentioned at Sr. No. 8 of the Complaint Form. (iv) An Advocate welfare stamp fee should be affixed on vakalatnama. An Index for the complaint may also be enclosed. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies thereof in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authori