sion(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-05-23 01:11:31.000','sysadmin','2021-05-23 01:11:31.000'),(7505,440004,'999','2021-05-23 01:25:43.000',2269,'AdCNo01012021UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-05-23 01:25:43.000','999','2021-05-23 01:25:43.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-05-23 01:25:43.000','sysadmin','2021-05-23 01:25:43.000'),(7506,440004,'999','2021-05-23 01:50:29.000',2272,'AdCNo01042021UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-05-23 01:50:29.000','999','2021-05-23 01:50:29.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-05-23 01:50:29.000','sysadmin','2021-05-23 01:50:29.000'),(7507,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-23 20:21:31.000',2219,'AdCNo00622021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-23 20:21:34.245','','2021-05-23 20:21:34.245','','After scrutinizing your complaint, it has been observed that (i) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. (ii) Respondent name is required to be mentioned as per the \'Agreement for Sale\' and \'Allotment letter\' uploaded on the web portal. Page Numbers have not been marked on the annexures. (iii) Complaint Form has been printed both side on the paper. Please print the form one side each page and an index for the complaint may also be annexed. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing/resubmitting the Complaint. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-23 20:21:31.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-23 20:21:31.000'),(7508,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-23 22:58:00.000',2255,'AdCNo00922021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-23 22:58:03.354','','2021-05-23 22:58:03.354','','The Complainants alleged violation as regards non delivery of physical possession of flat by the Respondent and has sought relief of interest on the delayed period of possession which violation falls under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the Act. Under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the Act, if an allottee wants to stay in the project for taking possession, he can seek interest as per Rules on the deposited amount for the delayed period in handing over of possession and for that cause of action and relief, complainants are required to file complaint under Form M with Authority. Please clarify the position.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-23 22:58:00.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-23 22:58:00.000'),(7509,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-23 23:01:59.000',2252,'AdCNo00882021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-23 23:02:02.386','','2021-05-23 23:02:02.386','','The Complainants alleged violation as regards non delivery of physical possession of flat by the Respondent and has sought relief of interest on the delayed period of possession which violation falls under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the Act. Under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the Act, if an allottee wants to stay in the project for taking possession, he can seek interest as per Rules on the deposited amount for the delayed period in handing over of possession and for that cause of action and relief, complainants are required to file complaint under Form M with Authority. Please clarify the position.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-23 23:01:59.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-23 23:01:59.000'),(7510,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 00:12:29.000',2254,'AdCNo00932021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-24 00:12:31.979','','2021-05-24 00:12:31.979','','The Complainants  seek certain directions w.r.t providing all facilities as detailed in Brochure and Advertisement including relief of interest on the deposited amount and compensation. The Complainant alleged violations u/s 14 (2) of Act and for that cause of action and relief, complainants are required to file complaint under Form M with Authority. Further, in terms of Section 71 of the Act, the power lies with the Adjudicating Officer for the purpose of adjudging compensation in Form N. Please clarify the position and resubmit the same.\r\n',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 00:12:29.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-24 00:12:29.000'),(7511,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 00:29:08.000',2250,'AdCNo00862021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-24 00:29:10.855','','2021-05-24 00:29:10.855','','(i) Annexure C-4 (Site Photographs) has been uploaded wrongly. Site Photographs have not been uploaded. (ii) Annexure C-5 has not been uploaded properly on the web portal. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 00:29:08.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-24 00:29:08.000'),(7512,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 00:43:52.000',2209,'AdCNo00942021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-24 00:43:55.120','','2021-05-24 00:43:55.120','','The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount deposited by him along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 00:43:52.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-24 00:43:52.000'),(7513,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 01:41:03.000',2258,'AdCNo00962021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-24 01:41:06.558','','2021-05-24 01:41:06.558','','After scrutinizing your complaint, it has been observed that (i) Uploaded Vakalatnama does not contain the signatures of Advocate. (ii) Page Numbers mentioned at Sr. No. 8 of the Form  are not in order. (iii) Verification has not been filled by the Complainant. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing/resubmitting the Complaint. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 01:41:03.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-24 01:41:03.000'),(7514,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 03:45:45.000',2238,'AdCNo00822021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-24 03:45:48.151','','2021-05-24 03:45:48.151','','(i) Annexure 3 and Annexure 5 have not been uploaded in order. (ii) Uplaoded Vakalatnama does not contain the signatures of complainant/authorised representative. (iii) Vakalatnama has not been affixed with Advocate Welfare Fund Stamp. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 03:45:45.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-24 03:45:45.000'),(7515,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-05-24 03:53:31.000',2248,'AdCNo00852021UR','','','