:57.214','','(i) You have not mentioned the Name of the Real Estate Project to which the Complaint relates. Please mention the same at Sr. No. 2 under/against the heading Name of the Real Estate Project/ Agent to which the Complaint relates. (ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-28 14:32:55.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-28 14:32:55.000'),(7562,440004,'999','2021-05-29 15:13:56.000',2258,'AdCNo00962021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-05-29 15:13:56.000','999','2021-05-29 15:13:56.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-05-29 15:13:56.000','sysadmin','2021-05-29 15:13:56.000'),(7563,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-05-30 07:58:39.000',2211,'AdCNo00562021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-05-30 07:58:41.988','','2021-05-30 07:58:41.988','','The present Complaint is about a floor purchased by Complainant in a RERA registered project \"GBP CAMELLIA\" and the same has been filed against \"GUPTA BUILDERS AND PROMOTERS PVT. LTD\". Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount along with interest and compensation. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-05-30 07:58:39.000','legaladvrera','2021-05-30 07:58:39.000'),(7564,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-05-30 08:08:02.0