00',2109,'AdCNo18012020TR-AUTH01632020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-04 10:43:25.519','','2021-06-04 10:43:25.519','','Complaint dismissed as having been settled between the parties vide order dated 28.05.2021.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2021-06-04 10:43:24.000','systemanalyst.rera','2021-06-04 10:43:24.000'),(7607,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-06-04 12:34:23.000',2184,'AdCNo00532021TR-AUTH00232021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-04 12:34:24.644','','2021-06-04 12:34:24.644','','The present Complaint relates to a dwelling unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"Connaught Residency \" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"TDI INFRATECH LTD AND ORS.\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of physical possession of unit by the Respondents and has sought relief of interest on the delayed period of possession which violation falls under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the Act. The present complaint is entrusted to the Authority for consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-04 12:34:23.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-04 12:34:23.000'),(7608,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-06-04 12:50:12.000',2252,'AdCNo00882021TR-AUTH00332021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-04 12:50:14.003','','2021-06-04 12:50:14.003','','The present Complaint relates to a flat purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"Sunny Heights\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \" M/s Bajwa Developers Ltd\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of physical possession of flat by the Respondent and has sought relief of interest on the delayed period of possession which violation falls under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the Act. The Complainants are also seeking possession and execution of conveyance deed of the unit. Accordingly, the present complaint is entrusted to the Authority for consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-04 12:50:12.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-04 12:50:12.000'),(7609,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-06-04 13:01:50.000',2255,'AdCNo00922021TR-AUTH00342021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-04 13:01:51.628','','2021-06-04 13:01:51.628','','The present Complaint relates to a flat purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \" Gillco Park Hills\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \" Gillco Developers & Builders Pvt Ltd.\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of physical possession of flat by the Respondent and has sought relief of interest on the delayed period of possession which violation falls under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the Act. The Complainants are also seeking possession and execution of conveyance deed of the unit after complete development. Accordingly, the present complaint is entrusted to the Authority for consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-04 13:01:50.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-04 13:01:50.000'),(7610,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-06-04 13:33:19.000',2254,'AdCNo00932021TR-AUTH00352021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-04 13:33:21.128','','2021-06-04 13:33:21.128','','The present Complaint relates to an apartment purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \" GILLCO HEIGHTS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \" Gillco Developers & Builders Pvt Ltd\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainants alleged violation of section 11,12, 14(2),17, 18,19 of Real Estate (Regulation and Development ) Act, 2016 and  prayed that the respondent be directed to (i) obtain Completion & Occupation Certificate from the competent authority (ii) provide all promised facilities, as detailed in Brochure & Advertisement (iii) pay interest at prescribed rates, on the amounts received from deemed date of possession till Occupation/Completion Certificate is obtained (iv) refund of amount received on account of maintenance charges, covered car parking charges and open parking space. Accordingly, the present complaint is entrusted to the Authority for consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-04 13:33:19.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-04 13:33:19.000'),(7611,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-06-04 13:59:02.000',2253,'AdCNo00912021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-04 13:59:03.628','','2021-06-04 13:59:03.628','','The present Complaint relates to a plot purchased by the Complainant in an unregistered project namely \"New Chandigarh GBP SMART CITY \" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \" Gupta Builders and Promoters Pvt Ltd\". The Complainant has sought refund of amount along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-04 13:59:02.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-04 13:59:02.000'),(7612,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2021-06-04 15:10:46.000',1926,'AdCNo16732020TR-AUTH01672020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-04 15:10:47.503','','2021-06-04 15:10:47.503','','Complaint dismissed vide order dated 19.05.2021.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2021-06-04 15:10:46.000','systemanalyst.rera','2021-06-04 15:10:46.000'),(7613,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-06-04 16:42:01.000',2253,'AdCNo00912021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-06-04 16:42:02.722','','2021-06-04 16:42:02.722','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to the respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 08.07.2021. Respondent shall file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  The complainant be also informed about the next date of hearing and its purpose through any mode of communication.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-06-04 16:42:01.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-06-04 16:42:01.000'),(7614,440004,'999','2021-06-05 20:30:04.000',2289,'AdCNo01172021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-06-05 20:30:04.000','999','2021-06-05 20:30:04.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-06-05 20:30:04.000','sysadmin','2021-06-05 20:30:04.000'),(7615,440001,'999','2021-06-07 14:59:13.000',2286,'AdCNo01222021UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-06-07 14:59:13.000','999','2021-06-07 14:59:13.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-06-07 14:59:13.000','sysadmin','2021-06-07 14:59:13.000'),(7616,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 09:43:25.000',2256,'AdCNo00952021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-08 09:43:24.074','','2021-06-08 09:43:24.074','','The present Complaint is about a unit applied by the Complainant in a RERA registered project \"LOK AWAS\" and the same has been filed against \"VERA DEVELOPERS PVT. LTD\". The Complainant has sought refund of application money paid by him along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L).  Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 09:43:25.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-08 09:43:25.000'),(7617,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 10:03:40.000',1799,'AdCNo15962020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-08 10:03:39.714','','2021-06-08 10:03:39.714','','In terms of Order dated 02.06.2021 passed by Ld. Adjudicating Officer, the Complaint is returned to the complainant to make the necessary amendments by deleting the name of Respondent No. 5. The amended complaint along with the hard copy of the same be resubmitted on or before the next date.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 10:03:40.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-08 10:03:40.000'),(7618,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 10:43:00.000',1832,'AdCNo16672020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-08 10:42:59.511','','2021-06-08 10:42:59.511','','In terms of Order dated 31.05.2021 passed by Ld. Adjudicating Officer, the online complaint is returned to the complainant with the direction to rectify the same. The rectified complaint be filed on or before 18.06.2021 and hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 10:43:00.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-08 10:43:00.000'),(7619,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 10:45:42.000',1835,'AdCNo16662020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-08 10:45:41.761','','2021-06-08 10:45:41.761','','In terms of Order dated 31.05.2021 passed by Ld. Adjudicating Officer, the online complaint is returned to the complainant with the direction to rectify the defects. The rectified complaint be resubmitted on or before 18.06.2021 and hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 10:45:42.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-08 10:45:42.000'),(7620,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 12:09:54.000',2205,'AdCNo00522021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-08 12:09:53.511','','2021-06-08 12:09:53.511','','The present Complaint has been filed against the promoter namely \"Gupta Builders and Promoters (P) Limited\" in an unregistered project. The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount deposited by him along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Vakalatnama has not been uploaded online. The Counsel for the Complainant while enclosing the Vakalatnama has requested through a written communication that inadvertently the Power of attorney to engagement of the counsel could not be uploaded with the present complaint and requested that the same may be place on record and be treated as part and parcel of the present complaint. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 12:09:54.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-08 12:09:54.000'),(7621,440055,'pschairperson','2021-06-08 12:36:53.000',2255,'AdCNo00922021TR-AUTH00342021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2021-06-08 12:36:52.839','','2021-06-08 12:36:52.839','','Notice be issued to respondent to appear in person or through authorized representative on 09.07.2021 at 10.30 am before the Authority and to file the reply (3 sets in hard copy)within 15 days from the receipt of this notice. A copy of the reply also be sent to the complaints through email ID as mentioned in the complaint. \r\nComplainants be also asked to appear on the above date and time.\r\n',2,0,'pschairperson','2021-06-08 12:36:53.000','pschairperson','2021-06-08 12:36:53.000'),(7622,440055,'pschairperson','2021-06-08 12:40:39.000',2254,'AdCNo00932021TR-AUTH00352021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2021-06-08 12:40:38.058','','2021-06-08 12:40:38.058','','Notice be issued to respondent to appear in person or through authorized representative on 09.07.2021 at 10.30 am before the Authority and to file the reply (3 sets in hard copy)within 15 days from the receipt of this notice. A copy of the reply also be sent to the complaints through email ID as mentioned in the complaint. \r\nComplainants be also asked to appear on the above date and time.\r\n',2,0,'pschairperson','2021-06-08 12:40:39.000','pschairperson','2021-06-08 12:40:39.000'),(7623,440055,'pschairperson','2021-06-08 12:42:49.000',2252,'AdCNo00882021TR-AUTH00332021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2021-06-08 12:42:48.745','','2021-06-08 12:42:48.745','','Notice be issued to respondent to appear in person or through authorized represen