ent complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 13:41:18.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-08 13:41:18.000'),(7626,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 13:50:44.000',2261,'AdCNo01032021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-08 13:50:44.074','','2021-06-08 13:50:44.074','',' The present Complaint alleges failure to deliver the possession of\r\napartment no. 702 , 7th Floor, T-3 situated in RERA registered project namely ATHENES-1 as agreed by the\r\nrespondent. The complaint has been filed through counsel against the respondents namely\r\n\"Gupta Builders and Promoters (P) Limited\" and \"Indiabulls Housing Finance Limited\". The\r\nComplainants have sought refund of amount deposited by him along with interest,\r\ncompensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures\r\nreceived. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L).\r\nAccordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders\r\nplease. (Connected with the similar complaint bearing AdcNo01052021. Parties are same.  Apartment Numbers are different.)',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-08 13:50:44.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-08 13:50:44.000'),(7627,440004,'999','2021-06-08 16:15:32.000',1799,'AdCNo15962020','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-06-08 16:15:32.000','999','2021-06-08 16:15:32.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-06-08 16:15:32.000','sysadmin','2021-06-08 16:15:32.000'),(7628,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-06-09 08:49:32.000',2286,'AdCNo01222021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-09 08:49:31.902','','2021-06-09 08:49:31.902','','After scrutinizing your complaint, it has been observed as under (i) You have mentioned that your complaint is against Allottee while it should be Promoter of the Project. (ii) Agreement to Sell has not been uploaded completely. (iii) Promoter/Respondent name may be corrected as per the documents uploaded by you. (iv) Name of the Authorised Representative may be mentioned. In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the Specific Relief claimed (iv) Vide email dated 07.06.2021, you have requested to return the complaint to correct the name of the complainant. Accordingly, the complaint is returned for rectifying the same. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the same. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-09 08:49:32.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-09 08:49:32.000'),(7629,440063,'legaladvrera','2021-06-09 11:02:12.000',1155,'AdCNo10862019TR-AUTH01372020','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-09 11:02:12.230','','2021-06-09 11:02:12.230','','During the hearing held on 02.06.2021, it has been observed by the Authority that the complainant has sought the relief of compensation as per the latest Circular No. RERA/Pb./Legal/24 dated 05.03.2021 issued by the Authority, the matter needs to be transferred to the Adjudicating Officer for further proceedings in the matter. Accordingly, vide order dated 02.06.2021, the case was transferred to the bench of Adjudicating Officer. Registry was directed to put up the case before the Adjudicating Officer on 15.06.2021. Counsel for both the parties have been directed to appear before the Adjudicating Officer on 15.06.2021. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-09 11:02:12.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-09 11:02:12.000'),(7630,440064,'legaladvrera','2021-06-09 11:03:13.000',1155,'AdCNo10862019TR','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Role Authority Desk','NA','2021-06-09 11:03:13.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-09 11:03:13.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-09 11:03:13.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-09 11:03:13.000'),(7631,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-06-09 11:04:29.000',1155,'AdCNo10862019TR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-09 11:04:28.980','','2021-06-09 11:04:28.980','','During the hearing held on 02.06.2021, it has been observed by the Authority that the complainant has sought the relief of compensation as per the latest Circular No. RERA/Pb./Legal/24 dated 05.03.2021 issued by the Authority, the matter needs to be transferred to the Adjudicating Officer for further proceedings in the matter. Accordingly, vide order dated 02.06.2021, the case was transferred to the bench of Adjudicating Officer. Registry was directed to put up the case before the Adjudicating Officer on 15.06.2021. Counsel for both the parties have been directed to appear before the Adjudicating Officer on 15.06.2021. Accordingly, the case is submitted for consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-09 11:04:29.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-09 11:04:29.000'),(7632,440055,'pschairperson','2021-06-09 11:31:42.000',1148,'AdCNo10832019TR-AUTH01382020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2021-06-09 11:31:42.480','','2021-06-09 11:31:42.480','','Vide order dated 02.06.2021, the case has been transferred to the Adjudicating Officer for further proceeding in the matter.',2,0,'pschairperson','2021-06-09 11:31:42.000','pschai