esk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-28 00:15:59.174','','2021-06-28 00:15:59.174','','The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount deposited by him along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Fee and Format checked. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 00:15:57.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-28 00:15:57.000'),(7766,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 00:24:56.000',2285,'AdCNo01182021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-28 00:24:57.502','','2021-06-28 00:24:57.502','','The Complainants have sought the refund of entire amount deposited by them along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Fee and Format checked. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 00:24:56.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-28 00:24:56.000'),(7767,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 01:21:56.000',2294,'AdCNo01202021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-28 01:21:57.533','','2021-06-28 01:21:57.533','','The Complainants have sought two reliefs (in alternative) i.e.(i)  possession of property along with interest and compensation and in alternative (ii) refund of entire amount paid by the complainants along with interest and compensation, which is mutually exclusive in nature. Accordingly, the Ld. Bench may issue notice to the complainants for preliminary hearing for the sake of clarity in relief. The present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 01:21:56.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-28 01:21:56.000'),(7768,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 01:43:06.000',2305,'AdCNo01282021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-28 01:43:07.846','','2021-06-28 01:43:07.846','','The Complainants have sought interest on the deposited amount, compensation and legal expenses. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Fee and Format checked. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Vakalatnama has been uploaded without signatures but Vakalatnama duly signed has been submitted with hard copy of the complaint, which may be considered. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 01:43:06.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-28 01:43:06.000'),(7769,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 01:58:54.000',2274,'AdCNo01092021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-28 01:58:56.035','','2021-06-28 01:58:56.035','','After scrutiny of your complaint, it has been observed that (i) You have filed one complaint for two different units. Since, different agreements have been executed, two different complaints for each unit needs to be filed. (ii) The Hard Copy of the Complaint has not been submitted. Only the Annexures have been submitted. Hard copy of the complaint duly signed by the complainant is required to be submitted. (iii) Project Name is required to be mentioned against RERA Registration number of the Project. (iv) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated and specify your relief. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 01:58:54.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-28 01:58:54.000'),(7770,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 03:03:31.000',2298,'AdCNo01232021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-28 03:03:32.643','','2021-06-28 03:03:32.643','','After scrutiny of your complaint, it has been observed that (i) Vakalatnama has not been uploaded on the web portal of Authority. (ii) Annexure C-4A, Annexure C-5 and Annexure C-6 have not been uploaded. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 03:03:31.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-28 03:03:31.000'),(7771,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 03:36:43.000',2238,'AdCNo00822021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-06-28 03:36:44.471','','2021-06-28 03:36:44.471','','The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount deposited by him along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Fee and Format checked. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-06-28 03:36:43.000','legaladvrera','2021-06-28 03:36:43.000'),(7772,440004,'999','2021-06-28 15:11:57.000',2298,'AdCNo01232021UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-06-28 15:11:57.000','999','2021-06-28 1