espondent have made violation of Sections 11,12, 13, 14 & 19 RERA Act. The Complainant has sought refund of amount along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:12:14.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:12:14.000'),(7841,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:25:22.000',2286,'AdCNo01222021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-07 02:25:21.667','','2021-07-07 02:25:21.667','','The present Complaint relates to a flat purchased by the Complainant in an unregistered project and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"Om Divine Developers and Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd\".  The Complainant has sought refund of amount deposited by her along with interest and compensation. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:25:22.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:25:22.000'),(7842,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:42:02.000',2099,'AdCNo17932020TR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-07 02:42:01.730','','2021-07-07 02:42:01.730','','The present Complaint relates to a flat purchased by the Complainant in RERA registered project \"Fashion Technology Park\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"Chandigarh Overseas Pvt Ltd\".  The Complaint has been filed through the legal heirs of the deceased. The legal heirs of the deceased Complainant have sought the refund of entire amount along with interest and compensation. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:42:02.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:42:02.000'),(7843,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:58:42.000',2274,'AdCNo01092021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-07 02:58:41.323','','2021-07-07 02:58:41.323','','(i)	You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. You may refer the RERA website for the address and contact details of the main respondent. (ii) Assured Return Scheme Letter has not been uploaded completely.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:58:42.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-07 02:58:42.000'),(7844,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-07-07 03:03:55.000',2324,'AdCNo01402021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-07 03:03:54.417','','2021-07-07 03:03:54.417','','You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. You may refer the RERA website for the address and contact details of the main respondent. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-07 03:03:55.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-07 03:03:55.0