-17 21:28:39.000','sysadmin','2021-07-17 21:28:39.000'),(7953,440001,'999','2021-07-18 12:45:23.000',2303,'AdCNo01492021','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-07-18 12:45:23.000','999','2021-07-18 12:45:23.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-07-18 12:45:23.000','sysadmin','2021-07-18 12:45:23.000'),(7954,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-07-18 22:27:30.000',2312,'AdCNo01312021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-18 22:27:31.702','','2021-07-18 22:27:31.702','','The Complainants have sought refund of entire amount deposited by them along with interest and compensation . Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-18 22:27:30.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-18 22:27:30.000'),(7955,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-07-18 22:38:09.000',2317,'AdCNo01342021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-18 22:38:10.983','','2021-07-18 22:38:10.983','','The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount deposited by him along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-18 22:38:09.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-18 22:38:09.000'),(7956,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-07-18 22:56:21.000',2328,'AdCNo01442021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-18 22:56:22.670','','2021-07-18 22:56:22.670','','It has been observed that Annexure A and Annexure B mentioned in the Allotment Letter are  not annexed with the Allotment Letter. The same may be uploaded and furnished and resubmit the complaint.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-18 22:56:21.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-18 22:56:21.000'),(7957,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-07-18 23:13:33.000',2221,'AdCNo00712021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-18 23:13:34.327','','2021-07-18 23:13:34.327','','The primary relief of the complainant is to refund of entire amount deposited by her along with interest and compensation.  Further, the Complainant seeks directions to (i) penalise the Promoter for Contravention of the provisions of the Act under Section 60 & 61 of the RERA Act (ii) penalise the Promoter for violation of Section 13 of the RERA Act (iii) Revocation of Registration of the project under Section 7 (c) (iii) in Violation of the provision of RERA Act. The other reliefs at (i) to (iii) above fall under the purview of Authority. In light of the above, a preliminary hearing may be given to the complainant for the sake of clarity. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-18 23:13:33.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-18 23:13:33.000'),(7958,440054,'exclegalrera','2021-07-19 14:02:07.000',2073,'AdCNo17732020TR-AUTH01142020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-19 14:02:08.795','','2021-07-19 14:02:08.795','','Complaint disposed of as partly allowed vide order dated 07.07.2021.',1,0,'exclegalrera','2021-07-19 14:02:07.000','exclegalrera','2021-07-19 14:02:07.000'),(7959,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-07-19 17:19:30.000',2312,'AdCNo01312021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-07-19 17:19:31.764','','2021-07-19 17:19:31.764','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to the respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 26.08.2021. Respondent shall file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  The complainant be also informed about the next date of hearing and its purpose through any mode of communication.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-07-19 17:19:30.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-07-19 17:19:30.000'),(7960,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-07-19 17:20:03.000',2317,'AdCNo01342021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-07-19 17:20:04.717','','2021-07-19 17:20:04.717','','Complaint received. Report of office perused and the complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to the respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 26.08.2021. Respondent shall file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  The complainant be also informed about the next date of hearing and its purpose through any mode of communication.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-07-19 17:20:03.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-07-19 17:20:03.000'),(7961,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-07-19 17:20:51.000',2221,'AdCNo00712021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-07-19 17:20:52.733','','2021-07-19 17:20:52.733','','The LA branch is pointed out that reliefs have been  claimed by the complainant for refund alongwith interest and compensation and also complainant further seeks direc