nd compensation, which is mutually\r\nexclusive in nature. Now, in terms of Order dated 15.07.2021 passed by the Ld. Adjudicating Officer, RERA, Punjab, the complaint is returned to the complainant with the direction to rectify the relief and then rectified complaint be filed on or before 03.08.2021. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-22 17:56:59.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-22 17:56:59.000'),(7993,440007,'exclegalrera','2021-07-23 09:53:44.000',2330,'AdCNo01472021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-23 09:53:44.420','','2021-07-23 09:53:44.420','','In response to your email dated 22.07.2021 sent at Help Desk RERA, the complaint is again returned for necessary amendments.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2021-07-23 09:53:44.000','exclegalrera','2021-07-23 09:53:44.000'),(7994,440054,'exclegalrera','2021-07-23 11:41:41.000',2040,'AdCNo17492020URTR-AUTH01512020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-23 11:41:41.030','','2021-07-23 11:41:41.030','','Complaint disposed of as partly accepted vide order dated 09.07.2021.',1,0,'exclegalrera','2021-07-23 11:41:41.000','exclegalrera','2021-07-23 11:41:41.000'),(7995,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-07-23 12:04:00.000',2323,'AdCNo01382021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-23 12:04:00.514','','2021-07-23 12:04:00.514','','You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. You may refer the RERA website for the address and contact details of the main respondent. (ii) Facts and Relief given by you are not clear. You may give the facts in detail in order to more clarity. (ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated and specific relief. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the same. In case the defects pointed out are not corrected, the matter shall be dealt with as per the said Regulations. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-23 12:04:00.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-23 12:04:00.000'),(7996,440001,'999','2021-07-23 12:54:32.000',2345,'AdCNo01532021','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-07-23 12:54:32.000','999','2021-07-23 12:54:32.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-07-23 12:54:32.000','sysadmin','2021-07-23 12:54:32.000'),(7997,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-07-23 14:03:14.000',2299,'AdCNo01242021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-23 14:03:14.499','','2021-07-23 14:03:14.499','','The complaint has been filed against an unregistered project located at Fountain Chowk Site, Mall Road, PWD (PH), Patiala, which was advertised under OUGVL scheme by PUDA, Patiala. Copy of one of the mandatory documents for filing a complaint against an unregistered project has not been submitted with the complaint. It is pertinent to mention here that the complainant has annexed a copy of auction notice and Newspaper Publication of the project under the heading of CLU document (Annexure VIII). However, from the perusal of the Copy of auction notice and Newspaper Publication of the project and other documents, it reveals that the money has been received from the complainants on account of allotment of site. Since the project in question is a government project advertised by PUDA, Patiala, the present complaint may be considered for hearing the complaint. PUDA, Patiala had informed that possession of the allotted unit could not be offered and the amount paid by the complainants was refunded without interest. Further, the complainants followed up with the respondent for payment of interest and compensation but the same has not been paid by PUDA. Accordingly, the complainant has prayed for payment of interest and compensation. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further directions please. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-23 14:03:14.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-23 14:03:14.000'),(7998,440004,'999','2021-07-23 17:29:04.000',2330,'AdCNo01472021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-07-23 17:29:04.000','999','2021-07-23 17:29:04.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-07-23 17:29:04.000','sysadmin','2021-07-23 17:29:04.000'),(7999,440004,'999','2021-07-23 17:51:55.000',2335,'AdCNo01482021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-07-23 17:51:55.000','999','2021-07-23 17:51:55.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-07-23 17:51:55.000','sysadmin','2021-07-23 17:51:55.000'),(8000,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-07-26 00:21:25.000',2281,'AdCNo01122021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-26 00:21:27.931','','2021-07-26 00:21:27.931','','The complaint has been filed against an unregistered project known as \'PWD (Public Health) Mall Road Fountain Chowk site Patiala\'. One of the six mandatory documents for filing a complaint against an unregistered project is required but the same has not been submitted with the complaint. The complainant has annexed a copy of letter dated 01.11.2016 under the heading of \'LOI document\' (Annexure C 1) through which 15 percent of the auctioned amount has been demanded. From the perusal of the documents annexed, it reveals that the money has been received from the complainant on account of allotment of site through auction. Since the project in question is a government project advertised by PUDA, the present complaint may be considered for further proceedings/hearing. PUDA, Patiala had informed that possession of the allotted unit could not be offered for some reason and the amount paid by the complainant was refunded without interest. Further, the complainant followed up with the respondent for payment of interest and compensation but the same has not been paid by PUDA. Accordingly, the complainant has prayed for payment of interest, compensation and litigation cost. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further directions please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-26 00:21:25.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-26 00:21:25.000'),(8001,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-07-26 00:27:46.000',2280,'AdCNo01132021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-26 00:27:49.681','','2021-07-26 00:27:49.681','','The complaint has been filed against an unregistered project known as \'PWD (Public Health) Mall Road Fountain Chowk site Patiala\'. One of the six mandatory documents for filing a complaint against an unregistered project is required but the same has not been submitted with the complaint. The complainant has annexed a copy of letter dated 01.11.2016 under the heading of \'LOI document\' (Annexure C 2) through which 15 percent of the auctioned amount has been demanded. From the perusal of the documents annexed, it reveals that the money has been received from the complainant on account of allotment of site through auction. Since the project in question is a government project advertised by PUDA, the present complaint may be considered for further proceedings/hearing. PUDA, Patiala had informed that possession of the allotted unit could not be offered for some reason and the amount paid by the complainant was refunded without interest. Further, the complainant followed up with the respondent for payment of interest and compensation but the same has not been paid by PUDA. Accordingly, the complainant has prayed for payment of interest, compensation and litigation cost. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further directions please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-26 00:27:46.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-26 00:27:46.000'),(8002,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-07-26 00:31:15.000',2282,'AdCNo01142021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-26 00:31:18.041','','2021-07-26 00:31:18.041','','The complaint has been filed against an unregistered project known as \'PWD (Public Health) Mall Road Fountain Chowk site Patiala\'. One of the six mandatory documents for filing a complaint against an unregistered project is required but the same has not been submitted with the complaint. The compla