roviding of possession of plot and Refund of amount with interest and compensation, which are mutually exclusive, which cannot be given. Relief may be specified as per the provisions of the Act. You may see the Circular dated 05.03.2021 issued by the Authority on the website in this regard. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-02 00:23:04.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-02 00:23:04.000'),(8073,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-02 00:44:37.000',2277,'AdCNo01102021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-02 00:44:40.047','','2021-08-02 00:44:40.047','','The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount deposited by him along with interest, compensation and litigation cost. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further directions please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-02 00:44:37.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-02 00:44:37.000'),(8074,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-02 00:56:42.000',2302,'AdCNo01262021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-02 00:56:44.781','','2021-08-02 00:56:44.781','','The complaint relates to a plot booked under the RERA registered project namely \'PUDA ENCLAVE NEAR SDM RESIDENCE\' at Fazilka and has been filed against \'PUDA (Now Bathinda Development Authority)\'. The Complainant has sought refund of amount deposited by the complainant along with interest and compensation. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further directions please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-02 00:56:42.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-02 00:56:42.000'),(8075,440056,'