removing objections.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2021-08-03 16:07:00.000','exclegalrera','2021-08-03 16:07:00.000'),(8108,440007,'exclegalrera','2021-08-03 16:30:11.000',2343,'AdCNo01502021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-03 16:30:11.704','','2021-08-03 16:30:11.704','','In response to your email dated 27.07.2021, the complaint is again returned for removing objections.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2021-08-03 16:30:11.000','exclegalrera','2021-08-03 16:30:11.000'),(8109,440007,'exclegalrera','2021-08-03 16:33:22.000',2321,'AdCNo01522021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-03 16:33:22.765','','2021-08-03 16:33:22.765','','In response to your email dated 27.07.2021, the complaint is returned for removing objections.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2021-08-03 16:33:22.000','exclegalrera','2021-08-03 16:33:22.000'),(8110,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-04 01:45:08.000',2327,'AdCNo01422021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-04 01:45:08.656','','2021-08-04 01:45:08.656','','In the present complaint, the Complainant has sought the following reliefs (1) Offer of possession letter dated 15.04.2021 be declared illegal. (2) Respondent be directed to (i) complete all amenities as promised and after obtaining Completion as well as Occupation Certificate, offer possession to complainant. (ii) produce on record Sanctioned Site Plans, revised Site plans etc. (iii) ensure payment of Default Assured return with interest. (iv) ensure timely payment of Assured return every month till actual physical possession is delivered after completing development in all respects and obtaining Completion/ Occupation certificate. (v) For the harassment caused, respondent be directed to pay compensation. The Complaint was returned online on 01.08.2021 to the Complainant to remove the objections in terms of Circular No. RERA/PB/Legal/24 dated 05.03.2021 issued by the Authority. In response to that, Counsel for the Complainant while resubmitting the complaint vide his email dated 03.08.2021 has submitted that the compensation is being sought under Form N, accordingly, requested to place the same before the Ld. Adjudicating Officer as it is. A copy email dated 03.08.2021 is placed on file for kind perusal please. Since it is apparent that most of the reliefs sought fall under the purview of Authority, the matter may be fixed for preliminary hearing to know the relief of the Complainant in terms of Circular dated 05.03.2021 issued by the Authority.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-04 01:45:08.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-04 01:45:08.000'),(8111,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-08-04 10:01:57.000',2327,'AdCNo01422021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-08-04 10:01:57.890','','2021-08-04 10:01:57.890','','\r\nThe LA branch is pointed out that the complainant has sought directions to respondent to provide the possession of the property and all the basic amenities as promised to the complainant along with interest, compensation and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench.  Let notice be issued to the complainant for Preliminary Hearing for 25.08.2021 to clarify the relief to be claimed. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-08-04 10:01:57.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-08-04 10:01:57.000'),(8112,440004,'999','2021-08-04 11:31:17.000',2343,'AdCNo01502021UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-08-04 11:31:17.000','999','2021-08-04 11:31:17.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-08-04 11:31:17.000','sysadmin','2021-08-04 11:31:17.000'),(8113,440004,'999','2021-08-04 11:45:40.000',2344,'AdCNo01512021UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-08-04 11:45:40.000','999','2021-08-04 11:45:40.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-08-04 11:45:40.000','sysadmin','2021-08-04 11:45:40.000'),(8114,440061,'exclegalrera','2021-08-04 12:28:18.000',2327,'AdCNo01422021','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-04 12:28:18.937','','2021-08-04 12:28:18.937','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 25.08.2021 for Preliminary Hearing regarding the complaint as per directions.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2021-08-04 12:28:18.000','exclegalrera','2021-08-04 12:28:18.000'),(8115,440001,'999','2021-08-06 10:10:33.000',2358,'AdCNo01622021','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-08-06 10:10:33.000','999','2021-08-06 10:10:33.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-08-06 10:10:33.000','sysadmin','2021-08-06 10:10:33.000'),(8116,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2021-08-06 14:45:03.000',1429,'AdCNo13202019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-06 14:45:05.578','','2021-08-06 14:45:05.578','','Complaint stands partly accepted vide order dated 04.08.2021.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2021-08-06 14:45:03.000','systemanalyst.rera','2021-08-06 14:45:03.000'),(8117,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 14:40:59.000',2304,'AdCNo01272021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 14:41:02.213','','2021-08-08 14:41:02.213','','You have annexed one more complaint furnishing the facts in detail and relief sought. In this regard, it is submitted that you are required to furnish your facts under the \'Facts of the Case\' in the prescribed form. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 14:40:59.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 14:40:59.000'),(8118,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 15:44:37.000',2323,'AdCNo01382021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 15:44:40.385','','2021-08-08 15:44:40.385','','The complaint is in context of two allotments of apartments in the same project and its exchange. For the purpose, two allotment letters have been issued to the same complainants. Accordingly, two separate complaints needs to be filed by the complainants.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 15:44:37.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 15:44:37.000'),(8119,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 18:33:48.000',2333,'AdCNo01462021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 18:33:51.041','','2021-08-08 18:33:51.041','','(i)	You have annexed an application for the award of compensation under Section 31 read with Section 71 of RERA Act along with an affidavit with the present complaint. In this regard, it is submitted that you are required to furnish your facts and relief under the \'Facts of the Case\' in the prescribed complaint form only. (ii) You have sought two reliefs i.e. delivery of possession of plot or Refund of amount with interest, which are mutually exclusive. Relief may be specified as per the provisions of the Act.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 18:33:48.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 18:33:48.000'),(8120,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 18:35:02.000',2332,'AdCNo01452021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 18:35:04.838','','2021-08-08 18:35:04.838','','(i)	You have annexed an application for the award of compensation under Section 31 read with Section 71 of RERA Act along with an affidavit with the present complaint. In this regard, it is submitted that you are required to furnish your facts and relief under the \'Facts of the Case\' in the prescribed complaint form only. (ii) You have sought two reliefs i.e. delivery of possession of plot or Refund of amount with interest, which are mutually exclusive. Relief may be specified as per the provisions of the Act.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 18:35:02.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 18:35:02.000'),(8121,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:02:21.000',2344,'AdCNo01512021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 19:02:23.947','','2021-08-08 19:02:23.947','','The present Complaint has been filed against an unregistered project Emerging Valley against \" MANAGING DIRECTOR, EMERGING INDIA HOUSING CORPORATION\". The respondents have been impleaded by name in the matter. A confirmation Letter (Annexure A-2) in place of Allotment Letter, has been annexed as one of the six mandatory documents for filing a complaint against an unregistered project. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant has sought refund of entire amount along with interest and compensation. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders/directions please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:02:21.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:02:21.000'),(8122,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:21:01.000',2356,'AdCNo01582021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 19:21:04.182','','2021-08-08 19:21:04.182','','The name of the 2nd Complainant/Applicant is not correct as per record. The same may be corrected and resubmit it.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:21:01.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:21:01.000'),(8123,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:28:30.000',2357,'AdCNo01602021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 19:28:33.260','','2021-08-08 19:28:33.260','','\r\nThe complaint has been filed against an unregistered project known as \' Fountain Chowk, Mall Road, Patiala\'. One of the six mandatory documents for filing a complaint against an unregistered project is required but the same has not been submitted with the complaint. The complainant has annexed a copy of letter dated 13.05.2016 under the heading of \'Allotment Letter\' (Annexure A 1) through which 15 percent of the auctioned amount has been demanded. From the perusal of the documents annexed, it reveals that the money has been received from the complainant on account of allotment of site through auction. Since the project in question is a government project advertised by PUDA, the present complaint may be considered for further proceedings/hearing. PUDA, Patiala had informed that possession of the allotted unit could not be offered for some reason and the amount paid by the complainants was refunded without interest. Further, the complainants followed up with the respondent for payment of interest and compensation but the same has not been paid by PUDA. Accordingly, the complainants have prayed for payment of interest, compensation and litigation cost. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further directions please. \r\n',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:28:30.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:28:30.000'),(8124,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:43:12.000',2355,'AdCNo01612021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 19:43:15.119','','2021-08-08 19:43:15.119','','Annexure C III and Allotment Letter are the same and both have been uploaded under the heading \"List of Enclosure\". Uploaded Allotment Letter is in fact invitation for allotment.  One of the six mandatory documents (i) CLU (ii) LOI (iii) Allotment Letter (iv) Agreement to Sell (iv) Regularization Certificate and (vi) License to develop Colony, for filing a complaint against an unregistered project is required but the same has not been uploaded with the complaint.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:43:12.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 19:43:12.000'),(8125,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 20:59:13.000',2330,'AdCNo01472021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 20:59:16.463','','2021-08-08 20:59:16.463','','(i) You have sought two reliefs i.e. providing of possession of apartment and Refund of amount with interest, which are mutually exclusive. One relief may be specified as per the provisions of the Act (ii) Copies of 38 pages of Brochure have not been uploaded and submitted. The same may be uploaded and submitted. (iii) Page Number mentioned at Sr. No. 8 of the Complaint Form are not correct. (iv) Every Vakalatnama filed by any Advocate, should be affixed with one Advocate Welfare Fund Stamp of Rs. 15. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the same. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 20:59:13.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 20:59:13.000'),(8126,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 21:21:55.000',2335,'AdCNo01482021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 21:21:58.166','','2021-08-08 21:21:58.166','','(i) You have sought two reliefs i.e. providing of possession of apartment and Refund of amount with interest, which are mutually exclusive. One relief may be specified as per the provisions of the Act (ii) Copies of 38 pages of Brochure have not been uploaded and submitted. The same may be uploaded and submitted. (iii) Page Number mentioned at Sr. No. 8 of the Complaint Form are not correct. (iv) Every Vakalatnama filed by any Advocate, should be affixed with one Advocate Welfare Fund Stamp of Rs. 15. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the same. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 21:21:55.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 21:21:55.000'),(8127,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:06:06.000',2276,'AdCNo01112021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 22:06:08.807','','2021-08-08 22:06:08.807','','The complaint has been filed against an unregistered project known as \' PWD (Public Health), Fountain Chownk, Mall Road, Patiala\'. One of the six mandatory documents for filing a complaint against an unregistered project is required but the same has not been submitted with the complaint. The complainant has annexed auction details under the heading of \'Agreement to Sell\' (Annexure C 2). From the perusal of the documents annexed, it reveals that the money has been received from the complainant on account of allotment of site through auction. Since the project in question is a government project advertised by PUDA, the present complaint may be considered for further proceedings/hearing. PUDA, Patiala had informed that possession of the allotted unit could not be offered for some reason and the amount paid by the complainants was refunded without interest. Further, the complainants followed up with the respondent for payment of interest and compensation but the same has not been paid by PUDA. Accordingly, the complainants have prayed for payment of interest, compensation and litigation cost. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further directions please. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:06:06.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:06:06.000'),(8128,440062,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:46:28.000',2284,'AdCNo01162021','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 22:46:31.322','','2021-08-08 22:46:31.322','','Hard Copy of the complaint is required ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:46:28.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:46:28.000'),(8129,440062,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:47:11.000',2279,'AdCNo01152021','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 22:47:14.229','','2021-08-08 22:47:14.229','','Hard copy of the complaint is required ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:47:11.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:47:11.000'),(8130,440062,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:47:45.000',2271,'AdCNo01062021UR','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-08 22:47:48.072','','2021-08-08 22:47:48.072','','Hard copy of the complaint is required',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:47:45.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-08 22:47:45.000'),(8131,440004,'999','2021-08-09 13:57:06.000',2323,'AdCNo01382021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Fo