s per your request received through email dated 13.08.2021, the complaint is returned for amendments.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2021-08-13 10:49:23.000','exclegalrera','2021-08-13 10:49:23.000'),(8172,440004,'999','2021-08-13 11:51:54.000',2349,'AdCNo01562021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-08-13 11:51:54.000','999','2021-08-13 11:51:54.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-08-13 11:51:54.000','sysadmin','2021-08-13 11:51:54.000'),(8173,440001,'999','2021-08-13 12:35:43.000',2365,'AdCNo01672021','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-08-13 12:35:43.000','999','2021-08-13 12:35:43.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-08-13 12:35:43.000','sysadmin','2021-08-13 12:35:43.000'),(8174,440059,'exclegalrera','2021-08-13 17:16:30.000',2326,'AdCNo01412021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-13 17:16:32.104','','2021-08-13 17:16:32.104','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 17.09.2021 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2021-08-13 17:16:30.000','exclegalrera','2021-08-13 17:16:30.000'),(8175,440001,'999','2021-08-15 12:00:30.000',2262,'AdCNo01682021','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-08-15 12:00:30.000','999','2021-08-15 12:00:30.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-08-15 12:00:30.000','sysadmin','2021-08-15 12:00:30.000'),(8176,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-15 17:34:14.000',2356,'AdCNo01582021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-15 17:34:17.363','','2021-08-15 17:34:17.363','','The complaint has been filed against an unregistered project known as PWD (Public Health) Mall Road Fountain Chowk site Patiala. No document of the six mandatory documents for filing a complaint against an unregistered project has been submitted with the complaint. The complainant has annexed a copy of letter dated 13.06.2016 under the heading of Allotment Letter (Annexure A 1) through which 15 percent of the auctioned amount has been demanded. From the perusal of the documents annexed, it reveals that the money has been received from the complainant on account of allotment of site through auction. Since the project in question is a government project advertised by PUDA, the present complaint may be considered for further proceedings/hearing. PUDA, Patiala had informed that possession of the allotted unit could not be offered for some reason and the amount paid by the complainant was refunded without interest. Further, the complainant followed up with the respondent for payment of interest and compensation but the same has not been paid by PUDA. Accordingly, the complainant has prayed for payment of interest, compensation and litigation cost. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further directions please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-15 17:34:14.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-15 17:34:14.000'),(8177,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-15 21:36:00.000',2333,'AdCNo01462021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-15 21:36:03.582','','2021-08-15 21:36:03.582','','You have not removed all the objections as raised on 08.08.2021. You have sought two reliefs i.e. delivery of possession of plot or Refund of amount with interest, which are mutually exclusive. Relief may be specified as per the provisions of the Act. For the relief part, you may refer to the Circular dated 05.03.2021 issued by the Authority on its web portal. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-15 21:36:00.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-15 21:36:00.000'),(8178,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-15 21:50:53.000',2332,'AdCNo01452021UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-15 21:50:56.098','','2021-08-15 21:50:56.098','','You have not removed all the objections as raised on 08.08.2021. You have sought two reliefs i.e. delivery of possession of plot or Refund of amount with interest, which are mutually exclusive. Relief may be specified as per the provisions of the Act. For the relief part, you may refer to the Circular dated 05.03.2021 issued by the Authority on its web portal. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-15 21:50:53.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-15 21:50:53.000'),(8179,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-15 22:15:21.000',2284,'AdCNo01162021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-15 22:15:23.817','','2021-08-15 22:15:23.817','','The present Complaint is about a commercial space booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" ISBT cum Commercial Complex\" and the same has been filed against \" C & C Towers Limited\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents alongwith interest from the respective dates of deposits, compensation and litigation expenses.  Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-15 22:15:21.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-15 22:15:21.000'),(8180,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-15 22:20:18.000',2271,'AdCNo01062021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-15 22:20:20.785','','2021-08-15 22:20:20.785','','The present Complaint is about a plot booked by Complainant in an unregistered project \"Gulmohar residency,\" and the same has been filed against \"Shiwalik Realtech Pvt.Ltd\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents alongwith interest from the respective dates of deposits, compensation and litigation expenses.  Complainant has enclosed the copy of \'Allotment letter\' and \'Agreement to Sell\' for filing a complaint against an unregistered project. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-15 22:20:18.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-15 22:20:18.000'),(8184,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-16 08:40:17.000',2359,'AdCNo01662021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-16 08:40:20.613','','2021-08-16 08:40:20.613','','As per your request received through email dated 13.08.2021, the complaint is returned for rectification therein.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-16 08:40:17.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-16 08:40:17.000'),(8185,440007,'exclegalrera','2021-08-16 09:25:31.000',219