','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-08-20 17:24:50.000','999','2021-08-20 17:24:50.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-08-20 17:24:50.000','sysadmin','2021-08-20 17:24:50.000'),(8234,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-22 12:35:33.000',2218,'AdCNo00612021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-22 12:35:36.082','','2021-08-22 12:35:36.082','','3rd page of Annexure P-2 has not been uploaded. Annexure P-3 has been uploaded in place of 3rd page of Annexure P-2. Please correct the same and resubmit.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-22 12:35:33.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-22 12:35:33.000'),(8235,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-08-22 13:04:36.000',1736,'AdCNo17752020','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-22 13:04:39.316','','2021-08-22 13:04:39.316','','Complaint has been resubmitted online on 03.08.2021 without removing objections raised on 15.01.2021. The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 02.08.2021 ordered that the online complaint be returned to the complainant with the direction to rectify the defects and then rectified complaint be filed on or before 31.08.2021 alongwith hard copy of the same. Accordingly, the complaint is returned to complainant for compliance of order dated 02.08.2021 passed by the Ld. Adjudicating Officer.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-22 13:04:36.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-22 13:04:36.000'),(8236,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-22 17:46:47.000',2328,'AdCNo01442021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-22 17:46:50.551','','2021-08-22 17:46:50.551','','The present Complaint is about a flat allotted to the Complainant in a RERA registered project \" Dream Homes\" and the same has been filed against \" M/s Dream Homes\". Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). The Complainant has sought refund of amount along with interest. It was observed that Annexure A and Annexure B mentioned in the Allotment Letter have not been annexed with the Allotment Letter. Accordingly, the complaint was returned to complainant for the same. While resubmitting his complaint, Complainant\'s Counsel vide his email dated 20.07.2021 submitted that there are not such documents with the complainant.  The Complainant\'s Counsel has apprised that reference of Annexure A and B states that Annexure A is Basic Sale Price that is mentioned on page 10 of an allotment letter and reference of Annexure B is payment plan that is also on page 10, so there are no such documents like Annexure A and B, it is just a formality which has been done by the builder to accept the money but in the reality, the builder has not provided such papers but details of those papers are already on page 10 of allotment letter. He has requested to remove the objection and list the case. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders/directions please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-22 17:46:47.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-22 17:46:47.000'),(8237,440056,'legaladvrera','2021-08-22 19:37:30.000',2177,'AdCNo00352021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-22 19:37:33.019','','2021-08-22 19:37:33.019','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 05.08.2021 had directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant to rectify the objections as raised by the Legal Branch and then rectified complaint be filed on or before 24.08.2021 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint was returned online for the compliance of the Order dated 05.08.2021. Online rectified Complaint has been resubmitted by the complainant on 20.08.2021. The Complainant has sought waiver of interest and interest for every month of delay till the handing over of the possession under section 18 of RERA Act. The relief of interest for delay period of possession lies with the Authority. The Complainant vide his email dated 17.03.2021 (placed on file for kind reference) has also submitted that inadvertently he filed his complaint under Form N instead of Form M. so kindly consider his complaint against Form \'M\'. In view of the above, the complaint may transfer to Authority for further proceedings. The Complainant may also be directed to submit the hard copies of complaint subsequent to transfer of complaint online or providing the complaint transfer number online. Submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further directions please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-08-22 19:37:30.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-22 19:37:30.000'),(8238,440001,'999','2021-08-23 15:08:15.000',2370,'AdCNo01732021','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-08-23 15:08:15.000','999','2021-08-23 15:08:15.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-08-23 15:08:15.000','sysadmin','2021-08-23 15:08:15.000'),(8239,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2021-08-23 15:13:34.000',1866,'AdCNo16402020UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-08-23 15:13:37.566','','2021-08-23 15:13:37.566','','Complaint dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 10.05.2021.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2021-08-23 15:13:34.000','systemanalyst.rera','2021-08-23 15:13:34.000'),(8240,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2021-08-23 15:33:11.000',1942,'AdCNo16852020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judge