440004,'999','2021-08-31 19:32:24.000',2150,'AdCNo00162021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-08-31 19:32:24.000','999','2021-08-31 19:32:24.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-08-31 19:32:24.000','sysadmin','2021-08-31 19:32:24.000'),(8289,440063,'legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:51:56.000',2327,'AdCNo01422021','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-01 01:51:57.262','','2021-09-01 01:51:57.262','','During the course of the hearing held on 25.08.2021, it has been stated by the Complainant that he does not  press the relief of compensation. The Authority has the jurisdiction qua the other reliefs i.e. completion of amenities as promised by the respondent, assured return amount with interest and production of site plans etc. Accordingly, the present complaint has been transferred to Authority for 08.09.2021. The Complaint was directed to appear before the Authority on the said date for further proceedings.  ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:51:56.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:51:56.000'),(8290,440064,'legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:53:05.000',2327,'AdCNo01422021TR-AUTH00432021','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Role Authority Desk','NA','2021-09-01 01:53:05.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:53:05.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:53:05.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:53:05.000'),(8291,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:54:22.000',2327,'AdCNo01422021TR-AUTH00432021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-01 01:54:22.669','','2021-09-01 01:54:22.669','','During the course of the hearing held on 25.08.2021, it has been stated by the Complainant that he does not  press the relief of compensation. The Authority has the jurisdiction qua the other reliefs i.e. completion of amenities as promised by the respondent, assured return amount with interest and production of site plans etc. Accordingly, the present complaint has been transferred to Authority for 08.09.2021. The Complaint was directed to appear before the Authority on the said date for further proceedings.  In compliance to above, the complaint is transferred to Authority for further proceedings.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:54:22.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:54:22.000'),(8292,440001,'999','2021-09-01 03:51:34.000',2377,'AdCNo01782021UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-09-01 03:51:34.000','999','2021-09-01 03:51:34.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-09-01 03:51:34.000','sysadmin','2021-09-01 03:51:34.000'),(8293,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-09-01 08:52:18.000',2345,'AdCNo01532021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-01 08:52:18.637','','2021-09-01 08:52:18.637','','(i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. (ii) You may give the facts in detail in order to more clarity. For the relief part, you may refer to the Circular dated 05.03.2021 issued by the Authority on its web portal.  (iii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. (iv) All documents have been executed in favour of Satinder Kaur but the Complaint has been filed by Bakshinder Singh. (v) PDF Print of the Complaint is not attached. Only copies of documents have been submitted by post. After taking print out of the complaint, the same should be duly signed by the Complainant. (vi) All submitted documents in hard copies have not been uploaded online. Copies of the Annexures should be readable. (vii) Annexure Reference Number as Annexure C-1, C-2 and so on, may be mentioned at Sr. No. 8 of the Complaint Form. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the complaint. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in resubmitting the complaint.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-09-01 08:52:18.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-01 08:52:18.000'),(8294,440061,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 09:27:23.000',2304,'AdCNo01272021','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-01 09:27:23.700','','2021-09-01 09:27:23.700','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 15.09.2021 for Preliminary Hearing regarding the complaint as per directions',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 09:27:23.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-01 09:27:23.000'),(8295,440058,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 09:35:22.000',2351,'AdCNo01652021','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-01 09:35:23.122','','2021-09-01 09:35:23.122','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 05.10.2021 as per directions.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 09:35:22.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-01 09:35:22.000'),(8296,440059,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 09:35:59.000',2351,'AdCNo01652021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d',