along with interest from the respective dates of deposits and compensation. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 15:53:39.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-01 15:53:39.000'),(8309,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 15:55:19.000',2324,'AdCNo01402021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-01 15:55:20.622','','2021-09-01 15:55:20.622','','Complaint Resubmitted after rectifying the defects .The present Complaint is about a Commercial space booked by Complainants in a RERA registered project \" Centrum\" and the same has been filed against \" Gupta Builders and Promoters Pvt Ltd\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits and compensation. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 15:55:19.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-01 15:55:19.000'),(8310,440001,'999','2021-09-01 16:08:01.000',2374,'AdCNo01802021UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-09-01 16:08:01.000','999','2021-09-01 16:08:01.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-09-01 16:08:01.000','sysadmin','2021-09-01 16:08:01.000'),(8311,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 17:11:13.000',2150,'AdCNo00162021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-01 17:11:14.278','','2021-09-01 17:11:14.278','','Complaint Resubmitted after rectifying the defects .The present Complaint is about a 3BHK Flat booked by Complainants in a RERA registered project \" Sanskriti Homes\" and the same has been filed against \" Sanskriti Golden Oak Real Estate Pvt Ltd\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits and compensation and Litigation Expenses. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 17:11:13.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-01 17:11:13.000'),(8312,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 17:38:18.000',2189,'AdCNo00442021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-01 17:38:18.825','','2021-09-01 17:38:18.825','','After Scrutiny of the resubmitted Complaint, it has been observed as under (i) Uploaded Annexure i.e Apartment Allottee arrangement contains 37 pages but Page Number mentioned at Sr. No. 8 of the Form reveals 25 pages (ii) Hard Copy Submitted does not have Signatures of the Complainant. Please remove the defects and resubmit the same',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 17:38:18.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-01 17:38:18.000'),(8313,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 17:54:19.000',2190,'AdCNo00452021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-01 17:54:20.169','','2021-09-01 17:54:20.169','','After Scrutiny of the resubmitted Complaint, it has been observed as under\r\n(i) Page Number 4-25 and 32-34 of Annexure C-3 ( Apartment Allottee .Arrangement) \r\n(ii) Please submit the Original Pdf Complaint duly signed by the Complainant. Have not been signed by the Developer. Please Clarify and remove the defects and resubmit the same',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-01 17:54:19.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-01 17:54:19.000'),(8314,440063,'legaladvrera','2021-09-02 09:28:30.000',2177,'AdCNo00352021','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-02 09:28:31.731','','2021-09-02 09:28:31.731','','During the course of the hearing held on 24.08.2021, it has been observed that the complainant himself has withdrawn the relief of compensation in the rectified complaint, submitted online and the complainant has sought interest for every month of delay. Accordingly, it was directed to transfer the complaint to Authority and the complainant was directed to appear before the Authority on 08.09.2021 for further proceedings. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-09-02 09:28:30.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-02 09:28:30.000'),(8315,440064,'legaladvrera','2021-09-02 09:29:20.000',2177,'AdCNo00352021TR-AUTH00442021','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Role Authority Desk','NA','2021-09-02 09:29:20.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-02 09:29:20.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-09-02 09:29:20.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-02 09:29:20.000'),(8316,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-09-02 09:39:38.000',2359,'AdCNo01662021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-02 09:39:39.887','','2021-09-02 09:39:39.887','','The present Complaint is about a Flat  booked by Complainants in a RERA registered project \" SANDWOODS OPULENCIA\" and the same has\r\nbeen filed against \" Sandwoods Infratech Pvt Ltd\" previously known as \"Sandwoods Infratech Projects Pvt Ltd\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with\r\ninterest from the respective dates of deposits, compensation and litigation expenses. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified\r\nwith Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-02 09:39:38.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-02 09:39:38.000'),(8317,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-09-02 10:45:35.000',2218,'AdCNo00612021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-02 10:45:36.341','','2021-09-02 10:45:36.341','','Complaint Resubmitted after rectifying the defects .The present Complaint is about a Commercial space booked by Complainants in a RERA registered project \" Chandigarh Citi Centre\" and the same has been filed against \" M/s Chandigarh Citi Centre\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits . Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-02 10:45:35.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-02 10:45:35.000'),(8318,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-09-02 12:24:07.000',2361,'AdCNo01642021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-02 12:24:08.153','','2021-09-02 12:24:08.153','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) Under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the RERA Act, if an allottee wants to stay in the project for taking possession, he can seek interest as per Rules on the deposited amount for the delayed period in handing over of possession and for that cause of action and relief, complainant is required to file complaint under Form M with Authority. (ii) In terms of Section 71 of the Act, the power lies with the Adjudicating Officer for the purpose of adjudging compensation in Form N, please clarify (iii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. (iv) page numbering of Annexure C-2 not as per uploaded documents. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-02 12:24:07.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-02 12:24:07.000'),(8319,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-09-02 16:46:29.000',2350,'AdCNo01702021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-02 16:46:30.216','','2021-09-02 16:46:30.216','','(i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. (ii)Copy of Agreement should be signed by both the Parties but Signature/Stamp of Promoter is missing on uploaded Document  (iii) Page 8 of Annexure-1 is not readable.(iv) Page Numbering in online Complaint is not in Sequence i.e Page numbering from 16 to 19 is missing. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the complaint. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in resubmitting the complaint.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-02 16:46:29.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-02 16:46:29.000'),(8320,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-09-03 11:12:35.000',2376,'AdCNo01752021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-03 11:12:36.997','','2021-09-03 11:12:36.997','','The present Complaint is about a Commercial space booked by Complainants in a RERA registered project \" Chandigarh Citi Centre\" and the same has been filed against \" Citi Centre Developers\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks primary relief of r000000000efund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits, and compensation. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-03 11:12:35.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-03 11:12:35.000'),(8321,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-09-03 13:23:51.000',2305,'AdCNo01282021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-03 13:23:52.934','','2021-09-03 13:23:52.934','','During the course of hearing held on 01.09.2021, an application was filed on behalf of the complainant for amendment of the online complaint. The Ld. Bench allowed the same and directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant with the direction to amend the same and then amended complaint be filed on or before 23.09.2021. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date with advance copy to the opposite party. Accordingly, the complaint is returned for compliance of the above.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-03 13:23:51.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-03 13:23:51.000'),(8322,440001,'999','2021-09-03 17:18:07.000',2385,'AdCNo01812021','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant wi