horized representative on 11.10.2021 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 10:32:10.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-06 10:32:10.000'),(8334,440059,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 10:34:16.000',2274,'AdCNo01092021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-06 10:34:18.943','','2021-09-06 10:34:18.943','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 08.10.2021 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 10:34:16.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-06 10:34:16.000'),(8335,440059,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 10:47:19.000',2324,'AdCNo01402021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-06 10:47:22.553','','2021-09-06 10:47:22.553','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 08.10.2021 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 10:47:19.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-06 10:47:19.000'),(8336,440007,'legaladvrera','2021-09-06 11:22:59.000',2385,'AdCNo01812021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-06 11:23:02.365','','2021-09-06 11:23:02.365','','As per your request received through email dated 03.09.2021 and 06.09.2021, the present online complaint is returned for rectification therein.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-09-06 11:22:59.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-06 11:22:59.000'),(8337,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 12:37:49.000',2249,'AdCNo00842021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-06 12:37:52.678','','2021-09-06 12:37:52.678','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) The present Complaint is filed by group of Allottees. As per Section 31 of the Act, Complaint can either be filed on behalf of Registered Resident Welfare Association or it can be filed individually/separately by each Allottee. (ii)Under proviso of Section 18 (1) of the RERA Act, if an allottee wants to stay in the project for taking possession, he can seek interest as per Rules on the deposited amount for the delayed period in handing over of possession and for that cause of action and relief, complainant is required to file complaint under Form M with Authority. (iii) In terms of Section 71 of the Act, the power lies with the Adjudicating Officer for the purpose of adjudging compensation in Form N, please clarify (iv) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 12:37:49.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-06 12:37:49.000'),(8338,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-09-06 13:36:01.000',2150,'AdCNo00162021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-09-06 13:36:04.662','','2021-09-06 13:36:04.662','','This case has been taken up today as I had to proceed on leave on 02.09.2021. As per report of the LA Branch, the rectified complaint has been submitted by the complainant.  Hard copies of the amended complaint have also been filed. Notice be issued to respondent nos.1 through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 12.10.2021 with direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-09-06 13:36:01.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-09-06 13:36:01.000'),(8339,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-09-06 13:37:35.000',2376,'AdCNo01752021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-09-06 13:37:38.459','','2021-09-06 13:37:38.459','','Complaint received.  Report of office perused and the complaint be registered.  Let notice be issued to the respondent no.1 through         E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 12.10.2021.  Respondent shall file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-09-06 13:37:35.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-09-06 13:37:35.000'),(8340,440058,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 13:51:17.000',2376,'AdCNo01752021','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-06 13:51:20.100','','2021-09-06 13:51:20.100','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 12.10.2021 as per directions.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 13:51:17.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-06 13:51:17.000'),(8341,440059,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 13:52:15.000',2376,'AdCNo01752021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-06 13:52:18.068','','2021-09-06 13:52:18.068','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 12.10.2021 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 13:52:15.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-06 13:52:15.000'),(8342,440059,'amlegalrera','2021-09-06 14:49:08.000',2150,'AdCNo00162021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-06 14:49:11.210','','2021-09-06 14:49:11.210','','Notice to Respondent No 1 to appear in person or through