vt Ltd\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits and compensation. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-09-07 11:00:33.000','amlegalrera','2021-09-07 11:00:33.000'),(8349,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-09-07 12:12:14.000',2177,'AdCNo00352021TR-AUTH00442021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-07 12:12:14.646','','2021-09-07 12:12:14.646','','During the course of the hearing held on 24.08.2021 before the Ld. Adjudicating officer, it was observed\r\nthat the complainant himself has withdrawn the relief of compensation in the rectified\r\ncomplaint, submitted online and the complainant has sought interest for every month of\r\ndelay. Accordingly, it was directed to transfer the complaint to Authority and the complainant\r\nwas directed to appear before the Authority on 08.09.2021 for further proceedings. The hard copy of the rectified Complaint bearing transfer number Adc00352021TR-AUTH00442021has been received on 06.09.2021 in this office. Accordingly, the same is submitted for kind consideration and further orders/directions please.\r\n',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-09-07 12:12:14.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-07 12:12:14.000'),(8350,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-09-07 12:13:06.000',2363,'AdCNo01722021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-09-07 12:13:06.584','','2021-09-07 12:13:06.584','','(i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the 