er the provisions of the Act. For the relief part, you may refer to the Circular dated 05.03.2021 issued by the Authority on its web portal. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in resubmitting the Complaint',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-10-11 12:43:19.000','amlegalrera','2021-10-11 12:43:19.000'),(8577,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-10-11 13:13:01.000',2309,'AdCNo01292021TR-AUTH00472021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-10-11 13:13:04.603','','2021-10-11 13:13:04.603','','The present Complaint is about a plot allotted to the Complainant in a RERA registered project \"SUNNY BASANT\" and the same has been filed against \"Damini Resorts & Builders Pvt Ltd\". As per Order dated 16.09.2021 passed by the Ld. Adjudicating Officer, the complaint was transferred to Hon\'ble Authority for 29.09.2021 for proceeding further and the complainant was directed to appear before the Authority on 29.09.2021. On 29.09.2021, Counsel for the complainant appeared before the Authority and has withdrawn the relief of compensation and only seek relief regarding basic amenities. As per Order dated 29.09.2021, the online complaint was returned to the complainant for filing amended complaint. He has rectified the online complaint and resubmitted its hard copies. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-10-11 13:13:01.000','legaladvrera','2021-10-11 13:13:01.000'),(8578,440063,'legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:03:34.000',2333,'AdCNo01462021UR','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-10-12 00:03:37.212','','2021-10-12 00:03:37.212','','The Complainant vide his email dated 11.10.2021 has requested to transfer the present complaint from Form N to Form M for proper adjudication of the case. The Complaint sought delivery of possession along with compensation. In terms of circular dated 05.03.2021 passed by the Authority, the primary relief is possession of plot, accordingly, complaint lies in Form M with the Authority.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:03:34.000','legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:03:34.000'),(8579,440064,'legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:03:58.000',2333,'AdCNo01462021URTR-AUTH00482021','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Role Authority Desk','NA','2021-10-12 00:03:58.000','legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:03:58.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:03:58.000','legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:03:58.000'),(8580,440063,'legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:09:30.000',2332,'AdCNo01452021UR','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-10-12 00:09:33.759','','2021-10-12 00:09:33.759','','The Complainant vide his email dated 11.10.2021 has requested to transfer the present complaint from Form N to Form M for proper adjudication of the case. The Complaint sought delivery of possession along with compensation. In terms of circular dated 05.03.2021 passed by the Authority, the primary relief is possession of plot, accordingly, complaint lies in Form M with the Authority.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:09:30.000','legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:09:30.000'),(8581,440064,'legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:09:53.000',2332,'AdCNo01452021URTR-AUTH00492021','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Role Authority Desk','NA','2021-10-12 00:09:53.000','legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:09:53.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:09:53.000','legaladvrera','2021-10-12 00:09:53.000'),(8582,440001,'999','2021-10-12 10:11:00.000