52021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-10-25 14:32:39.418','','2021-10-25 14:32:39.418','','Complaint received.  Report of office perused and the complaint be registered.  Let notice be issued to the respondent no.1 through               E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 01.12.2021 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-10-25 14:32:37.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-10-25 14:32:37.000'),(8678,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-10-25 14:55:49.000',2451,'AdCNo02262021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-10-25 14:55:51.621','','2021-10-25 14:55:51.621','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. (ii)In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. (iii) Number of pages and page numbering of Annexures is not done . The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit the hard copies of rectified Complaint in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-10-25 14:55:49.000','amlegalrera','2021-10-25 14:55:49.000'),(8679,440004,'999','2021-10-25 15:54:25.000',2438,'AdCNo02092021UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)