,'','2021-10-25 18:09:36.200','','2021-10-25 18:09:36.200','','(i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded/mentioned the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. You may refer the RERA website for the address and contact details of the main respondent. (ii) Complainant name should be as per the Certificate of Registration (Annexure C-1).',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-10-25 18:09:34.000','legaladvrera','2021-10-25 18:09:34.000'),(8684,440058,'amlegalrera','2021-10-26 12:43:52.000',2320,'AdCNo01372021','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-10-26 12:43:52.871','','2021-10-26 12:43:52.871','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 01.12.2021 as per directions.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-10-26 12:43:52.000','amlegalrera','2021-10-26 12:43:52.000'),(8685,440059,'amlegalrera','2021-10-26 12:44:39.000',2320,'AdCNo01372021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-10-26 12:44:39.668','','2021-10-26 12:44:39.668','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 01.12.2021 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-10-26 12:44:39.000','amlegalrera','2021-10-26 12:44:39.000'),(8686,440058,'amlegalrera','2021-10-26 13:03:15.000',2318,'AdCNo01352021','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-10-26 13:03:15.231','','2021-10-26 13:03:15.231','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 01.12.2021 as per directions.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-10-26 13:03:15.000','amlegalrera','2021-10-26 13:03:15.000'),(8687,440058,'amlegalre