galrera','2021-10-27 09:29:02.000',2350,'AdCNo01702021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-10-27 09:29:02.356','','2021-10-27 09:29:02.356','','The present Complaint is about purchase of Six Flats vide Single Mutual Agreement which were booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \"WHITE TOWER\" and the same has been filed against \" M/s WHITE TOWER\". Promoter name in list of Registered Projects is \" WHITE TOWER AND BAKSHISH BUILDERS LIMITED\" but the name of Promoter in RERA Registration Certificate is \" WHITE TOWER\". Complainant has alleged that Respondent has sold the Flats without legal Title in the Project land and has also given wrong information with regards to inventory sold at the time of RERA Registration. Complainant has now opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks primary relief of refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits, litigation charges and compensation. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-10-27 09:29:02.000','amlegalrera','2021-10-27 09:29:02.000'),(8696,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2021-10-27 13:22:31.000',2350,'AdCNo01702021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-10-27 13:22:32.028','','2021-10-27 13:22:32.028','','Complaint received.  Report of office perused and the complaint be registered.  Let notice be issued to respondents no.1 to 3 through               E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 06.12.2021 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudica