onymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-11-08 09:54:29.000','999','2021-11-08 09:54:29.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-11-08 09:54:29.000','sysadmin','2021-11-08 09:54:29.000'),(8766,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 12:54:52.000',1149,'AdCNo02292021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-11-08 12:54:54.847','','2021-11-08 12:54:54.847','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. So online Complaint is returned. Please submit the Complaint after removing the above said defects and submit the two copies of rectified Complaint in the Legal Branch. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 12:54:52.000','amlegalrera','2021-11-08 12:54:52.000'),(8767,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 13:38:44.000',2447,'AdCNo02212021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-11-08 13:38:46.222','','2021-11-08 13:38:46.222','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i)You have sought two reliefs i.e. providing of possession of plot and Refund of amount with interest and compensation, which are mutually exclusive, which cannot be given. Relief may be specified as per the provisions of the Act. You may see the Circular dated 05.03.2021 issued by the Authority on the website in this regard. (ii) Hard copies of Annexure C-3 and C-4 are not as per uploaded pages., (iii) An Advocate welfare stamp fee needs to be affixed on vakalatnama. So online Complaint is returned. Please submit the Complaint after removing the above said defects and submit the copies of rectified Complaint in the Legal Branch. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 13:38:44.000','amlegalrera','2021-11-08 13:38:44.000'),(8768,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 13:49:02.000',2466,'AdCNo02362021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-11-08 13:49:04.268','','2021-11-08 13:49:04.268','','The present Complaint is about a Commercial Unit booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" The present Complaint is about a Commercial Unit booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" FASHION TECHNOLOGY PARK\" and the same has been filed against \" CHANDIGARH OVERSEAS PVT LTD.\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project as promoter has failed to execute builder Buyers Agreement and seeks primary relief of refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits, and compensation. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please\" ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 13:49:02.000','amlegalrera','2021-11-08 13:49:02.000'),(8769,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 14:02:24.000',2468,'AdCNo02372021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-11-08 14:02:26.628','','2021-11-08 14:02:26.628','','The present Complaint is about a Residential Unit booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" The present Complaint is about a Commercial Unit booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" LOK NIWAS\" and the same has been filed against \" VERA DEVELOPERS PVT LTD.\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project as the complainant no longer wish to buy the said apartment and seeks primary relief of refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits, and compensation. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please\"',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 14:02:24.000','amlegalrera','2021-11-08 14:02:24.000'),(8770,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 14:58:51.000',2438,'AdCNo02092021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-11-08 14:58:53.643','','2021-11-08 14:58:53.643','','The present Complaint is about a Commercial Unit booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" UNICITY BUSINESS CENTRE\" and the same has been filed against \" UNICITY BUSINESS CENTRE.\". Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks primary relief of refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits, and compensation. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 14:58:51.000','amlegalrera','2021-11-08 14:58:51.000'),(8771,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 15:12:55.000',2397,'AdCNo01912021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-11-08 15:12:57.159','','2021-11-08 15:12:57.159','','The present Complaint is about a Commercial site booked by Complainant in a n un-registered project at Chhoti Baradari and the same has been filed against \" Estate Officer, Patiala Urban Planning and Development Authority)\". Complainant has sought refund of extra amount paid to the respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits, litigation charges and compensation. Complainant has clarified vied E-Mail dated 05.11.2021 that as he has already taken possession and has prayed for refund of surplus amount paid to Respondent, therefore his Complaints lies with the Adjudicating Officer. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 15:12:55.000','amlegalrera','2021-11-08 15:12:55.000'),(8772,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 15:21:16.000',2397,'AdCNo01912021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-11-08 15:21:18.331','','2021-11-08 15:21:18.331','','The present Complaint is about a Commercial site booked by Complainant\r\nin a n un-registered project at Chhoti Baradari and the same has been filed against \" Estate Officer, Patiala Urban Planning and Development Authority)\". Complainant has sought refund of extra amount paid to the respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits, litigation charges and compensation. Complainant has clarified vied E-Mail dated 05.11.2021 that as he has already taken possession and has prayed for refund of surplus amount paid to Respondent, therefore his Complaints lies with the Adjudicating Officer. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 15:21:16.000','amlegalrera','2021-11-08 15:21:16.000'),(8773,440056,'amlegalrera','2021-11-08 15:22:51.000',2395,'AdCNo01902021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf