e for the address and contact details of the main respondent. (iv) Additional Complainant may be impleaded. (v)  specific relief sought by you needs to be mentioned. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the same. In case the defects pointed out are not corrected, the matter shall be dealt with as per the said Regulations. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-11-09 00:43:31.000','legaladvrera','2021-11-09 00:43:31.000'),(8775,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-11-09 01:46:14.000',2333,'AdCNo01462021URTR-AUTH00482021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-11-09 01:46:16.440','','2021-11-09 01:46:16.440','','The Complaint is in respect of allotment of a plot in the project namely \"Preet City\". The complaint has been filed against the promoter \"Preet Land Promoters & Developers Private Ltd\". The said project is not registered with this  Authority.  The Complainant vide his email dated 11.10.2021 had requested to transfer the present complaint from Form N to Form M for proper adjudication of the case. The Complainant has sought delivery of possession of plot along with compensation. In terms of circular dated 05.03.2021 passed by the Authority, the primary relief is possession of plot, accordingly, complaint lies in Form M with the Authority. The complaint was transferred from Form N to Form M vide Reference Diary No. AdCNo.1462021URTR-AUTH00482021. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted, by Ex (L). Accordingly, the present Complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further directions/Orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2021-11-09 01:46:14.000','legaladvrera','2021-11-09 01:46:14.000'),(8776,440008,'legaladvrera','2021-11-09 01:51:21.000',2332,'AdCNo01452021URTR-AUTH00492021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint