nal Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-11-12 13:32:50.847','','2021-11-12 13:32:50.847','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. (ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. So online Complaint is returned. Please submit the Complaint after removing the above said defects and submit the two copies of rectified Complaint in the Legal Branch. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-11-12 13:32:49.000','amlegalrera','2021-11-12 13:32:49.000'),(8849,440007,'amlegalrera','2021-11-12 13:36:03.000',2471,'AdCNo02402021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-11-12 13:36:04.940','','2021-11-12 13:36:04.940','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. (ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. So online Complaint is returned. Please submit the Complaint after removing the above said def