 complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-01-18 09:56:18.000','amlegalrera','2022-01-18 09:56:18.000'),(9466,440091,'itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000',1811,'AdCNo16112020','','','Authority Desk','Bifurcate Case between different Bench(s)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','','With reference to email data, the case bifurcated for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant.',2,0,'itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000'),(9467,440091,'itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000',1791,'AdCNo15972020','','','Authority Desk','Bifurcate Case between different Bench(s)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','','With reference to email data, the case bifurcated for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant.',2,0,'itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000'),(9468,440091,'itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000',1793,'AdCNo15982020','','','Authority Desk','Bifurcate Case between different Bench(s)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','','With reference to email data, the case bifurcated for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant.',2,0,'itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000'),(9469,440091,'itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000',1753,'AdCNo15992020','','','Authority Desk','Bifurcate Case between different Bench(s)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','','With reference to email data, the case bifurcated for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant.',2,0,'itcellrera','2021-12-17 10:55:34.000','itcellrera','202