 required in filing/resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-02-18 13:17:41.000','amlegalrera','2022-02-18 13:17:41.000'),(10827,440092,'itcellrera','2022-02-18 14:12:27.000',1958,'AdCNo17512020','Case Bifurcated with Reference Diary Number','Case Bifurcated with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Bifurcated with Reference Diary Number','Role SystemAdmin','IT Cell RERA','2022-02-18 14:12:27.000','999','2022-02-18 14:12:27.000','In Process','Ref. Number BFNo00672022 in AdCNo17512020, and The Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 02.02.2022 had directed to send one set of paper-book of complaint to the concerned Bench of Authority for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant.\r\n',2,0,'itcellrera','2022-02-18 14:12:27.000','BifurcateAdmin','2022-02-18 14:12:27.000'),(10828,440001,'999','2020-09-15 18:28:59.000',2778,'AdCNo17512020BF','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-09-15 18:28:59.000','999','2020-09-15 18:28:59.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2020-09-15 18:28:59.000','BifurcateAdmin','2020-09-15 18:28:59.000'),(10829,440092,'itcellrera','2022-02-18 14:12:27.000',2778,'AdCNo17512020BF','Case Bifurcated with Reference Diary Number','Case Bifurcated with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Bifurcated with Reference Diary Number','Role SystemAdmin','IT Cell RERA','2022-02-18 14:12:27.000','999','2022-02-18 14:12:27.000','In Process','Ref. Number BFNo00672022 in AdCNo17512020, and The Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 02.02.2022 had directed to send one set of paper-book of complaint to the concerned Bench of Authority for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant.\r\n',2,0,'itcellrera','2022-02-18 14:12:27.000','BifurcateAdmin','2022-02-18 14:12:27.000'),(10830,440092,'itcellrera','2022-02-18 14:14: