eeks primary relief of refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits and litigation charges. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. The present complaint is entrusted to this bench of the Authority for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.\r\n\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-02-22 10:46:53.000','amlegalrera','2022-02-22 10:46:53.000'),(10940,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-02-22 10:59:44.000',2486,'AdCNo02482021TR-AUTH00522022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-02-22 10:59:44.193','','2022-02-22 10:59:44.193','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. (ii) Postal receipts in Annexure C-6 are not legible both online and in hard copy submitted. So online Complaint is returned. Please submit the Complaint after removing the above said defects and submit the two copies of rectified Complaint in the Legal Branch',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-02-22 10:59:44.000','amlegalrera','2022-02-22 10:59:44.000'),(10941,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-02-22 11:18:30.000',2751,'AdCNo00062022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-02-22 11:18:30.571','','2022-02-22 11:18:30.571','','he present Complaint is about a Residential unit booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" THE LAKE GROUP HOUSING\" and the same has been filed against \" OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENSION DEVELOPERS PVT LTD\". Complainant has alleged non delivery o