omplaint, following observations emerge (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in M/s Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints with prayer of Refund and interest on delayed period of possession now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation/Cost and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing/resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-03-15 13:33:08.000','amlegalrera','2022-03-15 13:33:08.000'),(11408,440004,'999','2022-03-15 13:45:38.000',2747,'AdCNo00052022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-03-15 13:45:38.000','999','2022-03-15 13:45:38.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-03-15 13:45:38.000','sysadmin','2022-03-15 13:45:38.000'),(11409,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2022-03-15 14:19:31.000',2590,'AdCNo16552020BFTR-AUTH00802021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-15 14:19:31.395','','2022-03-15 14:19:31.395','','Complaint accepted vide order dated 28.02.2022.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2022-03-15 14:19:31.000','systemanalyst.rera','2022-03-15 14:19:31.000'),(11410,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2022-03-15 14:35:28.000',2528,'AdCNo01962021BFTR-AUTH00562021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-15 14:35:28.395','','2022-03-15 14:35:28.395','','Complaint accepted vide order dated 28.02.2022.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2022-03-15 14:35:28.00