06.01.2022 directed to send one set of paper-book of complaint to the concerned Bench for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:47:27.000','amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:47:27.000'),(11675,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:54:29.000',2747,'AdCNo00052022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-25 15:54:30.887','','2022-03-25 15:54:30.887','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"PARKWOOD GLADE\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"M/s PARKWOOD DEVELOPERS PVT. LTD\". The Complainant had filed one Complaint with GC NO. 110 of 2018 which was allowed and refund was ordered by the Learned Authority. Now present Complaint is filed with prayer of compensation from Respondents. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:54:29.000','amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:54:29.000'),(11676,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:55:10.000',2056,'AdCNo17872020UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-25 15:55:12.293','','2022-03-25 15:55:12.293','','Complaint dismissed in default vide order dated 14.03.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:55:10.000','amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:55:10.000'),(11677,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:59:52.000',2054,'AdCNo17862020UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-25 15:59:54.152','','2022-03-25 15:59:54.152','','Complaint dismissed in default vide order dated 14.03.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:59:52.000','amlegalrera','2022-03-25 15:59:52.000'),(11678,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:05:58.000',2055,'AdCNo17852020UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-25 16:05:59.840','','2022-03-25 16:05:59.840','','Complaint dismissed in default vide order dated 14.03.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:05:58.000','amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:05:58.000'),(11679,440049,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:09:36.000',2465,'AdCNo02352021TR-AUTH00592022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-25 16:09:37.715','','2022-03-25 16:09:37.715','','The present Complaint is about a Residential unit booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" ATHENS-1\" and the same has been filed against \" GUPTA BUILDERS AND PROMOTERS (P) LTD\". Complainant has alleged violation by the Respondents as regards to non completion of the project and has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks Refund and Litigation Charges. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Earlier, Complaints of same project has been entrusted to this Bench of Authority. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:09:36.000','amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:09:36.000'),(11680,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:14:43.000',2164,'AdCNo00262021UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-25 16:14:44.918','','2022-03-25 16:14:44.918','','Complaint dismissed vide order dated 09.03.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:14:43.000','amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:14:43.000'),(11681,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:18:23.000',2168,'AdCNo00462021UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-25 16:18:24.981','','2022-03-25 16:18:24.981','','Complaint dismissed vide order dated 09.03.2022.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:18:23.000','amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:18:23.000'),(11683,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:25:24.000',2122,'AdCNo02422021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-25 16:25:26.262','','2022-03-25 16:25:26.262','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in M/s Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints with prayer of Refund and interest on delayed period of possession now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing/resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:25:24.000','amlegalrera','2022-03-25 16:25:24.000'),(11685,440092,'itcellrera','2022-03-27 14:48:27.000',1426,'AdCNo13132019','Case Bifurcated with Reference Diary Number','Case Bifurcated with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Bifurcated with Reference Diary Number','Role SystemAdmin','IT Cell RERA','2022-03-27 14:48:27.000','999','2022-03-27 14:48:27.000','In Process','Ref. Number BFNo01512022 in AdCNo13132019, and The Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 4.03.2022 dir