n Process','Ref. Number BFNo01622022 in AdCNo01912021UR, and The Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 07.03.2022 directed to send one set of paper-book of complaint to the concerned Bench for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant',2,0,'itcellrera','2022-04-19 09:57:15.000','BifurcateAdmin','2022-04-19 09:57:15.000'),(11874,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-04-19 10:36:22.000',2711,'AdCNo00042022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-04-19 10:36:22.010','','2022-04-19 10:36:22.010','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in M/s Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints with prayer of Possession/Refund and interest on delayed period of possession now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N (ii) Separate Complaint has to be filed for each Flat Booked with the Respondent.(iii) Society and Company Registration Certificates has to be uploaded online and also to be attached along with the hard copies submitted(v) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing or resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-04-19 10:36:22.000','amlegalrera','2022-04-19 10:36:22.000'),(11877,440070,'amlegalrera','2022-04-19 14:01:53.000',1815,'AdCNo16052020','','','Authority Desk','Re