 (ii) you have also annexed Complete Complaint as Annexure which is not permitted(iii)Print out should be on only one side of the  Page. (iv) Index page has to be annexed on the Hard Copy of the Complaint.(v)In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing or resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-04-19 15:14:01.000','amlegalrera','2022-04-19 15:14:01.000'),(11899,440063,'legaladvrera','2022-04-20 12:05:08.000',2882,'AdCNo17422020URBF','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-04-20 12:05:09.116','','2022-04-20 12:05:09.116','','The Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 29.03.2022 directed to send one set of paper-book of complaint to the Bench of Chairperson of Authority for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2022-04-20 12:05:08.000','legaladvrera','2022-04-20 12:05:08.000'),(11900,440064,'legaladvrera','2022-04-20 12:06:02.000',2882,'AdCNo17422020URBFTR-AUTH01952022','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Role Authority Desk','NA','2022-04-20 12:06:02.000','legaladvrera','2022-04-20 12:06:02.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'legaladvrera','2022-04-20 12:06:02.000','legaladvrera','2022-04-20 12:06:02.000'),(11901,440053,'legaladvrera','2022-04-20 12:07:02.000',2882,'AdCNo17422020URBFTR-AUTH01952022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-429