 Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-04-27 10:45:37.399','','2022-04-27 10:45:37.399','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"GBP CENTRUM\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"M/s GUPTA BUILDERS & PROMOTERS PVT.  LTD.\". The Complainants have alleged non payment of assured return and have sought compensation from Respondents for economic losses, mental and physical harassment. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-04-27 10:45:37.000','amlegalrera','2022-04-27 10:45:37.000'),(11980,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-04-27 10:59:31.000',2517,'AdCNo02762021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-04-27 10:59:31.931','','2022-04-27 10:59:31.931','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"GBP CENTRUM\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"M/s GUPTA BUILDERS & PROMOTERS PVT. LTD.\". The Complainants have alleged non payment of assured return and have sought compensation from Respondents for economic losses, mental and physical harassment. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-04-27 10:59:31.000','amlegalrera','2022-04-27 10:59:31.000'),(11981,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-04-27 12:54:34.000',2891,'AdCNo00212022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-04-27 12:54:34.868','','2022-04-27 12:54:34.868','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"ATS GOLF MEADOWS LIFESTYLE\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"ATS ESTATES PRIVATE LTD.\". The Complainants have alleged non delivery of actual possession by the Respondent and decided to withdraw from the Project and have sought compensation from Respondents for non delivery of unit as promised. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-04-27 12:54:34.000','amlegalrera','2022-04-27 12:54:34.000'),(11982,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-04-27 13:10:44.000',2878,'AdCNo00152022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-04-27 13:10:44.806','','2022-04-27 13:10:44.806','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation,  now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing or resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-04-27 13:10:44.000','amlegalrera','2022-04-27 13:10:44.000'),(11983,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-04-27 17:00:58.000',2887,'AdCNo00202022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-04-27 17:00:58.463','','2022-04-27 17:00:58.463','','Complaint has been put up by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and the complaint be registered.  Let notice be issued to the respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 01.06.2022 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-04-27 17:00:58.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-04-27 17:00:58.000'),(11984,440004,'999','2022-04-27 21:53:27.000',2486,'AdCNo02482021TR-AUTH00522022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-04-27 21:53:27.000','999','2022-04-27 21:53:27.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-04-27 21:53:27.000','sysadmin','2022-04-27 21:53:27.000'),(11985,440070,'amlegalrera','2022-04-28 09:48:47.000',1167,'AdCNo10952019','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-04-28 09:48:48.368','','2022-04-28 09:48:48.368','','Complaint reopened after Appeal is remanded back from Appellate Tribunal vide order dated11.04.2022.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-04-28 09:48:47.000','amlegalrera','2022-04-28 09:48:47.000'),(11986,440091,'amlegalrera','2022-04-28 09:49:48.000',1167,'AdCNo10952019','','','Authority Desk','Bifurcate Case between different Bench(s)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-04-28 09:49:48.899','','2022-04-28 09:49:48.899','','The Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 26.04.2022 directed to send one set of paper-book of complaint to the concerned Bench for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-04-28 09:49:48.000','amlegalrera','2022-04-28 09:49:48.