-10 17:27:01.000','BifurcateAdmin','2022-05-10 17:27:01.000'),(12085,440004,'999','2022-05-11 13:34:26.000',2211,'AdCNo00562021','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-05-11 13:34:26.000','999','2022-05-11 13:34:26.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-05-11 13:34:26.000','sysadmin','2022-05-11 13:34:26.000'),(12086,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-05-11 15:12:13.000',2393,'AdCNo02222021TR-AUTH01862022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-05-11 15:12:14.611','','2022-05-11 15:12:14.611','','Complaint is returned as per your Email Request dated 11.05.2022',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-05-11 15:12:13.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-11 15:12:13.000'),(12087,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-05-11 15:19:57.000',2514,'AdCNo02802021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-05-11 15:19:58.391','','2022-05-11 15:19:58.391','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"ACME EMERALD COURT\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"ACME BUILDER PVT. LTD..\". The Complainants have alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondents for non delivery of unit as promised. Complainant has filed separate Complaint in Form M for other reliefs . Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-05-11 15:19:57.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-11 15:19:57.000'),(12088,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-05-11 16:44:13.000',2520,'AdCNo02782021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-05-11 16:44:14.109','','2022-05-11 16:44:14.109','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in M/s Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints with prayer of Refund and interest on delayed period of possession now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation/Cost and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing/resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-05-11 16:44:13.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-11 16:44:13.000'),(12089,440004,'999','2022-05-11 18:03:19.000',2888,'AdCNo00182022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-05-11 18:03:19.000','999','2022-05-11 18:03:19.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-05-11 18:03:19.000','sysadmin','2022-05-11 18:03:19.000'),(12090,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-05-12 12:36:50.000',1351,'AdCNo12622019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-05-12 12:36:51.565','','2022-05-12 12:36:51.565','','Complaint partly accepted vide order dated 06.05.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-05-12 12:36:50.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-12 12:36:50.000'),(12091,440055,'pamemberaps','2022-05-12 15:41:11.000',2486,'AdCNo02482021TR-AUTH00522022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2022-05-12 15:41:12.219','','2022-05-12 15:41:12.219','','Dated  	09.05.2022\r\nPresent	None  	 \r\n			\r\n		This complaint has been received from the  Legal Branch.\r\n			\r\n	 	Notice to respondent to appear in person or through authorized representative on 09.06.2022 at 11.00am before this Bench and to file reply within fifteen days of receipt of this notice. A copy of reply be also sent to the complainant through email ID as mentioned in the complaint.\r\n		The complainant be also asked to appear on the above date and   time.\r\n \r\n\r\n(Ajay Pal Singh)                                     Member\r\n\r\n',2,0,'pamemberaps','2022-05-12 15:41:11.000','pamemberaps','2022-05-12 15:41:11.000'),(12092,440063,'amlegalrera','2022-05-13 11:37:15.000',2884,'AdCNo00172022','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-05-13 11:37:16.594','','2022-05-13 11:37:16.594','','As per Complainant\'s request through email dated 12.05.2022, the present case is transferred from Form N to form M.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-05-13 11:37:15.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-13 11:37:15.000'),(12093,440064,'amlegalrera','2022-05-13 11:38:10.000',2884,'AdCNo00172022TR-AUTH02122022','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Role Authority Desk','NA','2022-05-13 11:38:10.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-13 11:38:10.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-05-13 11:38:10.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-13 11:38:10.000'),(12094,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-05-13 13:22:24.000',2888,'AdCNo00182022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-05-13 13:22:26.328','','2022-05-13 13:22:26.328','','Complaint is returned as per your Email Request dated 1305.2022',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-05-13 13:22:24.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-13 13:22:24.000'),(12095,440004,'999','2022-05-13 13:29:17.000',2888,'AdCNo00182022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-05-13 13:29:17.000','999','2022-05-13 13:29:17.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-05-13 13:29:17.000','sysadmin','2022-05-13 13:29:17.000'),(12096,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-05-13 16:40:35.000',2920,'AdCNo00292022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-05-13 16:40:37.172','','2022-05-13 16:40:37.172','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.  (ii) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. (iii) You have annexed Complete Complaint in Annexures which is not permissible.(iv) Page numbering of Annexures uploaded is not correct. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing or resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-05-13 16:40:35.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-13 16:40:35.000'),(12097,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-05-13 16:43:56.000',2921,'AdCNo00302022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-05-13 16:43:58.128','','2022-05-13 16:43:58.128','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.  (ii) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. (iii) You have annexed Complete Complaint in Annexures which is not permissible.(iv) Page numbering and orientation of Annexures uploaded is not correct. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the complaint along with the hard copies in requisite number. You may consult Legal Branch of Authority, if required in filing or resubmitting the Complaint.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-05-13 16:43:56.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-13 16:43:56.000'),(12098,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-05-13 16:51:24.000',2514,'AdCNo02802021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-05-13 16:51:26.437','','2022-05-13 16:51:26.437','','Complaint has been put up by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and the complaint be registered.  Let notice be issued to the respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 17.06.2022 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-05-13 16:51:24.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-05-13 16:51:24.000'),(12099,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-05-16 11:41:53.000',2347,'AdCNo01572021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-05-16 11:41:55.865','','2022-05-16 11:41:55.865','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent.(ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (III) Vakalatnama needs to be uploaded online as well as to be attached along with the hard copy submitted. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit Six Complete Sets of Hard Copies of rectified Complaint in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-05-16 11:41:53.000','amlegalrera','2022-05-16 11:41:53.000'),(12100,440058,'amlegalrera','2022-05-16 12:55:47.000',2514,'AdCNo02802021','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-05-16 12:55:50.521','','2