fects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit Complete Sets of Hard Copies of rectified Complaint in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-17 11:43:27.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-17 11:43:27.000'),(12407,440004,'999','2022-06-17 13:22:09.000',2933,'AdCNo00362022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-06-17 13:22:09.000','999','2022-06-17 13:22:09.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-06-17 13:22:09.000','sysadmin','2022-06-17 13:22:09.000'),(12408,440001,'999','2022-06-17 15:09:39.000',2948,'AdCNo00392022','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-06-17 15:09:39.000','999','2022-06-17 15:09:39.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-06-17 15:09:39.000','sysadmin','2022-06-17 15:09:39.000'),(12409,440058,'amlegalrera','2022-06-17 16:10:32.000',2711,'AdCNo00042022','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-17 16:10:34.368','','2022-06-17 16:10:34.368','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 14.07.2022 at 10.30 A.M. as per directions.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-17 16:10:32.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-17 16:10:32.000'),(12410,440059,'amlegalrera','2022-06-17 16:11:20.000',2711,'AdCNo00042022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-17 16:11:22.462','','2022-06-17 16:11:22.462','','Notice to Respondent to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 14.07.2022 at 10.30 A.M. and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice to the Autho