l unit booked by Complainants in a RERA registered project \" Phase- 4 development of Mega Residential project\" and the same has been filed against \" M/s OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENSION DEVELOPERS PVT LTD\". Complainant has alleged violation by the Respondents as regards to non completion of the project by the Respondent and has sought the actual possession of the said unit in all aspects as promised in terms on the Agreement for Sale along with all amenities along with the relief of interest on the delayed period of possession along with litigation charges. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted  The present complaint is entrusted to this learned Bench of Authority as per rotation for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-22 14:01:51.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-22 14:01:51.000'),(12422,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-06-23 09:28:36.000',1497,'AdCNo13672019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-23 09:28:37.268','','2022-06-23 09:28:37.268','','Complaint dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 23.06.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-23 09:28:36.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-23 09:28:36.000'),(12423,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-06-23 10:19:58.000',1861,'AdCNo16342020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-23 10:19:59.222','','2022-06-23 10:19:59.222','','Complaint partly allowed vide order dated 13.06.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-23 10:19:58.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-23 10:19:58.000'),(12424,440001,'999','2022-06-23 11:32:28.000',2950,'AdCNo00412022','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-06-23 11:32:28.000','999','2022-06-23 11:32:28.