22-06-29 09:56:07.000'),(12474,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 09:56:37.000',2482,'AdCNo02462021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-29 09:56:37.920','','2022-06-29 09:56:37.920','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in an unregistered project namely \" AERODROME BUSINESS & SHOPPING CENTER\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"ANSAL PROPERTIES & INFRASTRUCTURE LTD\". The Complainants have alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession  and have opted to withdraw from the Project and have sought composite relief of refund, interest and compensation from Respondents for non delivery of unit as promised. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 09:56:37.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-29 09:56:37.000'),(12475,440063,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 10:08:33.000',2947,'AdCNo00402022','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-29 10:08:33.842','','2022-06-29 10:08:33.842','','As per Complainant\'s request through email dated 29.06.2022, the present case is transferred from Form N to form M.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 10:08:33.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-29 10:08:33.000'),(12476,440064,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 10:09:35.000',2947,'AdCNo00402022TR-AUTH02322022','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Authority Desk','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number','Role Authority Desk','NA','2022-06-29 10:09:35.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-29 10:09:35.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 10:09:35.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-29 10:09:35.000'),(12477,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 12:17:37.000',2520,'AdCNo02782021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-29 12:17:38.154','','2022-06-29 12:17:38.154','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"ATS GOLF MEADOWS LIFESTYLE\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"M/S ATS ESTATES PVT LTD.\". The Complainants alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual Legal physical possession of unit by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondents for non delivery of unit as promised. Complainant has filed separate Complaint in Form M for other reliefs . Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 12:17:37.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-29 12:17:37.000'),(12478,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 12:58:24.000',2919,'AdCNo00282022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-29 12:58:25.467','','2022-06-29 12:58:25.467','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"CHANDIGARH CITI CENTRE\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"CITI CENTRE DEVELOPERS.\". The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual Legal physical possession of unit by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondents for non delivery of unit as promised. Complainant has filed separate Complaint in Form M for other reliefs . Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 12:58:24.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-29 12:58:24.000'),(12479,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 14:06:29.000',2931,'AdCNo00332022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-29 14:06:30.248','','2022-06-29 14:06:30.248','','The present Complaint is about a Residential unit booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" MAYA GARDEN MAGNESIA\" and the same has been filed against \" BARNALA BUILDERS\". The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual Legal physical possession of unit by the Respondent and has sought compensation/return on investment from Respondents for non delivery of unit as promised. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 14:06:29.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-29 14:06:29.000'),(12480,440049,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 16:08:34.000',2920,'AdCNo00292022TR-AUTH02172022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-29 16:08:34.779','','2022-06-29 16:08:34.779','','The present Complaint relates to a Office Space purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"CHANDIGARH CITI CENTRE\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"CITI CENTRE DEVELOPER\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual Legal physical possession of unit by the Respondent as per Buyers Agreement and has sought the actual possession of the said unit in all aspects as promised in terms on the Agreement for Sale along with all amenities along with the relief of interest on the delayed period of possession and litigation charges. Earlier, Complaints of same project has been entrusted to this Bench of Authority. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 16:08:34.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-29 16:08:34.000'),(12481,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 16:18:05.000',2861,'AdCNo00092022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-29 16:18:06.107','','2022-06-29 16:18:06.107','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated  . So, the online Complaint is being returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit the hard copies of rectified Complaint in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-29 16:18:05.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-29 16:18:05.000'),(12482,440055,'executiveassistantao','2022-06-30 10:03:47.000',2487,'AdCNo02492021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2022-06-30 10:03:48.264','','2022-06-30 10:03:48.264','','Notice be issued to the respondent through E-mail and speed post for 03.08.2022 to appear before this Bench qua relief of compensation with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant. Intimation be also given to the complainant.',2,0,'executiveassistantao','2022-06-30 10:03:47.000','executiveassistantao','2022-06-30 10:03:47.000'),(12483,440055,'executiveassistantao','2022-06-30 10:06:03.000',2482,'AdCNo02462021UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2022-06-30 10:06:04.389','','2022-06-30 10:06:04.389','','Notice be issued to the respondent through E-mail and speed post for 03.08.2022 to appear before this Bench qua relief of compensation with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant. Intimation be also given to the complainant.',2,0,'executiveassistantao','2022-06-30 10:06:03.000','executiveassistantao','2022-06-30 10:06:03.000'),(12484,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-06-30 10:31:57.000',2921,'AdCNo00302022TR-AUTH02182022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-30 10:31:58.045','','2022-06-30 10:31:58.045','','Complaint is returned as per your Email Request dated 30.06.2022',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-30 10:31:57.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-30 10:31:57.000'),(12485,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-06-30 11:47:10.000',2919,'AdCNo00282022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-06-30 11:47:11.107','','2022-06-30 11:47:11.107','','Complaint has been put up by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Let notice be issued to respondents no. 1 & 2 through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 04.08.2022 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-06-30 11:47:10.000','adjudicatin