'','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-07-14 14:06:28.407','','2022-07-14 14:06:28.407','','Complaint is restored to its original number as per order dated 24.06.2022 passed in MA No. AO/02/2022',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-07-14 14:06:27.000','amlegalrera','2022-07-14 14:06:27.000'),(12599,440049,'amlegalrera','2022-07-14 14:14:00.000',2947,'AdCNo00402022TR-AUTH02322022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-07-14 14:14:01.783','','2022-07-14 14:14:01.783','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"DREAM MEADOWS II \" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"WWICS ESTATES PVT LTD\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged that the original allotted plot was washed away in rain and Respondents have failed to allot alternate property to the Complainant as promised by Respondents. Complainants now have opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks primary relief of refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents along with interest from the respective dates of deposits. Earlier, Complaints of same project has been entrusted to this Bench of Authority. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-07-14 14:14:00.000','amlegalrera','2022-07-14 14:14:00.000'),(12600,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-07-14 14:17:16.000',2948,'AdCNo00392022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-07-14 14:17:17.251','','2022-07-14 14:17:17.251','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"DREAM MEADOWS II \" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"WWICS ESTATES PVT LTD\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged that the original allotted plot was washed away in rain and Respondents have failed to allot alternate property to the Complainant as promised by Respondents. Complainants now have sought compensation from Respondents for non delivery of alternate unit as promised. Complainant has filed separate Complaint in Form M for other reliefs. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-07-14 14:17:16.000','amlegalrera','2022-07-14 14:17:16.000'),(12601,440055,'executiveassistantao','2022-07-14 15:50:32.000',2948,'AdCNo00392022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2022-07-14 15:50:33.360','','2022-07-14 15:50:33.360','','Complaint put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to respondents no. 2 & 3 through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 22.08.2022 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant.  Compliance be made positively within four days.',2,0,'executiveassistantao','2022-07-14 15:50:32.000','executiveassistantao','2022-07-14 15:50:32.000'),(12602,440058,'amlegalrera','2022-07-14 15:59:12.000',2948,'AdCNo00392022','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-07-14 15:59:13.626','','2022-07-14 15:59:13.626','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 22.08.2022 as per directions\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-07-14 15:59:12.000','amlegalrera','2022-07-14 15:59:12.000'),(12603,440059,'amlegalrera','2022-07-14 15:59:56.000',2948,'AdCNo00392022','','','Authority De