e specific with directions to the Respondent and should not contain facts of the case. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-07-27 15:40:50.000','amlegalrera','2022-07-27 15:40:50.000'),(12655,440001,'999','2022-07-28 08:50:10.000',2970,'AdCNo00512022','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-07-28 08:50:10.000','999','2022-07-28 08:50:10.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-07-28 08:50:10.000','sysadmin','2022-07-28 08:50:10.000'),(12656,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2022-07-28 10:13:54.000',2872,'AdCNo15012019BFTR-AUTH01932022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-07-28 10:13:55.752','','2022-07-28 10:13:55.752','','Complaint accepted vide order dated 18.07.2022.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2022-07-28 10:13:54.000','systemanalyst.rera','2022-07-28 10:13:54.000'),(12657,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-07-28 12:45:07.000',1815,'AdCNo16052020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-07-28 12:45:08.502','','2022-07-28 12:45:08.502','','Complaint dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 26.07.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-07-28 12:45:07.000','amlegalrera','2022-07-28 12:45:07.000'),(12658,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-07-28 13:09:37.000',2468,'AdCNo02372021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-07-28 13:09:38.049','','2022-07-28 13:09:38.049','','Complaint dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 26.07.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-07-28 13:09:37.000','amlegalrera','2022-07-28 13:09:37.000'),(12659,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-07-28 16:32:46.000',2968,'AdCNo00502022UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-07-28 16:32:47.783','','2022-07-28 16:32:47.783','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii)Relief column should contain only Prayer/Relief sought and should not contain facts.(iii) Annexure 10 has been uploaded twice and also its page numbering is not correct. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-07-28 16:32:46.000','amlegalrera','2022-07-28 16:32:46.000'),(12660,440004,'999','2022-07-29 10:25:04.000',2962,'AdCNo00462022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-07-29 10:25:04.000','999','2022-07-29 10:25:04.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-07-29 10:25:04.000','sysadmin','2022-07-29 10:25:04.000'),(12661,440001,'999','2022-07-29 18:42:58.000',2971,'AdCNo00522022','Complaint FormN Su