9,'amlegalrera','2022-08-03 13:04:00.000',2921,'AdCNo00302022TR-AUTH02182022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-03 13:04:01.324','','2022-08-03 13:04:01.324','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project \" MAYA GARDEN MAGNESIA\" and the same has been filed against \" M/s BARNALA BUILDERS\". Complainant has alleged violation by the Respondents as regards to non completion of the project and has sought copies of all permissions and certificates for the complete Project along with litigation charges. Complainant has also sent one Email stating that there is no loan on the said unit. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Earlier, Complaints of same project has been entrusted to this Bench of Authority. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-03 13:04:00.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-03 13:04:00.000'),(12690,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-08-03 14:16:45.000',2955,'AdCNo00452022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-03 14:16:46.231','','2022-08-03 14:16:46.231','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)The name of Co-allottee has to be added as additional Complainant. (ii) Bank needs to be impleaded as Additional Respondent in case loan has been availed.(iii) Relief column should contain only Prayer/Relief sought and should not contain facts. (iv) All Annexures uploaded are not attached with the Hard copy. (v) Bank Statement has been uploaded instead of Allotment Letter (vi) Same facts have been mentioned in the Facts and Relief coloum. (vii)In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated . The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-03 14:16:45.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-03 14:16:45.000'),(12691,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-08-04 10:54:46.000',2970,'AdCNo00512022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-04 10:54:47.356','','2022-08-04 10:54:47.356','','Complaint is returned as per your Email Request dated 04.08.2022',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-04 10:54:46.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-04 10:54:46.000'),(12692,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-08-04 11:46:55.000',2350,'AdCNo01702021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-04 11:46:56.186','','2022-08-04 11:46:56.186','','Complaint dismissed vide order dated 29.07.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-04 11:46:55.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-04 11:46:55.000'),(12693,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-08-04 13:01:04.000',1458,'AdCNo13372019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-04 13:01:05.402','','2022-08-04 13:01:05.402','','Complaint partly allowed vide order dated 21.07.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-04 13:01:04.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-04 13:01:04.000'),(12694,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-08-04 13:19:50.000',2121,'AdCNo00012021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-04 13:19:51.106','','2022-08-04 13:19:51.106','','Complaint partly allowed vide order dated 25