8:22:27.000',2988,'AdCNo00612022','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-08-21 08:22:27.000','999','2022-08-21 08:22:27.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-08-21 08:22:27.000','sysadmin','2022-08-21 08:22:27.000'),(12723,440004,'999','2022-08-21 08:22:32.000',2988,'AdCNo00612022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-08-21 08:22:32.000','999','2022-08-21 08:22:32.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-08-21 08:22:32.000','sysadmin','2022-08-21 08:22:32.000'),(12724,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2022-08-22 10:49:15.000',1428,'AdCNo13152019TR-AUTH01042022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-22 10:49:17.836','','2022-08-22 10:49:17.836','','Complaint dismissed vide order dated 21.07.2022.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2022-08-22 10:49:15.000','systemanalyst.rera','2022-08-22 10:49:15.000'),(12725,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-08-23 12:12:11.000',2946,'AdCNo00382022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-23 12:12:11.601','','2022-08-23 12:12:11.601','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(ii) Please attach proof of allottment/ownership.(iii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated.(iv) Prayer clause should be more specific and should not contain address/facts. So the online Complaint is rerurned.The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-23 12:12:11.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-23 12:12:11.000'),(12726,440054,'amlegalrera','2022-08-23 12:17:30.000',2762,'AdCNo01162021BFTR-AUTH02142021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-23 12:17:30.758','','2022-08-23 12:17:30.758','','Complaint is accepted vide order dated 15.03.2022',1,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-23 12:17:30.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-23 12:17:30.000'),(12727,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-08-23 15:47:55.000',2975,'AdCNo00532022UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-23 15:47:55.945','','2022-08-23 15:47:55.945','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.(ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated . So the online Complaint is rerurned.The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-23 15:47:55.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-23 15:47:55.000'),(12728,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-08-23 15:49:20.000',2963,'AdCNo00542022UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-23 15:49:20.445','','2022-08-23 15:49:20.445','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.(ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated . So the online Complaint is rerurned.The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-23 15:49:20.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-23 15:49:20.000'),(12729,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 09:21:11.000',2966,'AdCNo00482022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-24 09:21:11.758','','2022-08-24 09:21:11.758','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"PRESTIGE TOWERS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"VERA DEVELOPERS PVT. LTD.\" and two other Respondents who are Director and Bank respectively. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual legal possession of unit by the Respondent and have opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks Compensation for mental torture and harassment. Separate Complaint has also been filed in FORM M for other reliefs. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 09:21:11.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-24 09:21:11.000'),(12730,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 09:38:40.000',2962,'AdCNo00462022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-24 09:38:40.523','','2022-08-24 09:38:40.523','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"PARSVNATH CASTLE RAJPURA\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"PARSVNATH DEVELOPERS  LTD.\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual legal possession of unit by the Respondent and have opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks Compensation for mental  harassment. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 09:38:40.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-24 09:38:40.000'),(12731,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 09:49:06.000',2965,'AdCNo00472022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-24 09:49:06.492','','2022-08-24 09:49:06.492','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) The name of Co-allottee has to be added as additional Complainant. (iii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iv)Bank needs to be impleaded as Additional Respondent in case loan has been availed. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 09:49:06.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-24 09:49:06.000'),(12732,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 10:01:10.000',1152,'AdCNo00552022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-24 10:01:10.680','','2022-08-24 10:01:10.680','','The present Complaint is about a Residential Plot booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" PUDA Enclave\" and the same has been filed against \" Chief Administrator, Bathinda Development Authority)\". Complainant has alleged non completion of Project and has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks primary relief of compensation for mental agony and harassment. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 10:01:10.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-24 10:01:10.000'),(12733,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 10:24:39.000',2949,'AdCNo00492022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-24 10:24:39.445','','2022-08-24 10:24:39.445','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i))Bank needs to be impleaded as Additional Respondent in case loan has been availed. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 10:24:39.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-24 10:24:39.000'),(12734,440058,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 11:24:55.000',2921,'AdCNo00302022TR-AUTH02182022','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-08-24 11:24:56.008','','2022-08-24 11:24:56.008','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 30.08.2022 at 10.30A.M. as per directions.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 11:24:55.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-24 11:24:55.000'),(12735,440059,'amlegalrera','2022-08-24 11:25:30.000',2921,'AdCNo00302022TR-AUTH02182022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Responde