nt, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of an unregistered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter correctly which is EMAAR INDIA LIMITED.  (ii) The name of Co-allottee has to be added as additional Complainant. (iii) (Regarding Claim 6) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iv) hard copies of the Complaint are neither verified nor signed by the Complainants.(v) Prayer made should be more specific with directions to the Respondent and should not contain facts of the case. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-08-31 15:27:32.000','amlegalrera','2022-08-31 15:27:32.000'),(12766,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-09-01 09:28:24.000',2988,'AdCNo00612022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-09-01 09:28:25.665','','2022-09-01 09:28:25.665','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"MUIRWOOD ECOCITY\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"ALTUS SPACE BUILDERS OVT. LTD.\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual legal possession of unit by the Respondent and seeks exemplary Compensation . Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-09-01 09:28:24.000','amlegalrera','2022-09-01 09:28:24.000'),(12767,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-09-01 09:43:40.000',2980,'AdCNo00562022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-09-01 09:43:41.618','','2022-09-01 09:43:41.618','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"FASHION TECHNOLOGY PARK\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"CHANDIGARH OVERSEAS PVT. LTD.\" AND ONE ANOTHER RESPONDENT . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual legal possession of unit by the Respondent and seeks  Compensation on various accounts. Complaint filed in FORM M has been decided in favour of the Complainant. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-09-01 09:43:40.000','amlegalrera','2022-09-01 09:43:40.000'),(12768,440004,'999','2022-09-01 11:02:29.000',2946,'AdCNo00382022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-09-01 11:02:29.000','999','2022-09-01 11:02:29.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-09-01 11:02:29.000','sysadmin','2022-09-01 11:02:29.000'),(12769,440049,'amlegalrera','2022-09-01 12:30:05.000',2262,'AdCNo01682021TR-AUTH02332022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-09-01 12:30:06.637','','2022-09-01 12:30:06.637','','The present Complain