rera','2022-10-04 12:28:18.000',2519,'AdCNo02792021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-10-04 12:28:16.355','','2022-10-04 12:28:16.355','','The present Complaint relates to a plot purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"SMART CITY BANUR\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"M/s GUPTA BUILDERS & PROMOTERS PVT LTD\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non completion of the Project by the Respondent and has withdrawn from the Project and has sought compensation from Respondent for economic losses, mental and physical harassment. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-10-04 12:28:18.000','amlegalrera','2022-10-04 12:28:18.000'),(12927,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-10-04 13:14:22.000',3007,'AdCNo00792022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-10-04 13:14:21.056','','2022-10-04 13:14:21.056','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated .So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-10-04 13:14:22.000','amlegalrera','2022-10-04 13:14:22.000'),(12928,440004,'999','2022-10-04 15:25:04.000',2996,'AdCNo00732022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-10-04 15:25:04.000','999','2022-10-04 15:25:04.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-10-04 15:25:04.000','sysadmin','2022-10-04 15:25:04.000'),(12929,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-10-04 16:42:38.000',2999,'AdCNo00742022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-10-04 16:42:36.524','','2022-10-04 16:42:36.524','','Complaint put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to the respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 11.11.2022 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant.  Compliance be made positively within four days.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-10-04 16:42:38.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-10-04 16:42:38.000'),(12930,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-10-04 16:49:51.000',2519,'AdCNo02792021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-10-04 16:49:49.603','','2022-10-04 16:49:49.603','','Complaint put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to the respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 11.11.2022 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant.  Compliance be made positively within four days.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-10-04 16:49:51.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-10-04 16:49:51.000'),(12931,440004,'999','2022-10-05 14:52:24.000',3007,'AdCNo00792022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-10-05 14:52:24.000','999','2022-10-05 14:52:24.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-10-05 14:52:24.000','sysadmin','2022-10-05 14:52:24.000'),(12932,440001,'999','2022-10-05 17:20:29.000',3009,'AdCNo00802022','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-10-05 17:20:29.000','999','2022-10-05 17:20:29.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-10-05 17:20:29.000','sysadmin','2022-10-05 17:20:29.000'),(12933,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-10-06 09:41:03.000',3004,'AdCNo00772022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-10-06 09:41:03.212','','2022-10-06 09:41:03.212','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent (ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated .So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-10-06 09:41:03.000','amlegalrera','2022-10-06 09:41:03.000'),(12934,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-10-06 10:54:57.000',3006,'AdCNo00782022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-10-06 10:54:56.759','','2022-10-06 10:54:56.759','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"GROUP HOUSING(THE LAKE)\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENSION DEVELOPERS PVT LTD\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non delivery of possession and non completion of the Project and has sought compensation from Respondent on account of rent and maintenance paid. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-10-06 10:54:57.000','amlegalrera','2022-10-06 10:54:57.000'),(12935,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-10-06 11:11:03.000',1151,'AdCNo00642022UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-10-06 11:11:02.791','','2022-10-06 11:11:02.791','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in an unregistered project namely \"PUDA ENCLAVE SUGAR MILL SITE\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"PUDA,BATHINDA\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified 