.000','999','2022-11-18 15:16:57.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-11-18 15:16:57.000','sysadmin','2022-11-18 15:16:57.000'),(13073,440001,'999','2022-11-18 15:17:58.000',3014,'AdCNo00952022','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-11-18 15:17:58.000','999','2022-11-18 15:17:58.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-11-18 15:17:58.000','sysadmin','2022-11-18 15:17:58.000'),(13074,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-11-21 12:38:23.000',3028,'AdCNo00892022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-11-21 12:38:25.483','','2022-11-21 12:38:25.483','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.(iii) All pages are not uploaded in all the Annexures.\r\nSo the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-11-21 12:38:23.000','amlegalrera','2022-11-21 12:38:23.000'),(13075,440004,'999','2022-11-21 19:53:15.000',3028,'AdCNo00892022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-11-21 19:53:15.000','999','2022-11-21 19:53:15.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-11-21 19:53:15.000','sysadmin','2022-11-21 19:53:15.000'),(13076,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-11-23 09:58:43.000',3032,'AdCNo00922022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-11-23 09:58:42.546','','2022-11-23 09:58:42.546','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in an  Rera registered project namely \"WTC CHANDIGARH( SIGNATURE TOWEER)\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"WTC NOIDA DEVELOPEMENT COMPANY PVT LTD\" and four other Respondents who are its Directors . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged material change in architecture and structure of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent for contravention of the provisions and regulation of the Act. Complainant has also filed separate Complaint in form M for other relief. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-11-23 09:58:43.000','amlegalrera','2022-11-23 09:58:43.000'),(13077,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-11-23 10:05:18.000',2743,'AdCNo00192022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-11-23 10:05:16.952','','2022-11-23 10:05:16.952','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in an Rera registered project namely \"GOLF LINKS-1 ( COMMERCIAL)\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"ANSAL PROPERTIES AND INFRASTRUCTURE LTD\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non completion/development of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent for opportunity/business loss, delay in providing amenities, mental and physical harassment. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-11-23 10:05:18.000','amlegalrera','2022-11-23 10:05:18.000'),(13078,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-11-24 12:41:47.000',2743,'AdCNo00192022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-11-24 12:41:46.514','','2022-11-24 12:41:46.514','','Complaint put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to the respondent through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 27.12.2022 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant.  Compliance be made positively within four days.\r\n\r\n',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-11-24 12:41:47.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-11-24 12:41:47.000'),(13079,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-11-24 12:49:15.000',3032,'AdCNo00922022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-11-24 12:49:15.124','','2022-11-24 12:49:15.124','','Complaint put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to the respondent No.1 through E-mail and Registered Speed Post for 27.12.2022 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant.  Compliance be made positively within four days.\r\n\r\n',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-11-24 12:49:15.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2022-11-24 12:49:15.000'),(13080,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-11-24 13:12:14.000',2861,'AdCNo00092022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-11-24 13:12:13.421','','2022-11-24 13:12:13.421','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 23.11.2022 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant to rectify the objections as raised by the Legal Branch and then rectified complaint be filed on or before 22.12.2022 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 23.11.2022.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-11-24 13:12:14.000','amlegalrera','2022-11-24 13:12:14.000'),(13081,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-11-24 13:13:02.000',3004,'AdCNo00772022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-11-24 13:13:01.983','','2022-11-24 13:13:01.983','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 23.11.2022 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant to rectify the objections as raised by the Legal Branch and then rectified complaint be filed on or before 22.12.2022 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 23.11.2022.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-11-24 13:13:02.000','amlegalrera','2022-11-24 13:13:02.000'),(13082,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-11-24 13:13:57.000',2971,'AdCNo00522022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','73