22','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-07 15:49:35.018','','2022-12-07 15:49:35.018','','Complaint is returned as per your Email request dated 07.12.2022',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-07 15:49:36.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-07 15:49:36.000'),(13147,440004,'999','2022-12-08 10:15:55.000',3045,'AdCNo01052022','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-12-08 10:15:55.000','999','2022-12-08 10:15:55.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-12-08 10:15:55.000','sysadmin','2022-12-08 10:15:55.000'),(13148,440001,'999','2022-12-10 18:32:13.000',3042,'AdCNo01072022','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-12-10 18:32:13.000','999','2022-12-10 18:32:13.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-12-10 18:32:13.000','sysadmin','2022-12-10 18:32:13.000'),(13149,440001,'999','2022-12-11 11:24:52.000',3044,'AdCNo01082022','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-12-11 11:24:52.000','999','2022-12-11 11:24:52.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-12-11 11:24:52.000','sysadmin','2022-12-11 11:24:52.000'),(13150,440001,'999','2022-12-11 11:30:53.000',3043,'AdCNo01092022','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-12-11 11:30:53.000','999','2022-12-11 11:30:53.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2022-12-11 11:30:53.000','sysadmin','2022-12-11 11:30:53.000'),(13151,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-12-12 11:25:30.000',3034,'AdCNo00962022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-12 11:25:32.793','','2022-12-12 11:25:32.793','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) Index attached with the complaint not matches with the uploaded documents (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Bank needs to be impleaded as Additional Respondent in case loan has been availed. (iv) Annexures annexed with the complaint are not certified. (v) Page numbering  is not done on the annexures submitted in  hard (vi) Only one annexure is uploaded online which too is blank and remaining annexures are not uploaded but attached with the hardcopy of the complaint. So the online Complaint is returned.The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-12 11:25:30.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-12 11:25:30.000'),(13152,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-12-12 11:35:51.000',3036,'AdCNo00972022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-12 11:35:53.278','','2022-12-12 11:35:53.278','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) There is no index attached alongwith the complaint(ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) There is no mention of Praveen Kumar Mittal in the agreement, plz specify as how he had been impleaded as complainant. (iv)As per RERA Registration Number, the main promoter has not been impleaded as respondent. (v) Annexures annexed with the complaint are not certified. (vi) Page numbering is not done on the annexures uploaded and submitted in hard (vii) Page No. 3 & 4 of the Annexures attached as well as uploaded is not completely legible, needs rectification. (viii) Signature of co-applicant is not there. (ix) There is no authority letter in favour of Praveen Kumar Mittal by co-applicant, plz specify. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-12 11:35:51.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-12 11:35:51.000'),(13153,440070,'amlegalrera','2022-12-12 11:41:23.000',1337,'AdCNo12482019','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-12 11:41:25.793','','2022-12-12 11:41:25.793','','Complaint reopened after Appeal is remanded back from Appellate Tribunal vide order dated 24.11.2022',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-12 11:41:23.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-12 11:41:23.000'),(13154,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-12-12 11:55:15.000',1337,'AdCNo12