,'2022-12-26 09:14:57.110','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 23.12.2022 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant to rectify the objections as raised by the Legal Branch and then rectified complaint be filed on or before 17.01.2023 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 23.12.2022',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 09:14:54.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-26 09:14:54.000'),(13197,440059,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:22:43.000',2861,'AdCNo00092022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-26 10:22:45.578','','2022-12-26 10:22:45.578','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 27.01.2023 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:22:43.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:22:43.000'),(13198,440059,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:30:18.000',3004,'AdCNo00772022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-26 10:30:20.407','','2022-12-26 10:30:20.407','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 27.01.2023  and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:30:18.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:30:18.000'),(13199,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:34:07.000',3023,'AdCNo01062022UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-26 10:34:09.672','','2022-12-26 10:34:09.672','','Complaint is returned as per your Email Request dated 22.12.2022',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:34:07.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:34:07.000'),(13200,440059,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:37:30.000',2971,'AdCNo00522022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-26 10:37:32.297','','2022-12-26 10:37:32.297','','Notice to Respondent/sto appear in person or through his authorized representative on 27.01.2023 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:37:30.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-26 10:37:30.000'),(13201,440007,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 11:11:17.000',3048,'AdCNo01102022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-26 11:11:19.907','','2022-12-26 11:11:19.907','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.(iii) Complainant should be the Allottee through his SPA. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-26 11:11:17.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-26 11:11:17.000'),(13202,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-12-27 09:47:01.000',3030,'AdCNo00942022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-27 09:46:59.875','','2022-12-27 09:46:59.875','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a  rera registered project namely \"SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"SUSHMA BUILTECH LTD.\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged that separate car parking was not provided by the Respondent and has sought compensation from the promoter for not offering the apartment in terms of the Apartment Buyer\'s and litigation charges. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-27 09:47:01.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-27 09:47:01.000'),(13203,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-12-27 09:50:11.000',3014,'AdCNo00952022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-12-27 09:50:10.094','','2022-12-27 09:50:10.094','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a rera registered project namely \"SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"SUSHMA BUILTECH LTD.\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged that separate car parking was not provided by the Respondent and has sought compensation from the promoter for not offering the apartment in terms of the Apartment Buyer\'s and litigation charges. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-12-27 09:50:11.000','amlegalrera','2022-12-27 09:50:11.000'),(13204,440004,'9