0'),(13280,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-01-10 14:09:13.000',3043,'AdCNo01092022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-10 14:09:11.361','','2023-01-10 14:09:11.361','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-10 14:09:13.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-10 14:09:13.000'),(13281,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-01-10 14:13:06.000',3044,'AdCNo01082022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-10 14:13:04.751','','2023-01-10 14:13:04.751','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)Name of Complainant should be as mentioned in the Allotment Letter. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-10 14:13:06.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-10 14:13:06.000'),(13282,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-01-10 14:35:32.000',3056,'AdCNo00012023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-10 14:35:30.423','','2023-01-10 14:35:30.423','','Complaint is returned as per your Whats App message request 10.01.2023',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-10 14:35:32.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-10 14:35:32.000'),(13283,440004,'999','2023-01-10 15:06:03.000',3056,'AdCNo00012023','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-01-10 15:06:03.000','999','2023-01-10 15:06:03.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-01-10 15:06:03.000','sysadmin','2023-01-10 15:06:03.000'),(13284,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-01-10 15:33:50.000',3035,'AdCNo00982022UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-10 15:33:48.798','','2023-01-10 15:33:48.798','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) Complainant No. 3 Satya pal Mahajan should be added as additional Complaint and impleaded through his LR\'s( LR\'s should not be added as additional Complainants). (ii) Please attach proof of LR\'s like succession certificate etc. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-10 15:33:50.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-10 15:33:50.000'),(13285,440054,'amlegalrera','2023-01-11 13:14:48.000',2124,'AdCNo18112020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-11 13:14:47.079','','2023-01-11 13:14:47.079','','Complaint is dismissed as withdrawn ',1,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-11 13:14:48.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-11 13:14:48.000'),(13286,440054,'amlegalrera','2023-01-11 13:29:42.000',1969,'AdCNo16992020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-11 13:29:41.815','','2023-01-11 13:29:41.815','','Complaint is dismissed as withdrawn ',1,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-11 13:29:42.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-11 13:29:42.000'),(13287,440054,'amlegalrera','2023-01-11 13:55:59.000',1472,'AdCNo13702019UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-11 13:55:58.283','','2023-01-11 13:55:58.283','','Complaint is dismissed as withdrawn .',1,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-11 13:55:59.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-11 13:55:59.000'),(13288,440001,'999','2023-01-11 15:42:57.000',3025,'AdCNo00042023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-01-11 15:42:57.000','999','2023-01-11 15:42:57.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-01-11 15:42:57.000','sysadmin','2023-01-11 15:42:57.000'),(13289,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-01-12 11:17:42.000',3042,'AdCNo01072022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-12 11:17:41.870','','2023-01-12 11:17:41.870','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) co-allottee/applicant has to be added as additional Complainant. (ii) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(iii) No hard copy has been submitted in the Legal Branch. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-12 11:17:42.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-12 11:17:42.000'),(13290,440001,'999','2023-01-12 14:05:41.000',3065,'AdCNo00052023UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-01-12 14:05:41.000','999','2023-01-12 14:05:41.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-01-12 14:05:41.000','sysadmin','2023-01-12 14:05:41.000'),(13291,440049,'amlegalrera','2023-01-12 15:20:06.000',3034,'AdCNo00962022TR-AUTH00012023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-12 15:20:06.001','','2023-01-12 15:20:06.001','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"MONA CITY HOMES\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"MONA TOWNSHIP PVT. LTD.\" and one other Respondent which is a Bank . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual Legal physical possession of unit by the Respondents and have opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks primary relief of refund of entire amount lying deposited with respondents and paid by Bank along with interest. Earlier, Complaints of same project have been entrusted to this Bench of Authority. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-12 15:20:06.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-12 15:20:06.000'),(13292,440001,'999','2023-01-12 16:14:34.000',3062,'AdCNo00062023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-01-12 16:14:34.000','999','2023-01-12 16:14:34.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-01-12 16:14:34.000','sysadmin','2023-01-12 16:14:34.000'),(13293,440070,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 16:52:37.000',1509,'AdCNo13752019UR','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-12-15 16:52:37.000','','2021-12-15 16:52:37.000','','Complaint reopened after Appeal is remanded back from Appellate Tribunal vide order dated 06.12.2021.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 16:52:37.000','amlegalrera','2021-12-15 16:52:37.000'),(13294,440070,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 16:58:23.000',1507,'AdCNo13832019UR','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-12-15 16:58:23.000','','2021-12-15 16:58:23.000','','Complaint reopened after Appeal is remanded back from Appellate Tribunal vide order dated 06.12.2021.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 16:58:23.000','amlegalrera','2021-12-15 16:58:23.000'),(13295,440070,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:01:29.000',1508,'AdCNo13842019UR','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-12-15 17:01:29.000','','2021-12-15 17:01:29.000','','Complaint reopened after Appeal is remanded back from Appellate Tribunal vide order dated 06.12.2021.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:01:29.000','amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:01:29.000'),(13296,440070,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:04:04.000',1525,'AdCNo13872019UR','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-12-15 17:04:04.000','','2021-12-15 17:04:04.000','','Complaint reopened after Appeal is remanded back from Appellate Tribunal vide order dated 06.12.2021.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:04:04.000','amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:04:04.000'),(13297,440070,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:06:22.000',1527,'AdCNo13882019UR','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-12-15 17:06:22.000','','2021-12-15 17:06:22.000','','Complaint reopened after Appeal is remanded back from Appellate Tribunal vide order dated 06.12.2021.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:06:22.000','amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:06:22.000'),(13298,440070,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:08:52.000',1526,'AdCNo13892019UR','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-12-15 17:08:52.000','','2021-12-15 17:08:52.000','','Complaint reopened after Appeal is remanded back from Appellate Tribunal vide order dated 06.12.2021.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:08:52.000','amlegalrera','2021-12-15 17:08:52.000'),(13299,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-01-13 10:42:24.000',3025,'AdCNo00042023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-13 10:42:24.439','','2023-01-13 10:42:24.439','','Complaint is returned as per your Email Request dated 13.01.2023',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-13 10:42:24.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-13 10:42:24.000'),(13300,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-01-16 12:59:57.000',3052,'AdCNo01132022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-16 12:59:59.476','','2023-01-16 12:59:59.476','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Bank needs to be impleaded as Additional Respondent in case loan has been availed. (iv) Complete name of Complainant as mentioned in Agreement ,should be mentioned. (v) All uploaded pages of Annexure -C are not attached in hard copy. (vi) Vakalatnama has to be signed by the Advocated. (vii) Page numbering of hard copy is not done and index page has to be attached with hard copies. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-16 12:59:57.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-16 12:59:57.000'),(13301,440001,'999','2023-01-16 17:47:24.000',3064,'AdCNo00072023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous',