olation as regards to illegally amending the sanction plan without any consent from the 2/3 of buyers and has sought compensation from Respondent for physical and mental harassment. Complainant has also filed separate Complaint in form M for other reliefs. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-18 11:10:06.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-18 11:10:06.000'),(13308,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-01-18 11:40:15.000',3039,'AdCNo01042022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-18 11:40:14.838','','2023-01-18 11:40:14.838','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a rera registered project namely \"SUSHMA INFINIUM\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"SUSHMA BUILDTECH. LTD.\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged that  dedicated parking and other amenities are not provided by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondent for causing harassment. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-01-18 11:40:15.000','amlegalrera','2023-01-18 11:40:15.000'),(13309,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-01-18 11:57:11.000',3053,'AdCNo01152022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-01-18 11:57:10.728','','2023-01-18 11:57:10.728','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a rera registered project namely \"GROUP HOUSING(THE LAKE)\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"M/s OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENSION DEVELOPERS PVT. LTD.\" and one other Respondent who is a Finance Company. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verifi