'Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-02-16 10:44:20.000','999','2023-02-16 10:44:20.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-02-16 10:44:20.000','sysadmin','2023-02-16 10:44:20.000'),(13389,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-02-16 16:37:51.000',3064,'AdCNo00072023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-02-16 16:37:50.641','','2023-02-16 16:37:50.641','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) The name of Co-allottee has to be added as additional Complainant.(ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-02-16 16:37:51.000','amlegalrera','2023-02-16 16:37:51.000'),(13390,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-02-17 12:25:03.000',3071,'AdCNo00112023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-02-17 12:25:03.986','','2023-02-17 12:25:03.986','','Complaint is returned as per your Email Request dated 02.02.2023',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-02-17 12:25:03.000','amlegalrera','2023-02-17 12:25:03.000'),(13391,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-02-17 12:31:14.000',3007,'AdCNo00792022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-02-17 12:31:14.079','','2023-02-17 12:31:14.079','','Following objections not removed. (After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and\r\nDevelopers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order\r\ndated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation\r\nand interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for\r\nCompensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) In terms of\r\nRegulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling\r\nComplaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific\r\nprovisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated .So the online Complaint\r\nis returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit\r\nrequired set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent)\r\nin the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-02-17 12:31:14.000','amlegalrera','2023-02-17 12:31:14.000'),(13392,440001,'999','2023-02-17 12:50:06.000',3076,'AdCNo00152023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-02-17 12:50:06.000','999','2023-02-17 12:50:06.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-02-17 12:50:06.000','sysadmin','2023-02-17 12:50:06.000'),(13393,440004,'999','2023-02-19 12:52:52.000',3071,'AdCNo00112023','Application Re-Submission(Modified Appli