mlegalrera','2023-05-12 15:10:44.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-12 15:10:44.000'),(13574,440059,'amlegalrera','2023-05-12 15:11:16.000',3064,'AdCNo00072023','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-12 15:11:18.153','','2023-05-12 15:11:18.153','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 16.06.2023 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-12 15:11:16.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-12 15:11:16.000'),(13575,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-05-15 14:21:07.000',3084,'AdCNo00282023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-15 14:21:10.913','','2023-05-15 14:21:10.913','','The present Complaint is about a Residential unit booked by Complainants in a RERA registered project \"HERO HOMES\" and the same has been filed against \"HERO REALITY PRIVATE LIMITED\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged delayed possession and non completion of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent for financial, physical and mental hardships alongwith Litigation Charges.  Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-15 14:21:07.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-15 14:21:07.000'),(13576,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:25:01.000',3071,'AdCNo00112023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-16 10:25:01.819','','2023-05-16 10:25:01.819','','The present Complaint is about a unit booked by Complainant in a RERA registered project \" MAYA GARDEN MAGNESIA\" and the same has been filed against \" BARNALA BUILDERS\" and three other Respondents. Complainant has opted to withdraw from the Project and seeks compensation and Litigation Charges. Complainant has also filed separate Complaint in FORM M for Refund. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:25:01.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:25:01.000'),(13577,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:30:34.000',2452,'AdCNo02272021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-16 10:30:34.194','','2023-05-16 10:30:34.194','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) Bank needs to be impleaded as Additional Respondent in case loan has been availed. (iii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.Please specify your prayer. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:30:34.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:30:34.000'),(13578,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:35:37.000',3068,'AdCNo00082023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-16 10:35:37.616','','2023-05-16 10:35:37.616','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SKY GARDEN PHASE I\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT LTD\" and four other Respondents ( Directors). Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non execution of Buyers Agreement and illegal cancellation of unit by the Respondents and have opted to withdraw from the Project and has sought compensation from Respondent for mental agony and harassment. Complainant has also filed separate Complaint in form M for refund as per settlement deed. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:35:37.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:35:37.000'),(13579,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:44:28.000',3025,'AdCNo00042023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-16 10:44:28.366','','2023-05-16 10:44:28.366','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a rera registered project namely \"FLORENCE PARK\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"AMBIKA REALCON PVT. LTD.\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non delivery of possession and non completion of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent on account of harassment and also for not providing proper facilities. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:44:28.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-16 10:44:28.000'),(13580,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-05-16 15:58:27.000',3076,'AdCNo00152023TR-AUTH00072023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-16 15:58:27.491','','2023-05-16 15:58:27.491','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) The name of Co-allottee has to be added as additional Complainant. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-16 15:58:27.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-16 15:58:27.000'),(13581,440057,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 10:08:14.000',3043,'AdCNo01092022','','','Authority Desk','No Reply Recieved within 15 days','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-17 10:08:15.350','','2023-05-17 10:08:15.350','','The complaint was returned to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017 . No reply or explanation submitted by Complainant even after lapse of 15 days.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 10:08:14.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-17 