d copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as defect in workmanship by the Respondents and has sought compensation from Respondent for financial, physical and mental hardships. Complainant has also filed separate Complaint in form M for other reliefs. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 17:32:10.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-17 17:32:10.000'),(13615,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 17:57:53.000',3086,'AdCNo00222023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-17 17:57:53.922','','2023-05-17 17:57:53.922','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"ASHIRWAD TOWERS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"K.S.INFRACON PVT LTD\" and two other Respondents. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as defect in workmanship by the Respondents and has sought compensation from Respondent for financial, physical and mental hardships. Complainant has also filed separate Complaint in form M for other reliefs. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 17:57:53.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-17 17:57:53.000'),(13616,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:01:48.000',3022,'AdCNo00862022','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-17 18:01:49.022','','2023-05-17 18:01:49.022','','Complaint is returned as per your Email request dated 17.05.2023',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:01:48.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:01:48.000'),(13617,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:07:53.000',3097,'AdCNo00302023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-17 18:07:54.253','','2023-05-17 18:07:54.253','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a rera registered project namely \"Integrated Residential Township Phase-3C\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"M/S OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENSION DEVELOPERS PRIVATE LIMITED.\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non delivery of possession and non completion of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent and Litigation Charges. Complainant has also filed separate Complaint in form M for other reliefs. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:07:53.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:07:53.000'),(13618,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:29:45.000',3100,'AdCNo00322023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-17 18:29:46.210','','2023-05-17 18:29:46.210','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated .So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:29:45.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:29:45.000'),(13619,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:31:14.000',3102,'AdCNo00332023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-17 18:31:14.975','','2023-05-17 18:31:14.975','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:31:14.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-17 18:31:14.000'),(13620,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2023-05-18 12:54:37.000',2122,'AdCNo02422021TR-AUTH01852022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-18 12:54:38.975','','2023-05-18 12:54:38.975','','Complaint allowed to be withdrawn vide order dated 10.05.2023.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2023-05-18 12:54:37.000','systemanalyst.rera','2023-05-18 12:54:37.000'),(13621,440055,'adju