 Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-19 13:58:39.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-19 13:58:39.000'),(13675,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-05-19 14:07:44.000',3083,'AdCNo00192023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-19 14:07:46.245','','2023-05-19 14:07:46.245','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"CONNAUGHT RESIDENCY\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"TDI INFRATECH LTD\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint not received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as regards having many defects and certain works are still pending to be done by Respondents and have sought compensation from Respondent . Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-19 14:07:44.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-19 14:07:44.000'),(13676,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-05-19 14:14:47.000',3063,'AdCNo00032023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-19 14:14:49.709','','2023-05-19 14:14:49.709','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"IREO WATERFRONT POCKET-1\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"IREO WATERFRONT PVT LTD\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint not received. The Complainants alleged non delivery of possession and non completion of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent . Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-19 14:14:47.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-19 14:14:47.000'),(13677,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-05-19 15:03:57.000',2453,'AdCNo02282021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-19 15:03:59.475','','2023-05-19 15:03:59.475','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.  So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-19 15:03:57.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-19 15:03:57.000'),(13678,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-05-19 15:20:15.000',2423,'AdCNo02072021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-19 15:20:17.741','','2023-05-19 15:20:17.741','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You had not submitted the hard copies after resubmitting your Complaint. Now as per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) No hard Copy submitted. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-05-19 15:20:15.000','amlegalrera','2023-05-19 15:20:15.000'),(13679,440001,'999','2023-05-21 13:30:30.000',3109,'AdCNo00352023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-05-21 13:30:30.000','999','2023-05-21 13:30:30.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-05-21 13:30:30.000','sysadmin','2023-05-21 13:30:30.000'),(13680,440061,'systemanalyst.rera','2023-05-22 14:15:31.000',3042,'AdCNo01072022','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-22 14:15:35.656','','2023-05-22 14:15:35.656','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 07.06.2023 for Preliminary Hearing regarding the complaint as per directions.',2,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2023-05-22 14:15:31.000','systemanalyst.rera','2023-05-22 14:15:31.000'),(13681,440061,'systemanalyst.rera','2023-05-22 14:18:14.000',3098,'AdCNo00292023','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-22 14:18:17.985','','2023-05-22 14:18:17.985','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 07.06.2023 for Preliminary Hearing regarding the complaint as per directions.',2,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2023-05-22 14:18:14.000','systemanalyst.rera','2023-05-22 14:18:14.000'),(13682,440061,'systemanalyst.rera','2023-05-22 14:24:53.000',3011,'AdCNo01002022UR','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-05-22 14:24:57.297','','2023-05-22 