ived from registered Email-ID of Complaint requesting for withdrawal of the present case as he had filed two similar complaints mistakenly. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-07-27 12:45:38.000','amlegalrera','2023-07-27 12:45:38.000'),(13985,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-07-27 12:53:41.000',3131,'AdCNo00482023UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-07-27 12:53:43.320','','2023-07-27 12:53:43.320','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in an unregistered project namely \"EUFORIA HOMES\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"ASHOK KUMAR HUF\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged structural defects and non completion of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent for rectification of defects, mental agony and harassment.  Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-07-27 12:53:41.000','amlegalrera','2023-07-27 12:53:41.000'),(13986,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-07-28 09:45:50.000',3123,'AdCNo00462023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-07-28 09:45:52.164','','2023-07-28 09:45:52.164','','The present Complaint is about a Residential unit booked by Complainants in a RERA registered project \" THE PALM( PALM SPRINGS/PALM ECO/PALM GARDEN/VILLA)\" and the same has been filed against \" M/s MANOHAR INFRASTRUCTURE & CONSTRUCTIONS PVT LTD\". . Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non execution of Buyers Agreement by the Respondent and have o