','2023-08-16 09:34:29.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-16 09:34:29.000','TransferCase','Case Transfered with Reference Diary Number',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-16 09:34:29.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-16 09:34:29.000'),(14037,440049,'legaladvrera','2023-08-16 10:25:37.000',3099,'AdCNo00312023TR-AUTH00112023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-16 10:25:38.535','','2023-08-16 10:25:38.535','','The Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 07.08.2023 has transferred the present Complaint to the learned Bench of Sh. Ajay Pal Singh, Member of the Authority for deciding the relief of possession and delayed interest and other directions sought by the complainant. Accordingly, the present case is submitted to this Bench of Authority.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2023-08-16 10:25:37.000','legaladvrera','2023-08-16 10:25:37.000'),(14038,440049,'legaladvrera','2023-08-16 10:26:30.000',3100,'AdCNo00322023TR-AUTH00102023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-16 10:26:30.895','','2023-08-16 10:26:30.895','','The Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 07.08.2023 has transferred the present Complaint to the learned Bench of Sh. Ajay Pal Singh, Member of the Authority for deciding the relief of possession and delayed interest and other directions sought by the complainant. Accordingly, the present case is submitted to this Bench of Authority.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2023-08-16 10:26:30.000','legaladvrera','2023-08-16 10:26:30.000'),(14039,440049,'legaladvrera','2023-08-16 10:27:37.000',3102,'AdCNo00332023TR-AUTH00092023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-16 10:27:38.582','','2023-08-16 10:27:38.582','','The Ld. Adjudicating Officer vide Order dated 07.08.2023 has transferred the present Complaint to the learned Bench of Sh. Ajay Pal Singh, Member of the Authority for deciding the relief of possession and delayed interest and other directions sought by the complainant. Accordingly, the present case is submitted to this Bench of Authority.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2023-08-16 10:27:37.000','legaladvrera','2023-08-16 10:27:37.000'),(14040,440062,'amlegalrera','2023-08-16 11:42:28.000',3144,'AdCNo00502023UR','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-16 11:42:29.738','','2023-08-16 11:42:29.738','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-16 11:42:28.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-16 11:42:28.000'),(14041,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-08-16 12:46:37.000',3138,'AdCNo00512023UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-16 12:46:38.270','','2023-08-16 12:46:38.270','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Hard copies also not submitted. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-16 12:46:37.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-16 12:46:37.000'),(14042,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-08-16 13:14:06.000',3143,'AdCNo00522023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-16 13:14:07.176','','2023-08-16 13:14:07.176','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You are praying for possession of four Flats alongwith compensation in your \" Facts\" coloum\" . .As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Separate Complaint is to be filed for each Flat. (iii) Hard copies required. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-16 13:14:06.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-16 13:14:06.000'),(14043,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-08-16 13:18:48.000',3141,'AdCNo00532023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-16 13:18:49.004','','2023-08-16 13:18:49.004','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)  As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Hard copies required. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-16 13:18:48.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-16 13:18:48.000'),(14044,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2023-08-16 15:40:10.000',2672,'AdCNo00382021BFTR-AUTH01532021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-16 15:40:10.926','','2023-08-16 15:40:10.926','','The complainant does not wish to pursue the present matter and the same is, therefore, dismissed for non-prosecution vide order dated 08.08.2023.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2023-08-16 15:40:10.000','systemanalyst.rera','2023-08-16 15:40:10.000'),(14045,440001,'999','2023-08-16 22:08:41.000',3146,'AdCNo00542023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-08-16 22:08:41.000','999','2023-08-16 22:08:41.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-08-16 22:08:41.000','sysadmin','2023-08-16 22:08:41.000'),(14046,440059,'amlegalrera','2023-08-17 14:49:03.000',2993,'AdCNo00712022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-17 14:49:04.692','','2023-08-17 14:49:04.692','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 29.08.2023 and to file reply within 10 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-17 14:49:03.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-17 14:49:03.000'),(14047,440004,'999','2023-08-17 20:45:47.000',3143,'AdCNo00522023','Application Re-Submission(Modified Applicat