-21 12:24:24.810','','2023-08-21 12:24:24.810','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in an unregistered project namely \"PWD ( PUBLIC HEALTH) FOUNTAIN CHOWK, MALL ROAD PATIALA\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"ESTATE OFFICER PUDA\" and one other Respondent. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged delayed refund by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent for mental shock and agony along with Litigation Charges. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-21 12:24:20.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-21 12:24:20.000'),(14057,440001,'999','2023-08-21 14:30:25.000',3153,'AdCNo00592023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-08-21 14:30:25.000','999','2023-08-21 14:30:25.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-08-21 14:30:25.000','sysadmin','2023-08-21 14:30:25.000'),(14058,440070,'amlegalrera','2023-08-21 15:30:56.000',3092,'AdCNo00262023','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-21 15:31:00.831','','2023-08-21 15:31:00.831','','The present complaint is restored vide order dated 18.08.2023. passed in Misc App No. AO/14/2023',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-21 15:30:56.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-21 15:30:56.000'),(14059,440055,'readerao.rera','2023-08-21 16:18:30.000',3144,'AdCNo00502023UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2023-08-21 16:18:34.154','','2023-08-21 16:18:34.154','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused. Complaint be registered. Let notice be issued to 