10:40:37.154','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:40:37.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:40:37.000'),(14068,440054,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:42:08.000',2429,'AdCNo02062021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-22 10:42:08.935','','2023-08-22 10:42:08.935','','The present complaint is dismissed vide order dated 11.08.2023',1,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:42:08.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:42:08.000'),(14069,440057,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:43:02.000',2247,'AdCNo00832021','','','Authority Desk','No Reply Recieved within 15 days','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-22 10:43:02.264','','2023-08-22 10:43:02.264','','The complaint was returned to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017 . No reply or explanation submitted by Complainant even after lapse of 15 days.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:43:02.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:43:02.000'),(14070,440054,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:44:55.000',2247,'AdCNo00832021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-22 10:44:55.498','','2023-08-22 10:44:55.498','','The present complaint is dismissed vide order dated 10.08.2023',1,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:44:55.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:44:55.000'),(14071,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:45:02.000',3153,'AdCNo00592023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-22 10:45:02.451','','2023-08-22 10:45:02.451','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:45:02.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:45:02.000'),(14072,440054,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:47:16.000',2388,'AdCNo01842021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-22 10:47:16.076','','2023-08-22 10:47:16.076','','The present complaint is dismissed vide order dated 09.08.2023',1,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:47:16.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-22 10:47:16.000'),(14073,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 11:07:12.000',3151,'AdCNo00602023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-22 11:07:12.795','','2023-08-22 11:07:12.795','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Hard copies needs to be submitted .So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 11:07:12.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-22 11:07:12.000'),(14074,440054,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 11:10:39.000',2258,'AdCNo00962021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-22 11:10:39.107','','2023-08-22 11:10:39.107','','The present complaint is dismissed vide order dated 11.08.2023',1,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 11:10:39.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-22 11:10:39.000'),(14075,440053,'amlegalrera','2023-08-22 12:49:28.000',3146,'AdCNo00542023TR-AUTH00122023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-22 12:49:28.373','','2023-08-22 12:49:28.373','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SUSHMA CRESCENT\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as upl