'Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-25 09:59:49.904','','2023-08-25 09:59:49.904','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SHAURYA ANANDA\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"SHAURYA TOWNSHIP PVT LTD\" and two other Respondents. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual Legal physical possession of unit by the Respondent and have opted to withdraw from the Project and has sought compensation from Respondent for mental agony and harassment. Complainant has also filed separate Complaint in form M for refund. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-25 09:59:48.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-25 09:59:48.000'),(14093,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-08-25 10:17:46.000',3152,'AdCNo00632023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-25 10:17:48.264','','2023-08-25 10:17:48.264','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Vakalat nama is not uploaded online. (iii) Hard copies not submitted.So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-25 10:17:46.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-25 10:17:46.000'),(14094,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-08-25 10:23:01.000',3139,'AdCNo00642023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-25 10:23:02.967','','2023-08-25 10:23:02.967','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Vakalat nama is not uploaded online. (iii) Hard copies not submitted.So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-25 10:23:01.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-25 10:23:01.000'),(14095,440004,'999','2023-08-25 10:25:36.000',3156,'AdCNo00622023UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-08-25 10:25:36.000','999','2023-08-25 10:25:36.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-08-25 10:25:36.000','sysadmin','2023-08-25 10:25:36.000'),(14096,440001,'999','2023-08-25 11:41:05.000',3159,'AdCNo00652023','Co