-08-28 09:40:34.000'),(14108,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-08-28 09:46:10.000',3157,'AdCNo00662023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-28 09:46:14.710','','2023-08-28 09:46:14.710','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoters of a Registered Project but has not impleaded  the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N ( interim Prayer). (iii) Hard copies not submitted. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-28 09:46:10.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-28 09:46:10.000'),(14109,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-08-28 09:53:06.000',3158,'AdCNo00672023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-28 09:53:10.632','','2023-08-28 09:53:10.632','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N ( interim Prayer). (ii) Hard copies not submitted. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-28 09:53:06.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-28 09:53:06.000'),(14110,440001,'999','2023-08-28 15:51:07.000',3161,'AdCNo00692023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-08-28 15:51:07.000','999','2023-08-28 15:51:07.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-08-28 15:51:07.000','sysadmin','2023-08-28 15:51:07.000'),(14111,440061,'amlegalrera','2023-08-28 16:22:05.000',3153,'AdCNo00592023','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-28 16:22:09.835','','2023-08-28 16:22:09.835','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 18.09.2023 for Preliminary Hearing regarding the complaint as per directions..',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-08-28 16:22:05.000','amlegalrera','2023-08-28 16:22:05.000'),(14112,440059,'amlegalrera','2023-08-28 16:24:39.000',3153,'AdCNo00592023','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-08-28 16:24:43.523','','2023-08-28 16:24:43.523','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 18.09.2023 and to file reply within 15 days of