t on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Hard copies not submitted. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-11 13:53:27.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-11 13:53:27.000'),(14197,440062,'amlegalrera','2023-09-11 13:59:46.000',3165,'AdCNo00722023','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-11 13:59:50.940','','2023-09-11 13:59:50.940','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-11 13:59:46.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-11 13:59:46.000'),(14198,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-09-11 14:09:40.000',3167,'AdCNo00742023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-11 14:09:44.362','','2023-09-11 14:09:44.362','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii)  Hard copies not submitted. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'aml