',3140,'AdCNo00582023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-18 09:30:43.173','','2023-09-18 09:30:43.173','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 15.09.2023 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant with directions  to rectify the same in view of the substantial objections raised by the legal branch  and then rectified complaint be submitted online on or before 16.10.2023 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 15.09.2023.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-18 09:30:39.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-18 09:30:39.000'),(14230,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-09-18 13:14:33.000',3165,'AdCNo00722023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-18 13:14:37.792','','2023-09-18 13:14:37.792','','The present Complaint relates to a plot booked by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SUNTEC CITY\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"THE INDIAN CO-OP HOUSE BUILDING SOCIETY LTD\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. The Complainants alleged non delivery of possession of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent for various deficiencies. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-18 13:14:33.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-18 13:14:33.000'),(14231,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-09-18 13:36:26.000',3139,'AdCNo00642023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-18 13:36:30.792','','2023-09-18 13:36:30.792','','The present Complaint relates to a plot booked by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"Royal Arcade Ludhiana (Commercial-I)\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"OMAXE BUILDWELL LIMITED\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. The Complainant alleged non delivery of possession of the Project by the Respondents and has sought compensation from Respondent for mental pain along with Litigation Charges. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-18 13:36:26.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-18 13:36:26.000'),(14232,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-09-18 13:57:07.000',3151,'AdCNo00602023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-18 13:57:11.433','','2023-09-18 13:57:11.433','','The present Complaint relates to a  unit booked by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"PREET CITY\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"PREET LAND PROMOTERS & DEVELOPERS\r\nPVT. LTD\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. The Complainant alleged non delivery of possession of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent for mental pain along with Litigation Charges. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-18 13:57:07.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-18 13:57:07.000'),(14233,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-19 10:41:04.000',3151,'AdCNo00602023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-09-19 10:41:04.526','','2023-09-19 10:41:04.526','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondent through E-mail and Speed Post for 23.10.2023 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant.  ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-19 10:41:04.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-19 10:41:04.000'),(14234,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-19 10:44:13.000',3165,'AdCNo00722023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-09-19 10:44:13.683','','2023-09-19 10:44:13.683','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondent through E-mail and Speed Post for 23.10.2023 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant.  ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-19 10:44:13.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-19 10:44:13.000'),(14235,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-19 10:46:10.000',3139,'AdCNo00642023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-09-19 10:46:10.355','','2023-09-19 10:46:10.355','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Notice of the complaint be issued to respondent no.1 through E-mail and Speed Post for 23.10.2023 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant.  ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-19 10:46:10.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-19 10:46:10.000'),(14236,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-09-19 16:49:32.000',3169,'AdCNo00752023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-19 16:49:32.948','','2023-09-19 16:49:32.948','','Hard copy the complaint along with annexures (duly signed) has not been submitted by the Complainants. However, after scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge (a) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead other person as additional Respondent. You may refer the RERA website for the address and contact details of the main respondent. (b) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (c)  In terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, you are required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. The above defects may be removed within 15 days and resubmit the same along with duly signed and attested hard copies. In case the defects pointed out are not corrected, the matter shall be dealt with as per the said Regulations.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-19 16:49:32.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-19 16:49:32.000'),(14237,440001,'999','2023-09-20 08:14:28.000',3170,'AdCNo00762023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-09-20 08:14:28.000','999','2023-09-20 08:14:28.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-09-20 08:14:28.000','sysadmin','2023-09-20 08:14:28.000'),(14238,440004,'999','2023-09-20 20:12:34.000',3138,'AdCNo00512023UR','Application Re-Submis