ention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated (iv) Hard copies not submitted. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-22 16:03:40.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-22 16:03:40.000'),(14246,440001,'999','2023-09-23 13:44:15.000',3171,'AdCNo00772023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-09-23 13:44:15.000','999','2023-09-23 13:44:15.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-09-23 13:44:15.000','sysadmin','2023-09-23 13:44:15.000'),(14247,440062,'amlegalrera','2023-09-25 10:12:14.000',3171,'AdCNo00772023','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-25 10:12:18.669','','2023-09-25 10:12:18.669','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-25 10:12:14.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-25 10:12:14.000'),(14248,440001,'999','2023-09-25 16:33:32.000',3174,'AdCNo00782023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-09-25 16:33:32.000','999','2023-09-25 16:33:32.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-09-25 16:33:32.000','sysadmin','2023-09-25 16:33:32.000'),(14249,440057,'amlegalrera','2023-09-26 11:29:57.000',3164,'AdCNo00712023','','','Authority Desk','No Reply Recieved within 15 days','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-26 11:29:57.