plaint re called for forwarding before the bench under Regulation 6(5) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017 for further proceedings. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-26 11:32:23.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-26 11:32:23.000'),(14255,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-09-26 11:37:06.000',3171,'AdCNo00772023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-26 11:37:06.888','','2023-09-26 11:37:06.888','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"LA PARISIAN PHASE 1 ( T6 TO T9)\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"AMBIKA REALCON DEVELOPERS PVT LTD\" and one other respondent. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of actual Legal physical possession of unit by the Respondents and has sought compensation from Respondent for mental pain along with Litigation Charges. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-26 11:37:06.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-26 11:37:06.000'),(14256,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-09-27 10:56:30.000',3174,'AdCNo00782023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-09-27 10:56:31.028','','2023-09-27 10:56:31.028','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Vakalat nama is not uploaded online. (iii) Hard copies not submitted.So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-09-27 10:56:30.000','amlegalrera','2023-09-27 10:56:30.000'),(14257,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-27 13:32:35.000',3171,'AdCNo00772023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-09-27 13:32:36.169','','2023-09-27 13:32:36.169','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Notice of the complaint be issued to respondents no.1 and 2 through E-mail and Speed Post for 30.10.2023 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainants.  Intimation be also given to the complainants.  ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-27 13:32:35.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-27 13:32:35.000'),(14258,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-27 17:11:19.000',3164,'AdCNo00712023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-09-27 17:11:20.231','','2023-09-27 17:11:20.231','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused. Complainant has not complied with the objections raised by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench. In the interest of justice, let online complaint be returned and notice be issued to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online in facilitation with Legal Branch and then signed hard copy of the rectified complaint be also filed on or before 13.10.2023. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-27 17:11:19.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-27 17:11:19.000'),(14259,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-27 17:13:43.000',3166,'AdCNo00732023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-09-27 17:13:44.325','','2023-09-27 17:13:44.325','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused. Complainant has not complied with the objections raised by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench. In the interest of justice, let online complaint be returned and notice be issued to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online in facilitation with Legal Branch and then signed hard copy of the rectified complaint be also filed on or before 13.10.2023. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-27 17:13:43.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-27 17:13:43.000'),(14260,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-09-27 17:15:28.000',3167,'AdCNo00742023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-09-27 17:15:29.669','','2023-09-27 17:15:29.669','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused. Complainant has not complied with the objections raised by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench. In the interest of justice, let online complaint be returned and notice be issued to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online in facilitation with Legal Branch and then si