nd related matters) Regulations, 2017 . No reply or explanation submitted by Complainant even after lapse of 15 days.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-11-14 10:42:30.000','amlegalrera','2023-11-14 10:42:30.000'),(14454,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-11-14 10:42:56.000',3180,'AdCNo00852023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-11-14 10:42:56.059','','2023-11-14 10:42:56.059','','The complaint was returned to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. No Reply or Explanation submitted by Complainant Even After Lapse Of 15 Days. Complaint re called for forwarding before the bench under Regulation 6(5) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017 for further proceedings. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-11-14 10:42:56.000','amlegalrera','2023-11-14 10:42:56.000'),(14455,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-11-14 11:28:03.000',3211,'AdCNo01162023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-11-14 11:28:03.106','','2023-11-14 11:28:03.106','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondents no.1 to 3 through E-mail and Speed Post for 15.12.2023 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainants.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-11-14 11:28:03.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2023-11-14 11:28:03.000'),(14456,440058,'amlegalrera','2023-11-14 15:02:42.000',3211,'AdCNo01162023','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-42