". The Complainants have alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondents for mental harassment and other violations along with litigation charges. Complainant has filed separate Complaint in Form M for other reliefs . Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:11:44.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:11:44.000'),(14515,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:12:47.000',3197,'AdCNo01132023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-05 10:12:47.009','','2023-12-05 10:12:47.009','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SECTOR 88 & 89 INCLUDING PURAB PREMIUM APARTMENTS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"GREATER MOHALI AREA DEVELOPMENT.\". The Complainants have alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondents for mental harassment and other violations along with litigation charges. Complainant has filed separate Complaint in Form M for other reliefs . Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:12:47.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:12:47.000'),(14516,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:20:12.000',3221,'AdCNo01232023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-05 10:20:12.868','','2023-12-05 10:20:12.868','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set of one sided print of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:20:12.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:20:12.000'),(14517,440070,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:25:10.000',3010,'AdCNo00992022UR','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-05 10:25:10.306','','2023-12-05 10:25:10.306','','The complaint restored vide order dated 30.11.2023 passed in MA/AO/15/2023.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:25:10.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:25:10.000'),(14518,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:31:19.000',3010,'AdCNo00992022UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-05 10:31:19.510','','2023-12-05 10:31:19.510','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 30.11.2023 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant with directions  to rectify the same in view of the substantial objections raised by the legal branch  and then rectified complaint be submitted online on or before 15.12.2023 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 30.11.2023.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:31:19.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-05 10:31:19.000'),(14519,440070,'amlegalrera','2021-12-17 09:51:03.000',1669,'AdCNo15032019','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-05 11:51:03.806','','2023-12-05 11:51:03.806','','Complaint reopened vide order dated 30.11.2021 passed by  Ld Appellate Tribunal in Appeal No. 252 of 2020. ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 11:51:03.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-05 11:51:03.000'),(14520,440004,'999','2023-12-05 13:48:08.000',3180,'AdCNo00852023','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-12-05 13:48:08.000','999','2023-12-05 13:48:08.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-05 13:48:08.000','sysadmin','2023-12-05 13:48:08.000'),(14521,440004,'999','2023-12-05 14:18:46.000',3219,'AdCNo01222023','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-12-05 14:18:46.000','999','2023-12-05 14:18:46.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-05 14:18:46.000','sysadmin','2023-12-05 14:18:46.000'),(14522,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-12-05 15:17:56.000',3207,'AdCNo01052023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-05 1