ional Respondent. (ii) Each page should be numbered as per Annexures attached. \r\nSo, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 09:58:23.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 09:58:23.000'),(14655,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:02:29.000',3228,'AdCNo01272023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-26 10:02:29.133','','2023-12-26 10:02:29.133','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:02:29.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:02:29.000'),(14656,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:07:16.000',3186,'AdCNo00902023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-26 10:07:16.227','','2023-12-26 10:07:16.227','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have added Respondent No. 2 four times. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:07:16.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:07:16.000'),(14657,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:26:10.000',3183,'AdCNo00862023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-26 10:26:10.305','','2023-12-26 10:26:10.305','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SECTOR 88 & 89 INCLUDING PURAB PREMIUM APARTMENTS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"GREATER MOHALI AREA DEVELOPMENT.\" and one other Respondent. The Complainant has alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondents for mental harassment and other violations along with litigation charges. Complainant has filed separate. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:26:10.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:26:10.000'),(14658,440001,'999','2023-12-26 10:41:21.000',3222,'AdCNo01322023','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-12-26 10:41:21.000','999','2023-12-26 10:41:21.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-26 10:41:21.000','sysadmin','2023-12-26 10:41:21.000'),(14659,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:41:31.000',3182,'AdCNo00832023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-26 10:41:31.415','','2023-12-26 10:41:31.415','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SECTOR 88 & 89 INCLUDING PURAB PREMIUM APARTMENTS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"GREATER MOHALI AREA DEVELOPMENT.\" and one other Respondent. The Complainant has alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondents for mental harassment and other violations along with litigation charges. Complainant has filed separate. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:41:31.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:41:31.000'),(14660,440062,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:46:41.000',3232,'AdCNo01292023','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-26 10:46:41.805','','2023-12-26 10:46:41.805','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:46:41.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:46:41.000'),(14661,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:52:44.000',3233,'AdCNo01302023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-26 10:52:43.899','','2023-12-26 10:52:43.899','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) The name of Co-allottee has to be added as additional Complainant. (iii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iv) hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:52:44.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 10:52:44.000'),(14662,440054,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 11:34:48.000',1813,'AdCNo16022020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-26 11:34:48.555','','2023-12-26 11:34:48.555','','The present complaint is partly allowed vide order dated 05.12.2023.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 11:34:48.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 11:34:48.000'),(14663,440054,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 12:13:19.000',1960,'AdCNo16952020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-26 12:13:19.899','','2023-12-26 12:13:19.899','','The present complaint is partly allowed vide order dated 04.12.2023.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 12:13:19.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 12:13:19.000'),(14664,440056,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 12:58:36.000',3213,'AdCNo01172023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forward