al Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-26 14:41:06.180','','2023-12-26 14:41:06.180','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N (ii) Hard copies not submitted. So the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 14:41:06.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 14:41:06.000'),(14670,440062,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 14:44:29.000',3234,'AdCNo01332023','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-26 14:44:29.915','','2023-12-26 14:44:29.915','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-26 14:44:29.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-26 14:44:29.000'),(14671,440055,'readerao.rera','2023-12-26 15:47:29.000',3182,'AdCNo00832023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2023-12-26 15:47:29.493','','2023-12-26 15:47:29.493','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Notice of the complaint be issued to respondents no.1 and 2 through E-mail and Speed Post for 30.01.2024 with the direction to file rep