Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-12-27 17:25:11.000','999','2023-12-27 17:25:11.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-27 17:25:11.000','sysadmin','2023-12-27 17:25:11.000'),(14693,440004,'999','2023-12-27 22:16:13.000',3230,'AdCNo01282023','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-12-27 22:16:13.000','999','2023-12-27 22:16:13.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-27 22:16:13.000','sysadmin','2023-12-27 22:16:13.000'),(14694,440070,'amlegalrera','2023-12-29 15:32:09.000',3173,'AdCNo00812023','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-29 15:32:12.024','','2023-12-29 15:32:12.024','','The present complaint is restored vide order dated 29.12.2023.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-29 15:32:09.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-29 15:32:09.000'),(14695,440007,'amlegalrera','2023-12-29 15:34:39.000',3173,'AdCNo00812023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-29 15:34:41.680','','2023-12-29 15:34:41.680','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 29.12.2023 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant with directions  to rectify the same in view of the substantial objections raised by the legal branch  and then rectified complaint be submitted online on or before 31.01.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 29.12.2023.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2023-12-29 15:34:39.000','amlegalrera','2023-12-29 15:34:39.000'),(14696,440004,'999','2023-12-29 23:09:52.000',3186,'AdCNo00902023','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-12-29 23:09:52.000','999','2023-12-29 23:09:52.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-29 23:09:52.000','sysadmin','2023-12-29 23:09:52.000'),(14697,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-01-02 09:24:21.000',3222,'AdCNo01322023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-02 09:24:21.314','','2024-01-02 09:24:21.314','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-01-02 09:24:21.000','amlegalrera','2024-01-02 09:24:21.000'),(14698,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-01-02 09:28:46.000',3237,'AdCNo01342023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-02 09:28:46.689','','2024-01-02 09:28:46.689','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Complete agreement is to be uploaded online. (iv) hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-01-02 09:28:46.000','amlegalrera','2024-01-02 09:28:46.000'),(14699,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-01-02 09:32:47.000',3236,'AdCNo01352023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-02 09:32:46.846','','2024-01-02 09:32:46.846','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) Two Complaints for the same unit with same reliefs are not allowed. (ii) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (iii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iv) Complete agreement is to be uploaded online. (v) hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-01-02 09:32:47.000','amlegalrera','2024-01-02 09:32:47.000'),(14700,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-02 12:38:30.000',1318,'AdCNo12362019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-02 12:38:30.189','','2024-01-02 12:38:30.189','','The present complaint is partly allowed vide order dated 27.12.2023.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-02 12:38:30.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-02 12:38:30.000'),(14701,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-02 12:39:17.000',1319,'AdCNo12372019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-02 12:39:17.080','','2024-01-02 12:39:17.080','','The present complaint is partly allowed vide order dated 27.12.2023.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-02 12:39:17.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-02 12:39:17.000'),(14702,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-02 12:57:12.000',1524,'AdCNo13862019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-02 12:57:12.893','','2024-01-02 12:57:12.893','','The present complaint is partly allowed  vide order  dated 26.12.2023.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-02 12:57:12.000','OSlegal2.rer