33:42.000',3236,'AdCNo01352023TR-AUTH00012024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-01-23 09:33:42.263','','2024-01-23 09:33:42.263','','As per Regulation 9(3) of the Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017, the respondent is ordered to file its reply through registered post/speed post/email/through reputed courier or submit at the receipt counter of this Authority located at Plot No. 3, Block B,1st Floor, Sector 18-A, Madhya Marg, Chandigarh- 160018 on or before 26.02.2024 with a copy of the same to the complainant through registered post/speed post/through reputed courier and email. In case of non-filing of reply on or before 26.02.2024, it may file on the next working day and so on till the date of hearing.\r\n\r\n	Next date for hearing is 04.03.2024 at 11.30 AM to file Rejoinder and to examine the other issues of the case. Parties be informed through post as well as on their email addresses.\r\n',2,0,'pamemberaps','2024-01-23 09:33:42.000','pamemberaps','2024-01-23 09:33:42.000'),(14833,440055,'readerao.rera','2024-01-23 10:47:41.000',3222,'AdCNo01322023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-01-23 10:47:41.263','','2024-01-23 10:47:41.263','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused. Complainant has not complied with the objections raised by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench. In the interest of justice, let online complaint be returned and notice be issued to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online in facilitation with Legal Branch and then signed hard copy of the rectified complaint be also filed on or before 12.02.2024. ',2,0,'readerao.rera','2024-01-23 10:47:41.000','readerao.rera','2024-01-23 10:47:41.000'),(14834,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-23 12:16:16.000',1820,'AdCNo16182020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-23 12:16:16.607','','2024-01-23 12:16:16.607','','The present case is partly allowed vide order dated 12.01.2024.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-23 12:16:16.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-23 12:16:16.000'),(14835,440001,'999','2024-01-23 13:31:55.000',3262,'AdCNo00182024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-01-23 13:31:55.000','999','2024-01-23 13:31:55.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-01-23 13:31:55.000','sysadmin','2024-01-23 13:31:55.000'),(14836,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-23 14:53:06.000',3222,'AdCNo01322023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-23 14:53:06.357','','2024-01-23 14:53:06.357','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 19.01.2024 has directed that the online\r\ncomplaint be returned to the complainant with directions to rectify the same in view of the substantial objections raised by the legal branch and then rectified complaint be submitted\r\nonline on or before 12.02.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 19.01.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-23 14:53:06.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-23 14:53:06.000'),(14837,440001,'999','2024-01-24 14:20:02.000',3259,'AdCNo00192024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-01-