 Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-31 15:27:06.199','','2024-01-31 15:27:06.199','','Complaint re-opens vide order dated 25.01.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-31 15:27:05.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-31 15:27:05.000'),(14878,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-31 15:38:13.000',1337,'AdCNo12482019','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-31 15:38:13.621','','2024-01-31 15:38:13.621','','The present complaint is partly allowed vide order dated 25.01.2024.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-31 15:38:13.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-01-31 15:38:13.000'),(14879,440004,'999','2024-01-31 22:39:22.000',3246,'AdCNo00092024','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-01-31 22:39:22.000','999','2024-01-31 22:39:22.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-01-31 22:39:22.000','sysadmin','2024-01-31 22:39:22.000'),(14880,440001,'999','2024-01-31 22:41:59.000',3271,'AdCNo00282024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-01-31 22:41:59.000','999','2024-01-31 22:41:59.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-01-31 22:41:59.000','sysadmin','2024-01-31 22:41:59.000'),(14881,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-02-01 16:41:03.000',3269,'AdCNo00242024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-01 16:41:05.183','','2024-02-01 16:41:05.183','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N (iii) Facts column should not contain Emails, Annexures and should only contain facts of the case (iv) All the Annexures attached with hard copy are not uploaded.  So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-02-01 16:41:03.000','amlegalrera','2024-02-01 16:41:03.000'),(14882,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-02-01 16:44:57.000',3272,'AdCNo00272024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-01 16:44:58.386','','2024-02-01 16:44:58.386','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N (iii) Facts column should not contain Emails, Annexures and should only contain facts of the case (iv) All the Annexures attached with hard copy are not uploaded. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-02-01 16:44:57.000','amlegalrera','2024-02-01 16:44:57.000'),(14883,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-02-01 16:53:49.000',3262,'AdCNo00182024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-02-01 16:53:50.715','','2024-02-01 16:53:50.715','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondent no. 1 through E-mail and Speed Post for 27.02.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-02-01 16:53:49.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-02-01 16:53:49.000'),(14884,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-02-01 16:54:42.000',3264,'AdCNo00222024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-02-01 16:54:43.386','','2024-02-01 16:54:43.386','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondent no. 1 through E-mail and Spe