d to send one set of paper-book of complaint to the Bench of Sh. Rakesh Kumar Goyal, Ld. Member of the Authority for deciding the claim of refund and interest sought by the complainant.  Accordingly, the present case is submitted to this Bench of Authority.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2024-02-09 10:04:42.000','legaladvrera','2024-02-09 10:04:42.000'),(14937,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-02-09 10:11:50.000',3242,'AdCNo00082024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-09 10:11:52.280','','2024-02-09 10:11:52.280','','Hard copies not submitted. The complaint was asked to submit hard copies as per Regulation 4(3) and (4) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a rera registered project namely \"Integrated Residential Township Phase-3C\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"M/S OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENSION DEVELOPERS PRIVATE LIMITED.\" and three other Respondents . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non delivery of possession and non completion of the Project by the Respondents and has sought compensation from Respondent and Litigation Charges. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-02-09 10:11:50.000','amlegalrera','2024-02-09 10:11:50.000'),(14938,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-02-09 10:14:53.000',3247,'AdCNo00102024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-09 10:14:55.217','','2024-02-09 10:14:55.217','','Hard copies not submitted. The complaint was asked to submit hard copies as per Regulation 4(3) and (4) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for hand