the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondents for mental harassment and other violations along with litigation charges. Complainant has filed separate Complaint in Form M for other reliefs . Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted,. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-02-13 10:58:58.000','amlegalrera','2024-02-13 10:58:58.000'),(14967,440001,'999','2024-02-13 13:06:11.000',3276,'AdCNo00302024UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-02-13 13:06:11.000','999','2024-02-13 13:06:11.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-02-13 13:06:11.000','sysadmin','2024-02-13 13:06:11.000'),(14968,440001,'999','2024-02-13 13:09:23.000',3277,'AdCNo00312024UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-02-13 13:09:23.000','999','2024-02-13 13:09:23.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-02-13 13:09:23.000','sysadmin','2024-02-13 13:09:23.000'),(14969,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-02-13 15:10:11.000',3252,'AdCNo00252024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-02-13 15:10:11.261','','2024-02-13 15:10:11.261','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondents no. 1 and 2 through E-mail and Speed Post for 21.03.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-02-13 15:10:11.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-02-13 15:10:11.000'),(14970,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-02-13 15:11:33.000',3259,'AdCNo00192024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-02-13 15:11:32.995','','2024-02-13 15:11:32.995','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondents no. 1 and 2 through E-mail and Speed Post for 21.03.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-02-13 15:11:33.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-02-13 15:11:33.000'),(14971,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-02-14 09:22:18.000',3276,'AdCNo00302024UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-14 09:22:18.417','','2024-02-14 09:22:18.417','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)Name of Respondent is different from as mentioned in facts of the Case. You are required to implead the Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii)  As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-02-14 09:22:18.000','amlegalrera','2024-02-14 09:22:18.000'),(14972,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-02-14 09:23:26.000',3277,'AdCNo00312024UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-14 09:23:26.605','','2024-02-14 09:23:26.605','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)Name of Respondent is different from as mentioned in facts of the Case. You are required to implead the Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii)  As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-02-14 09:23:26.000','amlegalrera','2024-02-14 09:23:26.000'),(14973,440058,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-14 10:11:41.000',3228,'AdCNo01272023','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-14 10:11:41.620','','2024-02-14 10:11:41.620','',' Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized\r\nrepresentative on 15.