ar in person or through his authorized\r\nrepresentative on 27.03.2024 as per directions.\r\n',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:05:00.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:05:00.000'),(15012,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:06:25.000',3278,'AdCNo00322024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-21 11:06:25.334','','2024-02-21 11:06:25.334','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized\r\nrepresentative on 27.03.2024 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:06:25.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:06:25.000'),(15013,440058,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:07:32.000',3255,'AdCNo00212024','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-21 11:07:32.146','','2024-02-21 11:07:32.146','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized\r\nrepresentative on 27.03.2024 as per directions.\r\n',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:07:32.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:07:32.000'),(15014,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:08:24.000',3255,'AdCNo00212024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-21 11:08:24.615','','2024-02-21 11:08:24.615','',' Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized\r\nrepresentative on 27.03.2024 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:08:24.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:08:24.000'),(15015,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-02-21 11:11:50.000',3277,'AdCNo00312024UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-21 11:11:51.146','','2024-02-21 11:11:51.146','','All objections not removed. After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)Name of\r\nRespondent is different from as mentioned in facts of the Case. You are required to implead the Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme\r\nCourt vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) PDF of facts not attached with Hard copies So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-02-21 11:11:50.000','amlegalrera','2024-02-21 11:11:50.000'),(15016,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:11:52.000',3269,'AdCNo00242024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-21 11:11:52.303','','2024-02-21 11:11:52.303','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 20.02.2024 has directed that the online\r\ncomplaint be returned to the complainant with directions to rectify the same in view of the\r\nsubstantial objections raised by the legal branch and then rectified complaint be submitted\r\nonline on or before 11.03.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same\r\nbe also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the\r\ncomplainant for the compliance of the Order dated 20.02.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:11:52.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:11:52.000'),(15017,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:13:12.000',3272,'AdCNo00272024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-21 11:13:12.896','','2024-02-21 11:13:12.896','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 20.02.2024 has directed that the online\r\ncomplaint be returned to the complainant with directions to rectify the same in view of the\r\nsubstantial objections raised by the legal branch and then rectified complaint be submitted\r\nonline on or before 11.03.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same\r\nbe also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the\r\ncomplainant for the compliance of the Order dated 20.02.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:13:12.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-21 11:13:12.000'),(15018,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-02-21 11:13:29.000',3276,'AdCNo00302024UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-21 11:13:29.927','','2024-02-21 11:13:29.927','','All objections not removed. After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)Name of\r\nRespondent is different from as mentioned in facts of the Case. You are required to implead the Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme\r\nCourt vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) PDF of facts not attached with Hard copies So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-02-21 11:13:29.000','amlegalrera','2024-02-21 11:13:29.000'),(15019,440004,'999','2024-02-21 17:13:20.000',3277,'AdCNo00312024UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-02-21 17:13:20.000','999','2024-02-21 17:13:20.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-02-21 17:13:20.000','sysadmin','2024-02-21 17:13:20.000'),(15020,440004,'999','2024-02-21 17:45:59.000',3276,'AdCNo00302024UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-02-21 17:45:59.000','999','2024-02-21 17:45:59.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-02-21 17:45:59.000','sysadmin','2024-02-21 17:45:59.000'),(15021,440058,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-22 16:34:02.000',3180,'AdCNo00852023','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-22 16:34:03.553','','2024-02-22 16:34:03.553','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized\r\nrepresentative on 27.02.2024 as per directions.\r\n',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-22 16:34:02.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-22 16:34:02.000'),(15022,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-02-22 16:38:10.000',3180,'AdCNo00852023','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-02-22 16:38:11.146','','2024-02-22 16:38:11.146','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized\r\nrepresentative on 27.02.2024 and to file