:52.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-03-01 11:33:52.000'),(15038,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-03-04 10:40:21.000',3287,'AdCNo00342024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-04 10:40:24.465','','2024-03-04 10:40:24.465','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a rera registered project namely \"MONA CITY HOMES\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"MONA TOWNSHIP PVT LTD.\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant has alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondent for physical, mental harassment etc.. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-04 10:40:21.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-04 10:40:21.000'),(15039,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-03-04 10:52:55.000',3273,'AdCNo00292024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-04 10:52:58.293','','2024-03-04 10:52:58.293','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"CASA ESPANA\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"M/s ATS INFRABUILD PVT. LTD\" and one other Respondent. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged delay in delivery of unit by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondents for mental agony and harassment. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-04 10:52:55.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-04 10:52:55.000'),(15040,440056,'amlegalrera','2022-06-23 11:54:18.000',2932,'AdCNo00352022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-06-23 11:54:18.000','','2022-06-23 11:54:18.000','','Complainant vide E-Mail dated 22.06.2022 has requested for withdrawal of the present Complaint. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2022-06-23 11:54:18.000','amlegalrera','2022-06-23 11:54:18.000'),(15041,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-03-04 13:18:13.000',3275,'AdCNo00332024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-04 13:18:16.699','','2024-03-04 13:18:16.699','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted.(iv) Prayer made should be more specific with directions to the Respondent and should not contain facts of the case. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-04 13:18:13.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-04 13:18:13.000'),(15042,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-03-04 13:22:21.000',3288,'AdCNo00352024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-04 13:22:25.059','','2024-03-04 13:22:25.059','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent. (ii)Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted.. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-04 13:22:21.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-04 13:22:21.000'),(15043,440001,'999','2024-03-04 18:54:17.000',3261,'AdCNo00362024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-03-04 18:54:17.000','999','2024-03-04 18:54:17.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-03-04 18:54:17.000','sysadmin','2024-03-04 18:54:17.000'),(15044,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-03-05 09:35:42.000',3276,'AdCNo00302024UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-05 09:35:42.433','','2024-03-05 09:35:42.433','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in an un- registered project namely \"Deep Residency\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"SINGH BUILDERS AND DEVELOPERS\" and TWO other Respondents. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged delay in delivery of unit and non registration with RERA, by the Respondents and have sought compensation from Respondents for mental agony and physical harassment. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-05 09:35:42.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-05 09:35:42.000'),(15045,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-03-05 09:36:24.000',3277,'AdCNo00312024UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-05 09:36:24.012','','2024-03-05 09:36:24.012','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in an un- registered project namely \"Deep Residency\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"SINGH BUILDERS AND DEVELOPERS\" and TWO other Respondents. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged delay in delivery of unit and non registration with RERA, by the Respondents and have sought compensation from Respondents for mental agony and physical harassment. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-05 09:36:24.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-05 09:36:24.000'),(15046,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-03-05 10:03:40.000',3271,'AdCNo00282024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-05 10:03:40.199','','2024-03-05 10:03:40.199','','Hard copies not submitted. The complaint was asked to submit hard copies as per Regulation 4(3) and (4) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. The presen