 additional Respondent(s). (ii) The name of Co-allottee has to be added as additional Complainant. (iii) Vakalatnama is not uploaded. (iv) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 09:30:41.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-22 09:30:41.000'),(15107,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 09:34:38.000',3261,'AdCNo00362024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-22 09:34:39.667','','2024-03-22 09:34:39.667','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 09:34:38.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-22 09:34:38.000'),(15108,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 09:38:34.000',3295,'AdCNo00392024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-22 09:38:35.527','','2024-03-22 09:38:35.527','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) The name of Co-allottee has to be added as additional Complainant. (iii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required two sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 09:38:34.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-22 09:38:34.000'),(15109,440057,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 10:06:41.000',3275,'AdCNo00332024','','','Authority Desk','No Reply Recieved within 15 days','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-22 10:06:42.855','','2024-03-22 10:06:42.855','','The complaint was returned to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017 . No reply or explanation submitted by Complainant even after lapse of 15 days.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 10:06:41.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-22 10:06:41.000'),(15110,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 10:07:08.000',3275,'AdCNo00332024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-22 10:07:09.261','','2024-03-22 10:07:09.261','','The complaint was returned to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. No Reply or Explanation submitted by Complainant Even After Lapse Of 15 Days. Complaint re called for forwarding before the bench under Regulation 6(5) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017 for further proceedings. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 10:07:08.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-22 10:07:08.000'),(15111,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 10:14:44.000',3300,'AdCNo00422024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-03-22 10:14:45.558','','2024-03-22 10:14:45.558','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"HERMITAGE CENTRALIS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"M/S HERMITAGE INFRA DEVELOPERS.\" and three other Respondents. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted. The Complainants alleged violation as regards delay in delivery of actual Legal physical possession of unit by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondents  Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-03-22 10:14:44.000','amlegalrera','2024-03-22 10:14:44.000'),(15112,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-03-22 16:35:08.000',3275,'AdCNo00332024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-03-22 16:35:09.933','','2024-03-22 16:35:09.933','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused.  Complainant has not complied with the objections raised by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench.  In the interest of justice, online complaint be returned and notice be issued to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online in facilitation with Legal Branch and then signed hard copy of the rectified complaint be also filed on or before 23