f defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. No Reply or Explanation submitted by Complainant Even After Lapse Of 15 Days. Complaint re called for forwarding before the bench under Regulation 6(5) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017 for further proceedings. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-04-22 09:23:56.000','amlegalrera','2024-04-22 09:23:56.000'),(15195,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-04-22 09:25:48.000',3285,'AdCNo00472024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-04-22 09:25:51.138','','2024-04-22 09:25:51.138','','Hard copies not submitted. The complaint was asked to submit hard copies as per Regulation 4(3) and (4) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. . The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SECTOR 88 & 89 INCLUDING PURAB PREMIUM APARTMENTS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"GREATER MOHALI AREA DEVELOPMENT.\" and one other Respondent. The Complainant has alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondents for mental harassment and other violations along with litigation charges. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-04-22 09:25:48.000','amlegalrera','2024-04-22 09:25:48.000'),(15196,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-04-22 09:26:10.000',3286,'AdCNo00372024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-04-22 09:26:13.747','','202