CNo00562024UR','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-05-03 17:28:21.000','999','2024-05-03 17:28:21.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-05-03 17:28:21.000','sysadmin','2024-05-03 17:28:21.000'),(15268,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:23:47.000',3311,'AdCNo00582024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-06 09:23:55.115','','2024-05-06 09:23:55.115','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"IREO WATERFRONT POCKET 4\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"IREO WATERFRONT PVT LTD\" and two other Respondents. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondent for mental harassment and other violations along with litigation charges. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:23:47.000','amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:23:47.000'),(15269,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:29:48.000',3317,'AdCNo00612024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-06 09:29:56.255','','2024-05-06 09:29:56.255','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:29:48.000','amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:29:48.000'),(15270,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:32:45.000',3318,'AdCNo00622024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-06 09:32:52.552','','2024-05-06 09:32:52.552','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:32:45.000','amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:32:45.000'),(15271,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:41:04.000',3292,'AdCNo00632024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-06 09:41:11.740','','2024-05-06 09:41:11.740','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:41:04.000','amlegalrera','2024-05-06 09:41:04.000'),(15272,440058,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-05-06 09:43:54.000',3295,'AdCNo00392024','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-06 09:44:01.537','','2024-05-06 09:44:01.537','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 06.06.2024 as per directions.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-05-06 09:43:54.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-05-06 09:43:54.000'),(15273,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-05-06 09:50:01.000',3295,'AdCNo00392024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-06 09:50:08.505','','2024-05-06 09:50:08.505','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 06.06.2024 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-05-06 09:50:01.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-05-06 09:50:01.000'),(15274,440004,'999','2024-05-06 11:18:38.000',3315,'AdCNo00592024','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with 