.000',3292,'AdCNo00632024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-23 09:23:37.073','','2024-05-23 09:23:37.073','','The complaint was returned to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. No Reply or Explanation submitted by Complainant Even After Lapse Of 15 Days. Complaint re called for forwarding before the bench under Regulation 6(5) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017 for further proceedings. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:23:36.000','amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:23:36.000'),(15363,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:31:07.000',3329,'AdCNo00752024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-23 09:31:07.620','','2024-05-23 09:31:07.620','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"GROUP HOUSING(THE LAKE)\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENSION DEVELOPERS PVT LTD\" and one other Respondent. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged delay in possession and charging excess amount  by the Respondents and has sought compensation on various grounds from Respondent. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:31:07.000','amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:31:07.000'),(15364,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:33:36.000',3319,'AdCNo00712024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-23 09:33:37.433','','2024-05-23 09:33:37.433','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"WORLD-I HIGH STREET\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"RELIANT INFRASTRUCTURE PVT LTD\" and three other Respondents. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non delivery of actual Legal physical possession of unit by the Respondents and has sought compensation on various grounds from Respondent. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:33:36.000','amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:33:36.000'),(15365,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:35:39.000',3328,'AdCNo00732024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-23 09:35:39.558','','2024-05-23 09:35:39.558','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"GROUP HOUSING(THE LAKE)\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"OMAXE CHANDIGARH EXTENSION DEVELOPERS PVT LTD\" and one other Respondent. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged delay in completion of project and charging excess amount by the Respondents and has sought compensation on various grounds from Respondent. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:35:39.000','amlegalrera','2024-05-23 09:35:39.000'),(15366,440062,'amlegalrera','2024-05-23 13:50:47.000',3327,'AdCNo00722024','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-23 13:50:48.011','','2024-05-23 13:50:48.011','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-23 13:50:47.000','amlegalrera','2024-05-23 13:50:47.000'),(15367,440001,'999','2024-05-23 14:59:40.000',3330,'AdCNo00762024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-05-23 14:59:40.000','999','2024-05-23 14:59:40.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-05-23 14:59:40.000','sysadmin','2024-05-23 14:59:40.000'),(15368,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 13:05:34.000',3328,'AdCNo00732024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-05-24 13:05:35.370','','2024-05-24 13:05:35.370','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondents no.1 and 2 through E-mail and Speed Post for 27.06.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 13:05:34.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 13:05:34.000'),(15369,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-05-24 13:06:36.000',3308,'AdCNo00542024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-24 13:06:37.401','','2024-05-24 13:06:37.401','','You have resubmitted the Complaint without removing the objections. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\nOBJECTIONS(i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted.(v) You have sought two reliefs i.e. providing of possession of apartment and Refund of amount with interest, which are mutually exclusive. One relief may be specified as per the provisions of the Act . ',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-24 13:06:36.000','amlegalrera','2024-05-24 13:06:36.000'),(15370,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 13:09:40.000',3329,'AdCNo00752024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-05-24 13:09:41.948','','2024-05-24 13:09:41.948','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondents no.1 and 2 through E-mail and Speed Post for 27.06.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 13:09:40.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 13:09:40.000'),(15371,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 13:13:42.000',3319,'AdCNo00712024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-05-24 13:13:44.105','','2024-05-24 13:13:44.105','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondents no.1 to 4 through E-mail and Speed Post for 28.06.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 13:13:42.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 13:13:42.000'),(15372,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 14:00:10.000',3292,'AdCNo00632024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-05-24 14:00:11.573','','2024-05-24 14:00:11.573','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused.  Complainant has not complied with the objections raised by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench.  In the interest of justice, online complaint be returned and notice be issued to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online in facilitation with Legal Branch and then signed hard copy of the rectified complaint be also filed on or before 19.06.2024.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 14:00:10.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-24 14:00:10.000'),(15373,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-05-24 14:57:19.000',3231,'AdCNo01312023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-05-24 14:57:20.745','','2024-05-24 14:57:20.745','','Complaint is returned as per your Email request dated 24.05.2024',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-05-2