n or before 14.06.2024.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-29 16:26:17.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-29 16:26:17.000'),(15405,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-29 16:28:48.000',3321,'AdCNo00662024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-05-29 16:28:49.040','','2024-05-29 16:28:49.040','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch after rectification.  It transpires that initially the Legal Branch made the substantial objection of impleading Director / Incharge of the affairs of the company as additional respondent apart from impleading main promoter.  The complainant however, after returning of the online complaint by the Legal Branch, simply added the promoter as party through the Managing Director of the company.  Therefore, the substantial objection as noticed above, has not been rectified by the complainant.  In this view of the matter, the online complaint is directed to be returned to the complainant for rectification of the same for impleading Director / Incharge of the affairs of the company as additional respondent apart from impleading main promoter in facilitation with Legal Branch and then signed hard copy of the rectified complaint be also filed on or before 19.06.2024.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-29 16:28:48.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-05-29 16:28:48.000'),(15406,440001,'999','2024-05-30 16:29:57.000',3333,'AdCNo00782024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-05-30 16:29:57.000','999','2024-05-30 16:29:57.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-05-30 16:29:57.000','sysadmin','2024-05-30 16:29:57.000'),(15407,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-05-31 09:47:26.000',3315,'AdCNo00592024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4dd