ty (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017. No Reply or Explanation submitted by Complainant Even After Lapse Of 15 Days. Complaint re called for forwarding before the bench under Regulation 6(5) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017 for further proceedings. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-05 11:45:27.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-05 11:45:27.000'),(15434,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-06-05 16:19:36.000',3323,'AdCNo00672024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-06-05 16:19:36.375','','2024-06-05 16:19:36.375','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused.  Complainant has not complied with directions of removal of the objections by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench.  In the interest of justice, online complaint be returned and notice be issued to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online in facilitation with Legal Branch and then signed hard copy of the rectified complaint be also filed on or before 27.06.2024.',2,0,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-06-05 16:19:36.000','adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-06-05 16:19:36.000'),(15435,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-06 12:10:56.000',3323,'AdCNo00672024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-06 12:10:56.797','','2024-06-06 12:10:56.797','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 05.06.2024 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant with directions to rectify the same in view of the substantial objections raised by the legal branch and then rectified complaint be submitted online on or before 27.06.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 05.06.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-06 12:10:56.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-06 12:10:56.000'),(15436,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-06 13:53:00.000',1853,'AdCNo16332020','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-06 13:53:00.719','','2024-06-06 13:53:00.735','','The present case is partly allowed vide order dt. 29.05.2024.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-06 13:53:00.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-06 13:53:00.000'),(15437,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-06 13:54:12.000',2376,'AdCNo01752021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-06 13:54:13.532','','2024-06-06 13:54:13.532','','The present case is partly allowed vide order dt. 28.05.2024.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-06 13:54:12.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-06 13:54:12.000'),(15438,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-06-07 09:31:21.000',3332,'AdCNo00772024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-07 09:31:22.688','','2024-06-07 09:31:22.688','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"CITY OF DREAMS-5\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"CREDO ASSETS PVT LTD\" and three other Respondents. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged delay in possession by the Respondents and has sought compensation on various grounds from Respondent. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-07 09:31:21.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-07 09:31:21.000'),(15439,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-06-07 13:04:59.000',3307,'AdCNo00742024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-07 13:05:00.625','','2024-06-07 13:05:00.625','','The present Complaint relates to a unit booked by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SUSHMA VALENCIA\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"SUKSHA DEVELOERS PVT LTD\" and one other Respondent. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non refund of booking amount by the Respondents and has sought compensation on various grounds from Respondents. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-07 13:04:59.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-07 13:04:59.000'),(15440,440054,'systemanalyst.rera','2024-06-07 13:57:02.000',2636,'AdCNo00622021URBFTR-AUTH00572022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-07 13:57:03.672','','2024-06-07 13:57:03.672','','Complaint accepted vide order dated 31.05.2024.',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2024-06-07 13:57:02.000','systemanalyst.rera','2024-06-07 13:57:02.000'),(15441,440055,'adjudicatingofficer.rera','2024-06-07 16:16:35.000',3332,'AdCNo00772024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-06-07 16:16:36.250','','2024-06-07 16:16:36.250','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondents no.1 to 4 through E-mail and Speed Post for 15.07.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to th