330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-18 12:16:11.846','','2024-06-18 12:16:11.846','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Authorised Person/Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) The name of Co-allottee has to be added as additional Complainant.(iii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-18 12:16:12.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-18 12:16:12.000'),(15464,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-18 14:05:02.000',3020,'AdCNo00852022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-18 14:05:01.753','','2024-06-18 14:05:01.753','','The present complaint is dismissed vide order dated 05.06.2024.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-18 14:05:02.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-18 14:05:02.000'),(15465,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-18 14:05:48.000',3018,'AdCNo00842022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-18 14:05:47.643','','2024-06-18 14:05:47.643','','The present complaint is dismissed 