moters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed, and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-19 13:26:21.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-19 13:26:21.000'),(15498,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-20 10:39:26.000',3292,'AdCNo00632024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-20 10:39:26.487','','2024-06-20 10:39:26.487','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 19.06.2024 has directed that the online\r\ncomplaint be returned to the complainant with directions to rectify the same in view of the\r\nsubstantial objections raised by the legal branch and then rectified complaint be submitted\r\nonline on or before 05.07.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same\r\nbe also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the\r\ncomplainant for the compliance of the Order dated 19.06.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-20 10:39:26.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-20 10:39:26.000'),(15499,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:36:08.000',3327,'AdCNo00722024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-20 13:36:09.018','','2024-06-20 13:36:09.018','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SECTOR 88 & 89 INCLUDING PURAB PREMIUM APARTMENTS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"GREATER MOHALI AREA DEVELOPMENT.\"  The Complainant has alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent for mental harassment and other violations along with litigation charges. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:36:08.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:36:08.000'),(15500,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:45:07.000',3348,'AdCNo00832024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-20 13:45:07.737','','2024-06-20 13:45:07.737','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) The name of Co-allottee has to be added as additional Complainant.. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed, and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:45:07.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:45:07.000'),(15501,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:47:39.000',3340,'AdCNo00792024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-20 13:47:39.675','','2024-06-20 13:47:39.675','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a rera registered project namely \"ATS GOLF MEADOWS-V\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"ATS ESTATES PVT. LTD.\" and one other Respondent . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non delivery of possession and non completion of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondents for physical and mental hardships. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:47:39.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:47:39.000'),(15502,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:49:50.000',3324,'AdCNo00682024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-20 13:49:51.268','','2024-06-20 13:49:51.268','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a rera registered project namely \"ATS GOLF MEADOWS LIFESTYLE\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"ATS ESTATES PVT. LTD.\" and one other Respondent. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged non delivery of possession by the Respondents and has sought compensation from Respondent for financial, physical and mental hardships. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:49:50.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-20 13:49:50.000'),(15503,440063,'sysadmin','2024-04