-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-06-27 09:53:07.000','999','2024-06-27 09:53:07.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-06-27 09:53:07.000','sysadmin','2024-06-27 09:53:07.000'),(15669,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-27 10:41:31.000',3153,'AdCNo00592023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-27 10:41:32.378','','2024-06-27 10:41:32.378','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 26.06.2024 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant with directions to rectify the same in view of the substantial objections raised by the legal branch and then rectified complaint be submitted online on or before 25.07.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 26.06.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-27 10:41:31.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-27 10:41:31.000'),(15670,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:06:28.000',3333,'AdCNo00782024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-27 12:06:28.816','','2024-06-27 12:06:28.816','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a rera registered project namely \"PUDA ENCLAVE MANSA\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"BATHINDA DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY.\". Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non development of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:06:28.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:06:28.000'),(15671,440057,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:13:49.000',3308,'AdCNo00542024','','','Authority Desk','No Reply Recieved within 15 days','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-27 12:13:49.816','','2024-06-27 12:13:49.816','','The complaint was returned to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017 . No reply or explanation submitted by Complainant even after lapse of 15 days.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:13:49.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:13:49.000'),(15672,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:14:07.000',3308,'AdCNo00542024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-27 12:14:07.988','','2024-06-27 12:14:07.988','','The complaint was returned to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. No Reply or Explanation submitted by Complainant Even After Lapse Of 15 Days. Complaint re called for forwarding before the bench under Regulation 6(5) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017 for further proceedings. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:14:07.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:14:07.000'),(15673,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:15:33.000',3320,'AdCNo00642024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-27 12:15:33.832','','2024-06-27 12:15:33.832','','Hard copies not submitted. The complaint was required to submit hard copies as per Regulation 4(3) and (4) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017.. The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SECTOR 88 & 89 INCLUDING PURAB PREMIUM APARTMENTS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"GREATER MOHALI AREA DEVELOPMENT.\" and one other Respondent. The Complainant has alleged non delivery of actual LEGAL possession by the Respondent and have sought compensation from Respondents for mental harassment and other violations along with litigation charges. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:15:33.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-27 12:15:33.000'),(15674,440001,'999','2024-06-27 12:33:10.000',3339,'AdCNo00952024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-06-27 12:33:10.000','999','2024-06-27 12:33:10.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-06-27 12:33:10.000','sysadmin','2024-06-27 12:33:10.000'),(15675,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 14:56:30.000',3346,'AdCNo00812024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-27 14:56:31.113','','2024-06-27 14:56:31.113','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Details and page Numbers of Annexure 1 are different from uploaded Document. (iv) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed, and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 14:56:30.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-27 14:56:30.000'),(15676,440070,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 15:10:43.000',1923,'AdCNo16762020UR','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-27 15:10:44.472','','2024-06-27 15:10:44.472','','The present complaint is restored vide order dated 19.06.2024 passed in MA No. AO/03 of 2023.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-27 15:10:43.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-27 15:10:43.000'),(15677,440070,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-27 16:01:46.000',1859,'AdCNo16572020UR','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-27 16:01:47.097','','2024-06-27 16:01:47.097','','The present complaint is restored vide order dated 19.06.2024 passed in MA No. AO/05 of 2023.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-27 16:01:46.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-27 16:01:46.000'),(15678,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-27 16:11:50.000',2304,'AdCNo01272021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-27 16:11:50.753','','2024-06-27 16:11:50.753','','The present complaint is dismissed vide order dated 26.06.2024.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-27 16:11:50.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-27 16:11:50.000'),(15679,440055,'readerao.rera','2024-06-27 16:49:00.000',3320,'AdCNo0064202