with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant.  ',2,0,'readerao.rera','2024-06-27 16:56:08.000','readerao.rera','2024-06-27 16:56:08.000'),(15682,440008,'amlegalrera','2024-06-28 09:44:45.000',3317,'AdCNo00612024TR-AUTH00602024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-28 09:44:46.536','','2024-06-28 09:44:46.536','','Complaint File is OK. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non delivery of Project by Respondent and has sought primary relief of possession along with delay interest along with other reliefs. Accordingly, reference approval on file dated 10.04.2024, the present Complaint is entrusted to the Authority for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-06-28 09:44:45.000','amlegalrera','2024-06-28 09:44:45.000'),(15683,440058,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-28 10:22:49.000',3333,'AdCNo00782024','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-28 10:22:50.972','','2024-06-28 10:22:50.972','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 02.08.2024 as per directions.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-28 10:22:49.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-28 10:22:49.000'),(15684,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-28 10:23:58.000',3333,'AdCNo00782024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-06-28 10:23:59.847','','2024-06-28 10:23:59.847','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 02.08.2024 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-28 10:23:58.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-28 10:23:58.000'),(15685,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-06-28 10:49: