ranch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-07-01 10:13:22.000','amlegalrera','2024-07-01 10:13:22.000'),(15693,440058,'systemanalyst.rera','2024-07-01 10:59:48.000',3317,'AdCNo00612024TR-AUTH00602024','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-07-01 10:59:51.331','','2024-07-01 10:59:51.331','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 01.08.2024 at 10.00 A.M. as per directions.',2,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2024-07-01 10:59:48.000','systemanalyst.rera','2024-07-01 10:59:48.000'),(15694,440059,'systemanalyst.rera','2024-07-01 11:00:23.000',3317,'AdCNo00612024TR-AUTH00602024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-07-01 11:00:26.347','','2024-07-01 11:00:26.347','','Notice to Respondent to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 01.08.2024 at 10.00 A.M. and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice as per directions.',2,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2024-07-01 11:00:23.000','systemanalyst.rera','2024-07-01 11:00:23.000'),(15695,440055,'readerao.rera','2024-07-01 15:48:26.000',3348,'AdCNo00832024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-07-01 15:48:29.456','','2024-07-01 15:48:29.456','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Notice of the complaint be issued to respondents no.1 and 2 through E-mail and Speed Post for 05.08.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainants.  Intimation be also given to the complainants.  ',2,0,'readerao.rera','2024-07-01 15:48:26.000','readerao.rera','2024-07-01 15:48:26.000'),(15696,440004,'999','2024-07-01 16:48:59.000',3350,'AdCNo00842024','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with R