d to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-07-09 13:31:15.967','','2024-07-09 13:31:15.967','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a rera registered project namely \"GLD HOMES\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"GUNJAN LAND DEVELOPERS.\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non completion of the Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-07-09 13:31:16.000','amlegalrera','2024-07-09 13:31:16.000'),(15766,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-07-09 13:41:29.000',3366,'AdCNo00972024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-07-09 13:41:28.295','','2024-07-09 13:41:28.295','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Authorised Person/Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. ( iii) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for eac