dents Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-08-05 10:09:30.000','amlegalrera','2024-08-05 10:09:30.000'),(15860,440062,'amlegalrera','2024-08-05 10:57:24.000',3363,'AdCNo00962024','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-05 10:57:27.063','','2024-08-05 10:57:27.063','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-08-05 10:57:24.000','amlegalrera','2024-08-05 10:57:24.000'),(15861,440055,'readerao.rera','2024-08-05 16:15:16.000',3371,'AdCNo01012024UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-08-05 16:15:19.875','','2024-08-05 16:15:19.875','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Notice of the complaint be issued to respondents no.1 to 3 through E-mail and Speed Post for 09.09.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainants.  Intimation be also given to the complainants.  ',2,0,'readerao.rera','2024-08-05 16:15:16.000','readerao.rera','2024-08-05 16:15:16.000'),(15862,440055,'readerao.rera','2024-08-05 16:17:17.000',3368,'AdCNo01002024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-08-05 16:17:20.844','','2024-08-05 16:17:20.844','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Notice of the complaint be issued to respondents no.1 to 3 through E-mail and Speed Post for 09.09.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainants.  Intimation be also given to the complainants.  ',2,0,'readerao.rera','