55.000',3373,'AdCNo16762020URBFTR-AUTH00632024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-08-06 11:08:54.094','','2024-08-06 11:08:54.094','','Let fresh notice be issued to the complainant as well as to respondent no.4. Respondent no.4 be directed to submit its reply with an advance copy to the complainant on or before the next date of hearing.\r\n	To come up on 10.09.2024 at 10.00a.m. for filing of reply by respondent no.4.\r\n',2,0,'pamemberaps','2024-08-06 11:08:55.000','pamemberaps','2024-08-06 11:08:55.000'),(15868,440055,'pamemberaps','2024-08-06 11:42:19.000',3374,'AdCNo16572020URBFTR-AUTH00622024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-08-06 11:42:18.329','','2024-08-06 11:42:18.329','','Let fresh notice be issued to the complainant as well as to respondent no.4. Respondent no.4 be directed to submit its reply with an advance copy to the complainant on or before the next date of hearing.\r\n	To come up on 10.09.2024 at 10.00a.m. for filing of reply by respondent no.4.\r\n',2,0,'pamemberaps','2024-08-06 11:42:19.000','pamemberaps','2024-08-06 11:42:19.000'),(15869,440001,'999','2024-08-06 16:08:37.000',3379,'AdCNo01032024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-08-06 16:08:37.000','999','2024-08-06 16:08:37.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-08-06 16:08:37.000','sysadmin','2024-08-06 16:08:37.000'),(15870,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-08-08 13:16:43.000',3379,'AdCNo01032024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-08 13:16:44.063','','2024-08-08 13:16:44.063','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Authorised Person/Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.(iii) Complaint is not verified and signed by the Complainants. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-08-08 13:16:43.000','amlegalrera','2024-08-08 13:16:43.000'),(15871,440001,'999','2024-08-08 13:44:55.000',3376,'AdCNo01042024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-08-08 13:44:55.000','999','2024-08-08 13:44:55.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-08-08 13:44:55.000','sysadmin','2024-08-08 13:44:55.000'),(15873,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-13 10:09:27.000',3266,'AdCNo00232024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-13 10:09:26.948','','2024-08-13 10:09:26.948','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 12.08.2024 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and