 filed against the promoter namely \"WTC NOIDA DEVELOPMENT CO. PVT. LTD.\" Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged non delivery of possession of unit by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondent for delay, mental agony, harassment and losses. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-08-22 09:34:00.000','amlegalrera','2024-08-22 09:34:00.000'),(15891,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-08-22 09:40:56.000',3363,'AdCNo00962024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-22 09:40:56.659','','2024-08-22 09:40:56.659','','Hard copies not submitted. The complaint was asked to submit hard copies as per Regulation 4(3) and (4) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. Accordingly, reference approval on file dated 10.04.2024, the present Complaint is entrusted to the Authority for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-08-22 09:40:56.000','amlegalrera','2024-08-22 09:40:56.000'),(15892,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-22 10:03:24.000',3212,'AdCNo01182023UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-22 10:03:24.565','','2024-08-22 10:03:24.565','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 21.08.2024 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online rectified on or before 19.09.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 21.08.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-22 10:03:24.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-22 10:03:24.000'),(15893,440057,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-22 12:48:52.000',3341,'AdCNo00802024','','','Authority Desk','No Reply Recieved within 15 days','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-22 12:48:53.175','','2024-08-22 12:48:53.175','','The complaint was returned to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017 . No reply or explanation submitted by Complainant even after lapse of 15 days.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-22 12:48:52.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-22 12:48:52.000'),(15894,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-22 12:53:07.000',3341,'AdCNo00802024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-22 12:53:07.472','','2024-08-22 12:53:07.472','','The present complaint is dismissed due to non-appearance of the complainant /Authorized representative vide order dated 21.08.2024.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-22 12:53:07.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-22 12:53:07.000'),(15895,440001,'999','2024-08-22 13:18:21.000',3387,'AdCNo01062024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-08-22 13:18:21.000','999','2024-08-22 13:18:21.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-08-22 13:18:21.000','sysadmin','2024-08-22 13:18:21.000'),(15896,440055,'readerao.rera','2024-08-22 15:04:32.000',3379,'AdCNo01032024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-08-22 15:04:33.112','','2024-08-22 15:04:33.112','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused and complaint be registered. Notice of the complaint be issued to respo