 complaint be returned to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online rectified on or before 20.09.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 29.08.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-29 15:02:24.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-29 15:02:24.000'),(15949,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-29 15:04:20.000',3375,'AdCNo01022024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-29 15:04:21.082','','2024-08-29 15:04:21.082','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 29.08.2024 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online rectified on or before 20.09.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 29.08.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-29 15:04:20.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-08-29 15:04:20.000'),(15950,440001,'999','2024-08-29 19:35:21.000',3392,'AdCNo01102024UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-08-29 19:35:21.000','999','2024-08-29 19:35:21.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-08-29 19:35:21.000','sysadmin','2024-08-29 19:35:21.000'),(15951,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-08-30 11:07:31.000',3387,'AdCNo01062024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-30 11:07:32.129','','2024-08-30 11:07:32.129','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"GOLDEN PALMS\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"UBER BUILDCON PVT LTD\" and one other Respondent. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged illegal demand of holding charges by the Respondents and has sought compensation on various grounds from Respondent. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-08-30 11:07:31.000','amlegalrera','2024-08-30 11:07:31.000'),(15952,440001,'999','2024-08-30 11:40:03.000',3393,'AdCNo01112024','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-08-30 11:40:03.000','999','2024-08-30 11:40:03.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-08-30 11:40:03.000','sysadmin','2024-08-30 11:40:03.000'),(15953,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-08-30 15:01:46.000',3388,'AdCNo01082024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-30 15:01:47.611','','2024-08-30 15:01:47.611','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.(ii) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-08-30 15:01:46.000','amlegalrera','2024-08-30 15:01:46.000'),(15954,440062,'amlegalrera','2024-08-30 15:03:04.000',3391,'AdCNo01072024','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-30 15:03:04.674','','2024-08-30 15:03:04.674','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-08-30 15:03:04.000','amlegalrera','2024-08-30 15:03:04.000'),(15955,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-08-30 15:07:33.000',3389,'AdCNo01092024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-08-30 15:07:33.908','','2024-08-30 15:07:33.908','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter through its MD, as main respondent and should also implead its Authorised Person/Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-08-30 15:07:33.000','amlegalrera','2024-08-30 15:07:33.000'),(15956,440055,'executiveassistantao','2024-08-30 15:13:11.000',3387,'AdCNo01062024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-08-30 15:13:12.314','','2024-08-30 15:13:12.314','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondents no.1 and 2 through E-mail and Speed Post for 07.10.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'executiveassistantao','2024-08-30 15:13:11.000','executiveassistantao','2024-08-30 15:13:11.000'),(15957,440004,'999','2024-08-31 18:29:38.000',3210,'AdCNo01152023','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-08-31 18:29:38.000','999','2024-08-31 18:29:38.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',1,0,'sysadmin','2024-08-31 18:29:38.000','sysadmin','2024-08-31 18:29:38.000'),(15958,440007,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-02 11:31:11.000',3153,'AdCNo00592023','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-02 11:31:13.109','','2024-09-02 11:31:13.109','','The Ld. Bench vide its Order dated 29.08.2024 has directed that the online complaint be returned to the complainant for rectification of the online complaint in terms of the objections and to upload the rectified complaint online rectified on or before 09.09.2024 with the facilitation of Legal Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 29.08.2024.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-02 11:31:11.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-02 11:31:11.000'),(15959,440058,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-02 12:28:40.000',3387,'AdCNo01062024','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-02 12:28:42.343','',