-06 11:58:16.344','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"GALAXY HEIGHTS APARTMENT POCKET 2B\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"JANTA LAND PROMOTERS PVT LTD\" and three other Respondents ( Directors). Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainants alleged violation as regards non completion of Project by the Respondents and have sought compensation from Respondents Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-09-06 11:58:16.000','amlegalrera','2024-09-06 11:58:16.000'),(15996,440062,'amlegalrera','2024-09-06 12:13:20.000',3394,'AdCNo01122024','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-06 12:13:20.597','','2024-09-06 12:13:20.597','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-09-06 12:13:20.000','amlegalrera','2024-09-06 12:13:20.000'),(15997,440055,'readerao.rera','2024-09-06 15:29:39.000',3393,'AdCNo01112024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-09-06 15:29:39.531','','2024-09-06 15:29:39.531','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to respondent no.1 through E-mail and Speed Post for 15.10.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainants.  Intimation be also given to the complainants. ',2,0,'readerao.rera','2024-09-06 15:29:39.000','readerao.rera','2024-09-06 15:29:39.000'),(15998,440004,'999','2024-09-06 16:08:45.000',3389,'AdCNo01092024','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-09-06 16:08:45.000','999','2024-09-06 16:08:45.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-09-06 16:08:45.000','sysadmin','2024-09-06 16:08:45.000'),(15999,440058,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-09 11:28:41.000',3393,'AdCNo01112024','','','Authority Desk','Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-09 11:28:43.249','','2024-09-09 11:28:43.249','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 15.10.2024 as per directions.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-09 11:28:41.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-09 11:28:41.000'),(16000,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-09 11:29:35.000',3393,'AdCNo01112024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-09 11:29:37.211','','2024-09-09 11:29:37.211','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 15.10.2024 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-09 11:29:35.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-09 11:29:35.000'),(16001,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-09-09 12:34:23.000',3392,'AdCNo01102024UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-09 12:34:24.992','','2024-09-09 12:34:24.992','','The present Complaint relates to a unit purchased by the Complainant in an un-registered project namely \"GOLD CITY\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"AMD BUILDERS.\" and three other Respondents. Hard Copies of the Complaint along with Annexures received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint submitted. The Complainants alleged violation as regards non completion of Project by the Respondent and has sought compensation from Respondents Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind perusal, consideration and further orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-09-09 12:34:23.000','amlegalrera','2024-09-09 12:34:23.000'),(16002,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-09-09 14:16:48.000',3395,'AdCNo01132024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-09 14:16:49.914','','2024-09-09 14:16:49.914','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Authorised Person/Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s).(ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N.(iii) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-09-09 14:16:48.000','amlegalrera','2024-09-09 14:16:48.000'),(16003,440070,'OSlegal1.rera','2024-09-09 16:39:02.000',2691,'AdCNo14822019BFTR-AUTH00622022','','','Authority Desk','Re-open a complaint after closure or dispose of','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-09 16:39:03.492','','2024-09-09 16:39:03.492','','Vide Order dated 01.08.2024 passed in Appeal No. 206 of 2022 by the Ld. Real Estate Appellate Tribunal, Punjab, complaint is remanded back to this Authority.',2,0,'OSlegal1.rera','2024-09-09 16:39:02.000','OSlegal1.rera','2024-09-09 16:39:02.000'),(16004,440047,'OSlegal1.rera','2024-09-09 16:40:45.000',2691,'AdCNo14822019BFTR-AUTH00622022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member BKS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-09 16:40:46.539','','2024-09-09 16:40:46.539','','Vide Authority order/reference approval dated 06.08.2024, the present complaint is entrusted to this bench of the Authority Please.',2,0,'OSlegal1.rera','2024-09-09 16:40:45.000','OSlegal1.rera','2024-09-09 16:40:45.000'),(16005,440055,'readerao.rera','2024-09-10 14:37:54.000',3392,'AdCNo01102024UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-09-10 14:37:53.023','','2024-09-10 14:37:53.023','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to respondents no.1 to 4 through E-mail and Speed Post for 15.10.2024 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'readerao.rera','2024-09-10 14:37:54.000','readerao.rera','2024-09-10 14:37:54.000'),(16006,440004,'999','2024-09-10 18:56:07.000',3388,'AdCNo01082024','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-09-10 18:56:07.000','999','2024-09-10 18:56:07.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-09-10 18:56:07.000','sysadmin','2024-09-10 18:56:07.000'),(16007,440047,'legaladvrera','2024-09-11 10:23:16.000',2659,'AdCNo00232021BFTR-AUTH01412021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member BKS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','