.rera','2024-09-19 12:52:04.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-19 12:52:04.000'),(16048,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-09-19 14:59:01.000',3399,'AdCNo01162024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-19 14:59:00.761','','2024-09-19 14:59:00.762','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Authorised Person/Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Name of Complainant is different as mentioned in Documents and there is only One Complainant.(iv) Hard copies not submitted So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-09-19 14:59:01.000','amlegalrera','2024-09-19 14:59:01.000'),(16049,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-19 15:18:49.000',3307,'AdCNo00742024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-19 15:18:49.015','','2024-09-19 15:18:49.015','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 28.10.2024 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-19 15:18:49.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-19 15:18:49.000'),(16050,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-19 15:19:07.000',3363,'AdCNo00962024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-19 15:19:07.140','','2024-09-19 15:19:07.140','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 25.10.2024 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-19 15:19:07.000','OSlegal2.rera','2024-09-19 15:19:07.000'),(16051,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-09-19 16:23:19.000',3398,'AdCNo01152024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-19 16:23:18.952','','2024-09-19 16:23:18.952','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Authorised Person/Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So, the online Complaint is returned. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. You can consult with the Legal Branch of the Authority for clarification, if any\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-09-19 16:23:19.000','amlegalrera','2024-09-19 16:23:19.000'),(16052,440004,'999','2024-09-19 22:40:58.000',3364,'AdCNo00992024','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-09-19 22:40:58.000','999','2024-09-19 22:40:58.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-09-19 22:40:58.000','sysadmin','2024-09-19 22:40:58.000'),(16053,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-09-20 09:23:19.000',3391,'AdCNo01072024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-20 09:23:19.171','','2024-09-20 09:23:19.171','','The present Complaint relates to a unit booked by the Complainant in a RERA registered project namely \"SUSHMA CHANDIGARH GRANDE\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"SUSHMA BUILDTECH LTD\" . Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Complainant alleged delay in possession  by the Respondents and has sought compensation on various grounds from Respondent. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-09-20 09:23:19.000','amlegalrera','2024-09-20 09:23:19.000'),(16054,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-09-20 09:28:26.000',3394,'AdCNo01122024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-09-20 09:28:26.062','','2024-09-20 09:28:26.062','','The present Complaint relates to a unit booked by the Complainants in a RERA registered project namely \"SUSHMA GRANDE NXT\" and the same has been filed against the promoter namely \"SBL BUILDERS (P) LTD\" and one other Respondent. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. Documents as uploaded verified with Hard copy of complaint. The Compl