ice with an advance copy to the complainants. 		 	            \r\n 		 		To come up on 02.01.2025 at 10.00a.m. for appearance and filing of reply.\r\n	 		 	Notice to complainant be also issued for this date of hearing. \r\n  \r\n(Binod Kumar Singh)   \r\nMember, Rera Punjab\r\n',2,0,'pamember1','2024-11-19 14:55:07.000','pamember1','2024-11-19 14:55:07.000'),(16226,440055,'pamember1','2024-11-19 15:03:36.000',3414,'AdCNo01242024TR-AUTH01032024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2024-11-19 15:03:36.875','','2024-11-19 15:03:36.875','','Present  	None 			\r\n 				\r\n 			 	 Notice be issued to the respondent to appear in person or through authorized representative and to file reply within fifteen days of the receipt of this notice with an advance copy to the complainants. 		 	            \r\n 		 		To come up on 02.01.2025 at 10.00a.m. for appearance and filing of reply.\r\n	 		 	Notice to complainant be also issued for this date of hearing. \r\n  \r\n(Binod Kumar Singh)   \r\nMember, Rera Punjab\r\n',2,0,'pamember1','2024-11-19 15:03:36.000','pamember1','2024-11-19 15:03:36.000'),(16227,440004,'999','2024-11-19 16:02:58.000',3411,'AdCNo01282024','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-11-19 16:02:58.000','999','2024-11-19 16:02:58.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-11-19 16:02:58.000','sysadmin','2024-11-19 16:02:58.000'),(16228,440004,'999','2024-11-19 16:04:27.000',1882,'AdCNo01232024','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-11-19 16:04:27.000','999','2024-11-19 16:04:27.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-11-19 16:04:27.000','sysadmin','2024-11-19 16:04:27.000'),(16229,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-11-20 09:04:13.000',3427,'AdCNo01342024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-11-20 09:04:14.014','','2024-11-20 09:04:14.014','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Authorised Person/Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii)  Hard copies not submitted So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-11-20 09:04:13.000','amlegalrera','2024-11-20 09:04:13.000'),(16230,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-11-20 09:08:51.000',3428,'AdCNo01352024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-11-20 09:08:51.530','','2024-11-20 09:08:51.530','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) Co-allottee needs to be impleaded. (ii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies o