pondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-11-28 15:32:28.981','','2024-11-28 15:32:28.981','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 20.01.2025 at 2.30 P.M. and to file reply on or before 23.12.2024 with the copy of the same to the complainant.',2,0,'exclegalrera','2024-11-28 15:32:27.000','exclegalrera','2024-11-28 15:32:27.000'),(16257,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-11-29 10:12:07.000',3433,'AdCNo01382024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-11-29 10:12:09.233','','2024-11-29 10:12:09.233','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Authorised Person/Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s).(ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Name of Co-allottee should be as per Agreement. (iv)  Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-11-29 10:12:07.000','amlegalrera','2024-11-29 10:12:07.000'),(16258,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-11-29 12:25:14.000',3434,'AdCNo01392024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-11-29 12:25:15.819','','2024-11-29 12:25:15.819','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You are required to implead Second Respondent as additional Respondent(s).(ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii)  Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-11-29 12:25:14.000','amlegalrera','2024-11-29 12:25:14.000'),(16259,440004,'999','2024-12-02 15:59:26.000',3434,'AdCNo01392024','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2024-12-02 15:59:26.000','999','2024-12-02 15:59:26.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-12-02 15:59:26.000','sysadmin','2024-12-02 15:59:26.000'),(16260,440056,'amlegalrera','2024-12-03 12:21:11.000',3411,'AdCNo01282024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-12-03 12:21:12.004','','2024-12-03 12:21:12.004','','Complaint File is OK. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non completion of project by Respondent and has sought primary relief of Compensation along with other reliefs. Accordingly, pres