ORM N. (ii) Hard copies of Complaint not submitted. So the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. \r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-12-24 09:22:49.000','amlegalrera','2024-12-24 09:22:49.000'),(16298,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-12-24 09:24:00.000',3439,'AdCNo01442024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-12-24 09:24:00.941','','2024-12-24 09:24:00.941','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Hard copies of Complaint not submitted. So the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and resubmit the same. Also submit required set hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office. \r\n',2,0,'amlegalrera','2024-12-24 09:24:00.000','amlegalrera','2024-12-24 09:24:00.000'),(16299,440007,'amlegalrera','2024-12-24 09:32:50.000',3438,'AdCNo01422024','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-12-24 09:32:50.905','','2024-12-24 09:32:50.905','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) Co-allottee needs to be added as additional Complainant. (ii) Hard copies of Complaint not submitted. So the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and 