ed. Complainant has not complied with the objections raised by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench. Let notice be issued to the complainant for 18.03.2025 for preliminary hearing to show cause as to why the complaint be not dismissed for non-compliance. ',2,0,'readerao.rera','2025-01-22 10:27:14.000','readerao.rera','2025-01-22 10:27:14.000'),(16373,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-01-22 15:44:49.000',3448,'AdCNo00062025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-01-22 15:44:49.860','','2025-01-22 15:44:49.860','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i)You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and should also implead its Managing Director/name of Person who is actively involved in affairs of the Company/Firm as additional Respondent(s). (ii) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Vakalatnama is not uploaded. (iv) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted . Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint ( one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-01-22 15:44:49.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-01-22 15:44:49.000'),(16374,440004,'999','2025-01-23 11:15:09.000',