9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-04-23 10:33:10.521','','2025-04-23 10:33:10.521','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Name of Co-allottee needs to be added (iii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-04-23 10:33:09.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-04-23 10:33:09.000'),(16591,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-04-23 10:35:22.000',3504,'AdCNo00442025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-04-23 10:35:23.439','','2025-04-23 10:35:23.439','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Name of Co-allottee needs to be added (iii) Hard copies of the Complaint not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-04-23 10:35:22.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-04-23 10:35:22.000'),(16592,440055,'executiveassistantao','2025-04-23 16:44:35.000',3492,'AdCNo00402025','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2025-04-23 16:44:36.727','','2025-04-23 16:44:36.727','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondents no.1 and 2 through E-mail and Speed Post for 05.06.2025 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainants.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'executiveassistantao','2025-04-23 16:44:35.000','executiveassistantao','2025-04-23 16:44:35.000'),(16593,440055,'executiveassistantao','2025-04-23 16:46:03.000',3467,'AdCNo00252025','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2025-04-23 16:46:03.995','','2025-04-23 16:46:03.995','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to the respondents no.1 to 3 through E-mail and Speed Post for 05.06.2025 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainants.  Intimation be also given to the complainant. ',2,0,'executiveassistantao','2025-04-23 16:46:03.000','executiveassistantao','2025-04-23 16:46:03.000'),(16594,440001,'999','2025-04-23 17:53:10.000',3507,'AdCNo00452025UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2025-04-23 17:53:10.000','999','2025-04-23 17:53:10.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',