Sine-Die vide order dated 15.03.2024.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-05-13 13:12:32.000','OSlegal2.rera','2025-05-13 13:12:32.000'),(16711,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-13 14:57:04.000',3518,'AdCNo00542025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-05-13 14:57:04.599','','2025-05-13 14:57:04.599','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(ii)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii) Co-allottee needs to be added as additional Complainant. (iv) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-13 14:57:04.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-13 14:57:04.000'),(16712,440056,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-13 15:00:00.000',3476,'AdCNo00312025','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-05-13 15:00:00.930','','2025-05-13 15:00:00.930','','Hard copies not submitted. The complaint was required to submit hard copies as per Regulation 4(3) and (4) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017. Accordingly, the present Complaint is entrusted to this Bench for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-13 15:00:00.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-13 15:00:00.000'),(16713,440055,'executiveassistantao','2025-05-14 12:53:33.000',3480,'AdCNo00422025','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2025-05-14 12:53:34.641','','2025-05-14 12:53:34.641','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused. Complainant has not complied with the objection raised by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench. Let notice be issued to the complainant for 05.06.2025 for preliminary hearing to show cause as to why the complaint be not dismissed for non-compliance. ',2,0,'executiveassistantao','2025-05-14 12:53:33.000','executiveassistantao','2025-05-14 12:53:33.000'),(16714,440055,'executiveassistantao','2025-05-14 12:55:13.000',3507,'AdCNo00452025UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2025-05-14 12:55:14.240','','2025-05-14 12:55:14.240','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch. Report of office perused. Complainant has not complied with the objection raised by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench. Let notice be issued to the complainant for 05.06.2025 for preliminary hearing to show cause as to why the complaint be not dismissed for non-compliance. ',2,0,'executiveassistantao','2025-05-14 12:55:13.000','executiveassistantao','2025-05-14 12:55:13.000'),(16715,440055,'executiveassistantao','2025-05-14 12:57:34.000',3475,'AdCNo00372025','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2025-05-14 12:57:35.247','','2025-0