6775,440056,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 09:37:50.000',3505,'AdCNo00502025','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-05-22 09:37:51.497','','2025-05-22 09:37:51.497','','The complaint was unlocked and sent to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. No Reply or Explanation submitted by Complainant Even After Lapse Of 15 Days. Complaint re called for forwarding before the bench under Regulation 6(5) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017 for further proceedings. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 09:37:50.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 09:37:50.000'),(16776,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 10:56:21.000',3519,'AdCNo00572025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-05-22 10:56:22.761','','2025-05-22 10:56:22.761','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 10:56:21.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 10:56:21.000'),(16777,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 10:59:14.000',3079,'AdCNo00562025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-05-22 10:59:15.968','','2025-05-22 10:59:15.968','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Vakalatnama not uploaded. (iii) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 10:59:14.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 10:59:14.000'),(16778,440062,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 11:02:21.000',3509,'AdCNo00552025','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-05-22 11:02:23.254','','2025-05-22 11:02:23.254','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 11:02:21.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-05-22 11:02:21.000'),(16779,440004,'999','2025-05-22 11:55:45.000',3518,'AdCNo00542025','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2025-05-22 11:55:45.000','999