 Branch. Hard copy of the same be also submitted for the said date. Accordingly, the complaint is returned online to the complainant for the compliance of the Order dated 27.06.2025.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-06-30 15:41:08.000','OSlegal2.rera','2025-06-30 15:41:08.000'),(16913,440004,'999','2025-06-30 19:18:20.000',3538,'AdCNo00652025','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2025-06-30 19:18:20.000','999','2025-06-30 19:18:20.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-06-30 19:18:20.000','sysadmin','2025-06-30 19:18:20.000'),(16914,440001,'999','2025-07-01 16:01:31.000',3543,'AdCNo00662025','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2025-07-01 16:01:31.000','999','2025-07-01 16:01:31.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-07-01 16:01:31.000','sysadmin','2025-07-01 16:01:31.000'),(16915,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-07-02 09:53:17.000',3543,'AdCNo00662025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-07-02 09:53:18.549','','2025-07-02 09:53:18.549','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Co-allottee needs to be added as additional Complainant. (iii) Hard copies 