ve on 17.09.2025 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-08-13 12:20:32.000','OSlegal2.rera','2025-08-13 12:20:32.000'),(17035,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-08-13 13:24:46.000',3551,'AdCNo00812025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-08-13 13:24:47.815','','2025-08-13 13:24:47.815','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(ii) Detailed Facts are not uploaded. (iii) Name of Complainant should be as per Agreement. (iv) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-08-13 13:24:46.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-08-13 13:24:46.000'),(17036,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-08-13 16:32:22.000',3475,'AdCNo00372025','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-08-13 16:32:23.697','','2025-08-13 16:32:23.697','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 19.09.2025 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-08-13 16:32:22.000','OSlegal2.rera','2025-08-13 16:32:22.000'),(17037,440001,'999','2025-08-13 19:12:19.000',3552,'AdCNo00822025','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Rol