01082025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-09-16 11:04:45.877','','2025-09-16 11:04:45.877','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-16 11:04:45.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-16 11:04:45.000'),(17307,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-16 13:10:22.000',3592,'AdCNo01062025UR','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-09-16 13:10:23.104','','2025-09-16 13:10:23.104','','Complaint is unlocked as per your Email request dated 16.09.2025\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-16 13:10:22.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-16 13:10:22.000'),(17308,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-09-16 14:10:08.000',3214,'AdCNo00022024UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-09-16 14:10:08.814','','2025-09-16 14:10:08.814','','The present case is partly allowed and disposed of vide order dated 26.08.2025.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-09-16 14:10:08.000','OSlegal2.rera','2025-09-16 14:10:08.000'),(17309,440055,'pamember1','2025-09-16 14:21:02.000',3537,'AdCNo00672025TR-AUTH00082025','','','Authori