2025','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2025-09-17 08:21:05.000','999','2025-09-17 08:21:05.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-09-17 08:21:05.000','sysadmin','2025-09-17 08:21:05.000'),(17314,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-17 13:23:00.000',3606,'AdCNo01132025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-09-17 13:23:01.477','','2025-09-17 13:23:01.477','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(ii)You have mentioned Complaint against Allottee but it should be against Promoter. (iii) Co-allottee needs to be added as additional Complainant. (iv) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-17 13:23:00.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-17 13:23:00.000'),(17315,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-17 13:26:08.000',3610,'AdCNo01162025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-09-17 13:26:09.736','','2025-09-17 13:26:09.736','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Additional Respondent has been added twice. (iii) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-17 13:26:08.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-09-17 13:26:08.000'),(17316,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-09-17 16:08:36.000',3559,'AdCNo00772025','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-09-17 16:08:37.294','','2025-09-17 16:08:37.294','','The present case is dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 15.09.2025.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-09-17 16:08:36.000','OSlegal2.rera','2025-09-17 16:08:36.000'),(17317,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-09-17 16:25:53.000',3422,'AdCNo01312024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-09-17 16:25:53.848','','2025-09-17 16:25:53.848','','The present complaint is dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 15.09.2025.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-09-17 16:25:53.000','OSlegal2.rera','2025-09-17 16:25:53.000'),(17318,440004,'999','2025-09-17 20:01:59.000',3610,'AdCNo01162025','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2025-09-17 20:01:59.000','999','2025-09-17 20:01:59.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-09-17 20:01:59.000','sysadmin','2025-09-17 20:01:59.000'),(17319,440004,'999','2025-09-17 21:13:32.0