00','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-08 10:39:20.000'),(17435,440062,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-08 10:41:14.000',3620,'AdCNo01272025','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-08 10:41:15.373','','2025-10-08 10:41:15.373','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-08 10:41:14.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-08 10:41:14.000'),(17436,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-08 10:45:24.000',3598,'AdCNo01262025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-08 10:45:25.660','','2025-10-08 10:45:25.660','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Co-allottee needs to be added as additional Complainant. (iii) Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-08 10:45:24.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-08 10:45:24.000'),(17437,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-08 10:47:20.000',3618,'AdCNo01252025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-08 10:47:21.194','','2025-10-08 10:47:21.194','','Afte