10-14 10:34:45.581','','2025-10-14 10:34:45.581','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-14 10:34:45.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-14 10:34:45.000'),(17471,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-14 11:04:56.000',3622,'AdCNo01302025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-14 11:04:56.468','','2025-10-14 11:04:56.468','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(ii)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii)  Hard copies not submitted. (iv) Co-allottee needs to be added as additional Complainant. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-14 11:04:56.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-14 11:04:56.000'),(17472,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2025-10-14 15:03:20.000',3289,'AdCNo00412024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-14 15:03:20.534','','20