 10:26:43.000',3628,'AdCNo01332025','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2025-10-23 10:26:43.000','999','2025-10-23 10:26:43.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-10-23 10:26:43.000','sysadmin','2025-10-23 10:26:43.000'),(17515,440001,'999','2025-10-23 20:09:28.000',3627,'AdCNo01342025','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2025-10-23 20:09:28.000','999','2025-10-23 20:09:28.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-10-23 20:09:28.000','sysadmin','2025-10-23 20:09:28.000'),(17516,440001,'999','2025-10-24 10:22:36.000',3630,'AdCNo01352025','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2025-10-24 10:22:36.000','999','2025-10-24 10:22:36.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-10-24 10:22:36.000','sysadmin','2025-10-24 10:22:36.000'),(17517,440056,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-27 10:04:46.000',3620,'AdCNo01272025','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-27 10:04:49.527','','2025-10-27 10:04:49.527','','Complaint File is OK. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non compliance of Authority order, by Respondent and has sought primary relief of Compensation along with other reliefs. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-27 10:04:46.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-27 10:04:46.000'),(17518,440056,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-27 10:07:52.000',3625,'AdCNo01312025','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-27 10:07:56.048','','2025-10-27 10:07:56.048','','Complaint File is OK. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non completion of project by Respondent and has sought primary relief of Compensation along with other reliefs. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-27 10:07:52.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-27 10:07:52.000'),(17519,440001,'999','2025-10-27 14:44:39.000',3619,'AdCNo01362025','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2025-10-27 14:44:39.000','999','2025-10-27 14:44:39.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-10-27 14:44:39.000','sysadmin','2025-10-27 14:44:39.000'),(17520,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:35:07.000',3626,'AdCNo01322025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-28 09:35:07.709','','2025-10-28 09:35:07.709','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) GPA not uploaded. ii)  Hard copies not submitted. . So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:35:07.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:35:07.000'),(17521,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:49:01.000',3628,'AdCNo01332025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-28 09:49:01.967','','2025-10-28 09:49:01.967','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(ii)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii)  Hard copies not submitted.  So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:49:01.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:49:01.000'),(17522,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:51:40.000',3627,'AdCNo01342025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-28 09:51:40.979','','2025-10-28 09:51:40.979','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii)  Hard copies not submitted.  So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:51:40.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:51:40.000'),(17523,440062,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:53:10.000',3630,'AdCNo01352025','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-28 09:53:11.049','','2025-10-28 09:53:11.049','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:53:10.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:53:10.000'),(17524,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:55:00.000',3619,'AdCNo01362025','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-28 09:55:00.090','','2025-10-28 09:55:00.090','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(ii)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii)  Hard copies not submitted.. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:55:00.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:55:00.000'),(17525,440057,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:56:23.000',3598,'AdCNo01262025','','','Authority Desk','No Reply Recieved within 15 days','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-28 09:56:24.042','','2025-10-28 09:56:24.042','','The complaint was unlocked and sent to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017. No reply or explanation submitted by Complainant even after lapse of 15 days.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:56:23.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:56:23.000'),(17526,440057,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:56:43.000',3616,'AdCNo01232025','','','Authority Desk','No Reply Recieved within 15 days','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-28 09:56:43.252','','2025-10-28 09:56:43.252','','The complaint was unlocked and sent to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017. No reply or explanation submitted by Complainant even after lapse of 15 days.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:56:43.000','DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:56:43.000'),(17527,440056,'DyDirectorLegal','2025-10-28 09:57:06.000',3616,'AdCNo01232025','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2025-10-28 09:57:06.878','','2025-10-28 09:57:06.878','','The complaint was unlocked and sent to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. No Reply or Explanation submitted by Complainant Even After Lapse Of 15 Days. Comp