e with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) Facts column should contain details of payment made, date of possession etc and supporting documents like allotment letter, Buyers agreement, payment receipts etc should be uploaded as annexures. (iii)  Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-16 10:58:34.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-16 10:58:34.000'),(17812,440062,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-16 11:00:01.000',3657,'AdCNo01512025','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-01-16 11:00:03.590','','2026-01-16 11:00:03.590','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of rectified complaint  duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-16 11:00:01.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-16 11:00:01.000'),(17813,440061,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-01-16 11:38:02.000',3659,'AdCNo01522025','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-01-16 11:38:05.238','','2026-01-16 11:38:05.238','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative for preliminary hearing on 09.02.2026 regarding the maintainability of the present case. ',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-01-16 11:38:02.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-01-16 11:38:02.000'),(17814,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-01-16 11:50:10.000',3632,'AdCNo01372025','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-01-16 11:50:13.164','','2026-01-16 11:50:13.164','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 27.01.2026 and to file reply within 15 days 