nt Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2026-01-26 23:54:51.000','sysadmin','2026-01-26 23:54:51.000'),(17828,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-27 10:36:26.000',3675,'AdCNo00052026','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-01-27 10:36:26.795','','2026-01-27 10:36:26.795','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(ii)Hard copies not submitted. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-27 10:36:26.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-27 10:36:26.000'),(17829,440057,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-27 10:38:08.000',3629,'AdCNo01552025','','','Authority Desk','No Reply Recieved within 15 days','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-01-27 10:38:08.898','','2026-01-27 10:38:08.898','','The complaint was unlocked and sent to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017. No reply or explanation submitted by Complainant even after lapse of 15 days.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-27 10:38:08.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-01-27 10:38:08.000'),(17830,440055,'executiveassistantao','2026-01-27 12:56:58.000',3657,'AdCNo01512025','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2026-01-27 12:56:58.299','','2026-01-27 12:56:58.299','','This file has been taken up today as