','2026-02-17 12:59:32.000'),(17971,440061,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 15:36:59.000',3680,'AdCNo00172026','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-02-17 15:37:00.052','','2026-02-17 15:37:00.052','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 11.03.2026 for preliminary hearing and for furnishing the signed hard copy of complaint and documents on or before the said date. ',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 15:36:59.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 15:36:59.000'),(17972,440061,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 15:55:51.000',3675,'AdCNo00052026','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-02-17 15:55:51.804','','2026-02-17 15:55:51.804','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 09.03.2026 for preliminary hearing to show cause as to why the complaint be not dismissed for non-compliance. ',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 15:55:51.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 15:55:51.000'),(17973,440061,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 15:56:58.000',3677,'AdCNo00162026','','','Authority Desk','Preliminary Hearing Date Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-02-17 15:56:58.772','','2026-02-17 15:56:58.772','','Notice to Complainant to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 09.03.2026 for preliminary hearing to show cause as to why the complaint be not dismissed for non-compliance. ',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 15:56:58.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 15:56:58.000'),(17974,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 16:42:45.000',3633,'AdCNo01382025','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-02-17 16:42:46.113','','2026-02-17 16:42:46.113','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 25.02.2026 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 16:42:45.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-02-17 16:42:45.000'),(17975,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-02-18 11:01:43.000',3687,'AdCNo00212026','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-02-18 11:01:44.216','','2026-02-18 11:01:44.216','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii) In case unit is still in husband name, Complainant in present case would be the husband and represented by his Legal heirs.(iii)  Hard copies not submitted.  So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-02-18 11:01:43.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-02-18 11:01:43.000'),(17976,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-02-18 11:09:56.000',3691,'AdCNo00222026','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-02-18 11:09:56.927','','2026-02-18 11:09:56.927','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) You have filed complaint against Promoter of a Registered Project but has not impleaded the Promoter recorded against RERA Registration number of the Project. You are required to implead the registered Promoter as main respondent and may implead another person as additional Respondent.(ii)As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (iii)  Hard copies not submitted. (iv) Co-allottee needs to be added as additional Complainant. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-02-18 11:09:56.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-02-18 11:09:56.000'),(17977,440004,'999','2026-02-18 17:03:56.000',3685,'AdCNo00202026','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2026-02-18 17:03:56.000','999','2026-02-18 17:03:56.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2026-02-18 17:03:56.000','sysadmin','2026-02-18 17:03:56.000'),(17978,440004,'999','2026-02-20 14:37:14.000',3691,'AdCNo00222026','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2026-02-20 14:37:14.000','999','2026-02-20 14:37:14.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2026-02-20 14:37:14.000','sysadmin','2026-02-20 14:37:14.000'),(17979,440063,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-02-20 15:06:58.000',3691,'AdCNo00222026','','','Authority Desk','Case Transfer between Bench/ FormM and FormN','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-02-20 15:07:01.228','','2