ice.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 09:52:22.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 09:52:22.000'),(18016,440062,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 09:57:45.000',3693,'AdCNo00232026','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-03-02 09:57:49.669','','2026-03-02 09:57:49.669','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 09:57:45.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 09:57:45.000'),(18017,440062,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 09:58:21.000',3694,'AdCNo00242026','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-03-02 09:58:26.412','','2026-03-02 09:58:26.412','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 09:58:21.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 09:58:21.000'),(18018,440062,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 10:04:55.000',3696,'AdCNo00262026','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-03-02 10:05:00.019','','2026-03-02 10:05:00.019','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 10:04:55.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-03-02 10:04:55.000'),(18019,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-03-02 12:41:57.000',3253,'AdCNo00152024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-03-02 12:42:01.960','','2026-03-02 12:42:01.960','','The present complaint is dismissed and disposed off vide order dated 26.02.2026.',2,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-03-02 12:41:57.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-03-02 12:41:57.000'),(18020,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-03-02 12:41:57.000',