d related matters) Regulations, 2017. No reply or explanation submitted by Complainant even after lapse of 15 days.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-01 10:54:55.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-01 10:54:55.000'),(18138,440056,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-01 10:55:11.000',3697,'AdCNo00282026','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-04-01 10:55:12.037','','2026-04-01 10:55:12.037','','The complaint was unlocked and sent to complainant for removal of defects under Regulation 6(3) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters ) Regulations, 2017. No Reply or Explanation submitted by Complainant Even After Lapse Of 15 Days. Complaint re called for forwarding before the bench under Regulation 6(5) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017 for further proceedings. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-01 10:55:11.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-01 10:55:11.000'),(18139,440056,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-01 10:55:58.000',3698,'AdCNo00272026UR','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-04-01 10:55:59.584','','2026-04-01 10:55:59.584','','Hard copies not submitted. The complaint was required to submit hard copies as per Regulation 4(3) and (4) of Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for handling complaints and related matters) Regulations, 2017. Accordingly, the present Complaint is entrusted to this Bench for kind consideration and further Orders please\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-01 10:55:58.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-01 10:55:58.000'),(18140,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-04-01 10:58:08.000',3332,'AdCNo00772024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','