aint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-21 13:43:21.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-21 13:43:21.000'),(18213,440004,'999','2026-04-22 10:52:30.000',3722,'AdCNo00482026','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2026-04-22 10:52:30.000','999','2026-04-22 10:52:30.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',1,0,'sysadmin','2026-04-22 10:52:30.000','sysadmin','2026-04-22 10:52:30.000'),(18214,440001,'999','2026-04-23 18:59:32.000',3724,'AdCNo00492026UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2026-04-23 18:59:32.000','999','2026-04-23 18:59:32.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2026-04-23 18:59:32.000','sysadmin','2026-04-23 18:59:32.000'),(18215,440001,'999','2026-04-25 14:48:03.000',3725,'AdCNo00502026','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2026-04-25 14:48:03.000','999','2026-04-25 14:48:03.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',2,0,'sysadmin','2026-04-25 14:48:03.000','sysadmin','2026-04-25 14:48:03.000'),(18216,440056,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-04-27 10:42:58.000',3669,'AdCNo00452026','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-04-27 10:43:03.199','','2026-04-27 10:43:03.199','','Complaint File is OK. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non completion of project by R