ce sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 09:11:05.449','','2026-05-11 09:11:05.449','','the present complaint stands dismissed as withdrawn, being mutually settled, vide order dated 04-05-2026',1,0,'systemanalyst.rera','2026-05-11 09:11:02.000','systemanalyst.rera','2026-05-11 09:11:02.000'),(18289,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 09:41:46.000',3734,'AdCNo00572026','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 09:41:49.511','','2026-05-11 09:41:49.511','','Complaint is unlocked as per your Email request dated 11.05.2026\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 09:41:46.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 09:41:46.000'),(18290,440062,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 09:57:45.000',3731,'AdCNo00552026UR','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 09:57:48.609','','2026-05-11 09:57:48.609','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',1,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 09:57:45.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 09:57:45.000'),(18291,440062,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 09:59:34.000',3728,'AdCNo00532026','','','Authority Desk','Hard copy of complaint required','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 09:59:37.890','','2026-05-11 09:59:37.890','','Complaint is requested to submit the hard copies of complaint along with annexures duly signed at the earliest for taking further action.\r\n',2,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 09:59:34.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 09:59:34.000'),(18292,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 10:03:10.000',3732,'AdCNo00562026','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 10:03:13.663','','2026-05-11 10:03:13.663','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) Facts should be mentioned in facts Column and relevant documents should be annexed as Annexures(ii)Relief sought should be more specific (iii)  Hard copies not submitted. . So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',1,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 10:03:10.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 10:03:10.000'),(18293,440007,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 10:07:26.000',3716,'AdCNo00582026','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 10:07:30.032','','2026-05-11 10:07:30.032','','After scrutiny of your complaint, following observations emerge. (i) As per observations in Civil Appeal No(s) 6745-6749 of 2021 in \'Ms Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd vs State of UP and others\' decided by Hon\'ble Supreme Court vide order dated 11.11.2021, complaints under Section 31 with any prayer other than Compensation and interest on Compensation, now shall lie with the Authority in FORM M and Complaint for Compensation and interest thereon has to be filed separately in FORM N. (ii)  Hard copies not submitted. (iii) Co-allottee needs to be added as additional Complainant. So, the online Complaint is unlocked. The above defects may be removed and Complaint be resubmitted. Also submit required sets of hard copies of rectified Complaint (one for Bench plus one for each respondent) in the Office.\r\n',1,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 10:07:26.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-11 10:07:26.000'),(18294,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 10:52:37.000',3247,'AdCNo00102024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 10:52:41.061','','2026-05-11 10:52:41.061','','The present complaint is dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 08.05.2026.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 10:52:37.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 10:52:37.000'),(18295,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 10:53:57.000',3189,'AdCNo00932023','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 10:54:00.574','','2026-05-11 10:54:00.574','','The present complaint is dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 08.05.2026.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 10:53:57.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 10:53:57.000'),(18296,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 11:11:23.000',3441,'AdCNo01472024','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 11:11:27.124','','2026-05-11 11:11:27.124','','The present complaint stands dismissed and disposed off vide order dated 05.05.2026.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 11:11:23.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 11:11:23.000'),(18297,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 11:23:51.000',3507,'AdCNo00452025UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 11:23:54.482','','2026-05-11 11:23:54.482','','The present complaint stands dismissed and disposed off vide order dated 04.05.2026.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 11:23:51.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 11:23:51.000'),(18298,440055,'executiveassistantao','2026-05-11 11:57:55.000',3729,'AdCNo00542026','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2026-05-11 11:57:58.360','','2026-05-11 11:57:58.360','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused and complaint be registered.  Notice of the complaint be issued to respondent(s) through E-mail and Speed Post for 16.06.2026 with the direction to file reply within fifteen days of service of notice with advance copy to the complainant(s).  Intimation be also given to the complainant(s). ',1,0,'executiveassistantao','2026-05-11 11:57:55.000','executiveassistantao','2026-05-11 11:57:55.000'),(18299,440055,'executiveassistantao','2026-05-11 11:59:36.000',3725,'AdCNo00502026','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2026-05-11 11:59:40.204','','2026-05-11 11:59:40.204','','Complaint has been put up today by Legal Branch.  Report of office perused. Complainant has not complied with the objections raised by the Legal Branch within specified period and as such this complaint is forwarded to this Bench.  Let notice be issued to the complainant for Preliminary Hearing 05.06.2026 to show cause as to why the complaint be not dismissed for non-compliance. ',1,0,'executiveassistantao','2026-05-11 11:59:36.000','executiveassistantao','2026-05-11 11:59:36.000'),(18300,440054,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 12:16:41.000',3704,'AdCNo00322026','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-11 12:16:45.165','','2026-05-11 12:16:45.165','','The present complaint is dismissed as withdrawn being fully satisfied  vide order dated 04.05.2026.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 12:16:41.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-11 12:16:41.000'),(18301,440001,'999','2026-05-11 12:45:28.000',3735,'AdCNo00592026UR','Complaint FormN Submission(New Application)','Form-N submitted by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Complaint Form-N Submitted','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2026-05-11 12:45:28.000','999','2026-05-11 12:45:28.000','In Process','Complaint Form-N Submitted',1,0,'sysadmin','2026-05-11 12:45:28.000','sysadmin','2026-05-11 12:45:28.000'),(18302,440004,'999','2026-05-11 23:18:07.000',3734,'AdCNo00572026','Application Re-Submission(Modified Application)','Form-N submiited by Applicant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-N Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2026-05-11 23:18:07.000','999','2026-05-11 23:18:07.000','In Process','Form-N Re-Submission(Modified Application)',1,0,'sysadmin','2026-05-11 23:18:07.000','sysadmin','2026-05-11 23:18:07.000'),(18303,440056,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-12 09:57:02.000',3728,'AdCNo00532026','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Adjudicating Officer','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-12 09:57:02.935','','2026-05-12 09:57:02.935','','Complaint File is OK. Fee and Format Checked. Hard Copy of the Complaint received. The Complainant alleged violation as regards non completion of project by Respondent and has sought primary relief of Compensation along with other reliefs. Accordingly, present Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further Orders please.',1,0,'DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-12 09:57:02.000','DyDirectorLegal','2026-05-12 09:57:02.000'),(18304,440059,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-12 10:35:12.000',3648,'AdCNo01502025UR','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent to Respondent','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2026-05-12 10:35:12.846','','2026-05-12 10:35:12.846','','Notice to Respondent/s to appear in person or through his authorized representative on 12.06.2026 and to file reply within 15 days of receipt of notice with an advance copy to the complainant.',1,0,'OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-12 10:35:12.000','OSlegal2.rera','2026-05-12 10:35:12.000');
